n ezafágoró goró.','Add a start or end date (or both) to impose time constraints on ticket availability. Leave either blank for no upper/lower limit.'=>'Ticket moujut hoar somoy hodd laganir lagi shuru yá sesh tarík (yá duitta) dió. Uppor/tole hodd na lagile duitta khali rakkó.','Add a tax rate to your ticket prices (entering 10 will add 10% to the ticket price).'=>'Tuáñr ticket price-t ekta tax rate ezafágoró goró (10 dile ticket price-t 10% ezafágoró hoibo).','Add any of these columns to an events file. A row with none of them filled in is a single event.'=>'Ei column ókkol-ór jé-kunó ekta ivent file-ót jog goró. Ekhane kunó-ó nai ói row ekta ekbocon ivent.','Add br tags to HTML emails?'=>'HTML email-ot br tag ezafágoribo?','Add location'=>'Jaga ezafágoró','Add new ticket'=>'Noya Ticket Ezafágoró','Add or remove %s'=>'%s ezafágoró yá larifélo','Add or remove events'=>'Ivent ezafágoró yá larifélo','Add tax to ticket price?'=>'Ticket price-t tax ezafágoró goribó?','Add to your table from the columns below.'=>'Nise\'r thúni ókkol thóni tuáñr thebíl\'ót ezafágoró.','Add-ons'=>'Add-on ókkol','Add-ons and prices are up to date.'=>'Add-on ókkol aro dam up to date asé.','Add-ons are separate plugins that work with the free Events Manager plugin, so you do not need Events Manager Pro to use them.'=>'Add-on ókkol Events Manager muft plugin-ór logé kam gora alada plugin, ehonná ói use goribo Events Manager Pro lagé nai.','Additional CSS'=>'Additional CSS','Address'=>'Thíkana','Address line 2'=>'Thíkana line 2','Address only'=>'Khali thíkana','Address:'=>'Thíkana:','Adds a checkbox below the location options that limits results to events attendees can join virtually, including hybrid events.'=>'Jaga option-ór nisé ekta checkbox jog goré, jéta result-ré hybrid ivent shomet attendee ókkol virtual-ót join gorte paré ói ivent-ót sima goré.','Adds a guest-accessible withdrawal flow and, optionally, a site-wide footer link.'=>'Ekkún guest estemal gorité fáre emon withdrawal flow aa