lso include events and locations where they are the author.'=>'Nise-or beggún option ítá estemalgoróya-r nízor personal data caóar belá submit kora yá collect kora data-or shaithe zuri, ítát zé Ivent ar Jaga-or ózi lekóya thaké ítá dhukibó.','All our sold add-ons'=>'Amar bikri hoa sob add-on','All regions text'=>'Beggún region ókkol\'r HTML Leká','All settings, events and bookings for every site on this network will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'Ei network\'or sob sáith\'or sob séthín, ivent ar booking sorai sorai haçifélano hoibo. Eita abbar fisé ana jaibo na.','All states text'=>'Beggún state ókkol\'r HTML Leká','All towns/cities text'=>'Beggún shohor/gaon ókkol\'r HTML Leká','All translations of this event will be detached from the recurring event.'=>'Ei Ivent\'or beggún torjuma bar bar hoba Ivent óttu alada hoibo.','All your settings and events will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'Tuañr sob séthín ar ivent sorai sorai haçifélano hoibo. Eita abbar fisé ana jaibo na.','All your settings, including email templates and template formats for Events Manager will be deleted.'=>'Tuañr sob séthín, Events Manager\'or email template ar template cokól sôho, haçifélano hoibo.','Allow %s to appear in the built-in search results.'=>'Built-in tua falaphol\'ót %s dekha zaiba dió.','Allow Maybe?'=>'Maybe ózazot dibó?','Allow Multiple Uploads'=>'Boho Upload Ejazot Dé','Allow RSVP Actions'=>'RSVP Ékcen Ókkol Ózazot Dó','Allow WordPress post-style archives.'=>'WordPress poigam-style arkaiv anumoti dió.','Allow anonymous event submissions?'=>'Namsára Ivent zomá anumoti dibá?','Allow bookings with registered emails?'=>'Registered email dia booking ózazot dibó?','Allow double bookings?'=>'Double booking ózazot dibó?','Allow format shortcode parameters?'=>'Format shortcode parameter ókkol ózazot dibó?','Allow guest bookings?'=>'Guest booking ózazot dibó?','Allow overbooking when approving?'=>'Approve gorar somoy overbooking ózazot dibó?','Allow subsites to create their own'=>'Subsite ókkolke nizor banaite dó','Allow users to respond with a \'Maybe\' status rather than Attending or Not Attending'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkolke Attending yá Not Attending-or bodole \'Maybe\' hásiyot dia jobab dibar ózazot dó','Allowed Extensions'=>'Ejazot Diya Extension ókkol','Already Booked'=>'Agót Booking Hoiyé','Already attending'=>'Ageyi attend gorot asé','Already booked'=>'Ageyi booking kora hoi gesé','Already have a license? Download the plugin from %s, upload it under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'Aggé license asé? %s-tún plugin download goró, Plugins > Add New Plugin-ót upload goró, aro tar settings-tún apnar license activate goró.','Already migrated: %s'=>'Aggé migrate hoiyé: %s','Also, the following will occur:'=>'Aar, nise\'r ókkol hóibo:','Always check the latest stable version?'=>'Sob somoy taza stable varcén check goribó?','Always show and ask for consent'=>'Orté dekhaió ar consent cáió','An email will be sent to an administrator of your choice when an event is published by users who are not administrators.'=>'Administrator no hoya estemalgoróya Ivent publish goróle tuáñr basa administrator\'ke B-ciñçí fatóya zaibo.','An email will be sent to the event contact if someone cancels their booking.'=>'Honíkka booking kenselgoróle Ivent\'r contact\'ke B-ciñçí fatóya zaibo.','An email will be sent to the event owner when their event is approved. Users requiring event approval do not have the <code>publish_events</code> capability.'=>'Ivent approved hoile Ivent owner\'ke B-ciñçí fatóya zaibo. Zei estemalgoróya\'r Ivent approval lage, tár <code>publish_events</code> capability nai.','An email will be sent to your administrator emails when an event is submitted and pending approval.'=>'Ivent submit hoi pending approval thakile tuáñr administrator B-ciñçi ókkolke B-ciñçí fatóya zaibo.','An error has occurred, not all sites were upgraded successfully.'=>'Error hoise, beggún sáith bhalo kore upgrade hoí nái.','An error occurred.'=>'Ekkún error hoijjé.','An event with no bookings.'=>'Booking ná thaka ekta ivent.','An event with this name and start is already on this site (event %d).'=>'Ei nam aro suru-r ekta ivent ei site-ót ágéi asé (ivent %d).','An import is running. Wait for it to finish, or pause it first.'=>'Ekta import chaliyé. Sesh hoa porjonto opekkha goró, ba ágé pause goró.','An organizer with this name is already on this site.'=>'Ei nam-ór ekjon organizer ei site-ót ágéi asé.','And much more'=>'Aro onek kichu','Anonymous Submitter Info'=>'Namsára Jomá Goróya\'r Khobor','Anonymous event submissions'=>'Namsára Ivent zomá','Anonymous submitters cannot see or modify their event once submitted. You can customize the success message they see here.'=>'Namsára zomá dayok Ivent zomá dile ar dekhíte yá sóiyi koríte paré na. Zeta sofolota message dekhe tá etháne háaic mozin séthgoró paró.','Another request is already updating this online location.'=>'Aro ekta request ágéi ei online jaga update gorer.','Any Type'=>'Kunu Kisím','Appears as the first default search option.'=>'Prothom asási tua option hisabe dekhay.','Appears as the label for this search option.'=>'Ei tua option\'r label hisabe dekhay.','Appears on the text search filter above the categories list.'=>'Kisím óll liís\'r uporór HTML Leká tua filter\'ot dekhay.','Appears on the text search filter above the tags list.'=>'Hót óll liís\'r uporór HTML Leká tua filter\'ot dekhay.','Appears within the input box.'=>'Input box\'r bitorot dekhay.','Apply global capabilities?'=>'Global kabiliát apply koribo?','Approval Required?'=>'Approval Dorkar?','Approve'=>'Approve goró','Approved'=>'Approved','Archetype'=>'Árkitaip','Archetypes UI Builder'=>'Archetype UI Builder','Are current events past events?'=>'Cholmán Ivent kí aagot Ivent?','Are you sure you want to cancel your booking?'=>'Tuáñr booking kenselgoibar lagi nicit?','Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'Tuñí pakka cólibó cái?','Are you sure you want to convert all repeating events into recurring events?'=>'Tuí ki nischit sob repeating ivent\'ré recurring ivent-ot convert kori saós?','Are you sure you want to convert this repeating event?'=>'Tuñí pakka ei bar bar hoba ivent bodolo gorité cái?','Are you sure you want to delete all recurrences of this event?'=>'Tuñí pakka ei ivent\'r beggún bar bar hoa haçifélité cái?','Are you sure you want to delete this archetype? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Tumi ki nicchit ei archetype haçifélo gorit cao? Ei kaj ager moto kora zaibo na.','Are you sure you want to delete this file? It will be deleted upon submission.'=>'Tuñí pakka ei fail haçifélité cái? Jomá dewa\'r somoi eita haçifélo hóibo.','Are you sure you want to delete this item? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Tuñí pakka ei item haçifélité cái? Eita fisór kiré fáribó ná.','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket?'=>'Tuñí pakka ei ticket haçifélité cái?','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket? All bookings related to this ticket will be deleted once you save this %s.'=>'Tuñí pakka ei ticket haçifélité cái? Ei %s bórieró\'r fisé ei ticket\'r beggún booking haçifélo hóibo.','Are you sure you want to delete?'=>'Tuñí pakka haçifélité cái?','Are you sure you want to delete? This action cannot be undone.'=>'Tuñí pakka haçifélité cái? Eita fisór kiré fáribó ná.','Are you sure you want to detach this event? By doing so, this event will be independent of the recurring set of events.'=>'Tuñí pakka ei ivent detach gorité cái? Eita goriló, ei ivent bar bar hoba ivent set\'r thóni swadhin hóibo.','Are you sure you want to disable bookings? If you do this and save, you will lose all previous bookings. If you wish to prevent further bookings, reduce the number of spaces available to the amount of bookings you currently have'=>'Tuñí pakka booking disable gorité cái? Eita goria bórieróle, tuáñr agor beggún booking harai zaibó. Zodi aar booking bondo gorité cao, bortoman booking\'r goner somán jaga kom goró','Are you sure you want to proceed? We recommend you back up your database first, just in case!'=>'Tumi ki nicchit aguwa zaibó? Amra sarámorso dói age tuáñr database backup gori rakó, zodi kiccu bhul hoy!','Are you sure you want to reset Events Manager?'=>'Tuí ki nischit Events Manager reset koribar cáós?','Are you sure you want to uninstall Events Manager?'=>'Tuí ki nischit Events Manager uninstall koribar cáós?','As a site admin, you see all group events, users will only be able to choose groups they are admins of.'=>'Sáith Sóoñloya hisabe tuí beggún gróp Ivent soó, Estemalgoróya ókkol khali zei gróp-ór admin ouddá basíle fare.','Ascending'=>'Bairano','Aside from pages we automatically generate and include certain jQuery files, if you are using Widgets, Shortcode or PHP to display specific items you may need to tell us where you are using them for them to work properly. Below are options for you to include specific jQuery dependencies only on certain pages.'=>'Amra automatic baniya kora sófa ualawa certain jQuery file dhalo, Widget, Shortcode yá PHP diya bishesh jiníc dekhaile ei ókkol thik moton kam koríbar lagi kot estemal koríso amak jana dorkar oiba paré. Níce kheli kheli sófa\'ót khali bishesh jQuery dependency dhaló koríbar opshon asé.','Attachment ID not found.'=>'Attachment ID pawa zai nái.','Attendee %d'=>'Attendee %d','Attendee %s'=>'Attendee %s','Attendee (Per Space Booked)'=>'Attendee (Hór Booking Goróya Jagaot)','Attendee names, answers to attendee fields and check-in status are copied and kept with each ticket. Without Events Manager Pro they are not shown, so you will see each booking, its tickets and the person who booked. If you add Events Manager Pro later, run the migration again to set up its attendee forms and check-ins.'=>'Attendee-ór nam, attendee field-ór jobab aro check-in hásiyot prottek ticket-ór logé copy hoi aro rakha hoi. Events Manager Pro na thakle ókkol dekha jai nai, tai apni prottek booking, tar ticket ókkol aro booking gora manushta dekhibo. Apni pisé Events Manager Pro zuro goile, tar attendee form aro check-in set up goribar lagi migration abar chalaw.','Attendees'=>'Attendee ókkol','Attending'=>'Hájir Hoba','Attributes'=>'Gun ókkol','AutoTLS'=>'AutoTLS','Avail. Spaces'=>'Moujut Jaga','Availability'=>'Pawa zaya','Available'=>'Moujut Asé','Available Archetypes'=>'Moujut Asé Archetype Ókkol','Available Spaces'=>'Moujut Jaga','Available for'=>'Moujut','Available from'=>'Eddín óttu moujut','Available spaces'=>'Moujut Jaga','Available until'=>'Eddín fojjon moujut','Average Sale'=>'Orsoto Bikri','Average Ticket'=>'Orsoto Ticket','Awaiting Online Payment'=>'Online Payment Aguwa','Awaiting Payment'=>'Payment Aguwa','Bar Graph'=>'Bar Graf','Base Event Settings'=>'Base Ivent Séthín Ókkol','Base Location Settings'=>'Base Jaga Séthín Ókkol','Base font size'=>'Base lekár maf','Base font weight'=>'Base lekár weight','Base line height'=>'Base line usol','Basic HTML is allowed in ticket labels and descriptions.'=>'Ticket-ór leká ar tofsil-ót basic HTML dewa zae.','Basic Only'=>'Khali Basic','Be aware that some themes will not work with this option, if so (or you want to make your own changes), you can create a file named <code>single-%s.php</code> <a href=\'#\'>as shown on the WordPress codex</a>, and leave this set to Posts.'=>'Khetal rakó, kunu kunu tehm ei opshon\'ór sáthe kam koríba na, oíle (yá tuáñr nijor bodol cáile) <a href=\'#\'>WordPress codex\'ót dekhano moton</a> <code>single-%s.php</code> nam\'ór ek file baniya Poigam óll basílo rakhía paró.','Before'=>'Age','Before you save your changes, you can quickly send yourself a test email by clicking this button.'=>'Tuañr séthín bórieróibar agé, ei button-ót click kori tuí taratari nijor\'ré ekta test email fatai dibar fare.','Below are translations for your location address. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'Nice tuáñr Jaga thíkana\'r torjuma. Khali rakhile mul Ivent\'or bhasa estemal hoibo.','Below are translations for your tickets. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'Nice tuáñr Ticket\'or torjuma. Khali rakhile mul Ivent\'or bhasa estemal hoibo.','Below you will find texts that will be displayed to users in various areas during the bookings process, particularly on booking forms.'=>'Niceo leká ókkol pabo zegula booking process-or somoy, bisesh kori booking form-t, estemalgoróya ókkolke dekhano hoibo.','Between %1$d and %2$d.'=>'%1$d aro %2$d-ór moddhe.','Block Editor (Gutenberg)'=>'Block Edhithar (Gutenberg)','Block Editor development is still ongoing, switch back to the Classic Editor if you experience issues.'=>'Block Edhithar\'ór unnoyon ekhono sólé, somossa oíle Classic Edhithar\'ót fisé zaó.','Block editor layout'=>'Block edhithar layout','Blog Default Timezone'=>'Bologsáith Asási Timezone','Body Classes'=>'Body Class óll','Book Now'=>'Ekhon Booking Goró','Book Now!'=>'Ekhon Booking Goró!','Booked'=>'Booking hoiyé','Booked Spaces'=>'Booked Jaga','Booked User Emails'=>'Booking goróya Estemalgoróya\'r B-ciñçí Ókkol','Booked/Available'=>'Booked/Moujut Asé','Booking'=>'Booking','Booking %s'=>'Booking %s','Booking %s.'=>'Booking %s.','Booking Actions'=>'Booking Ékcen Ókkol','Booking Cancellation Warning'=>'Booking Kenselgoró Warning','Booking Cancelled'=>'Booking Kenselgoró hoiyé','Booking Chart'=>'Booking Cart','Booking Comment'=>'Booking\'r Rai','Booking Confirmation'=>'Booking Confirmation','Booking Confirmed'=>'Booking Confirm hoiyé','Booking Cut-Off Date'=>'Booking Bondor Tarík','Booking Data'=>'Booking or Data','Booking Date'=>'Booking Tarík','Booking Details'=>'Booking\'r Tofsil','Booking Email Templates'=>'Booking B-ciñçí Nomuna ókkol','Booking Form'=>'Booking Form','Booking ID'=>'Booking ID','Booking ID.'=>'Booking ID.','Booking Intent'=>'Booking Intent','Booking Management Pages'=>'Booking Management Sófa óll','Booking Meta'=>'Booking or Uorór','Booking Notes'=>'Booking Nuth óll','Booking Pending'=>'Booking Bakí asé','Booking RSVP'=>'Booking-or