\'r subject','Booking reference'=>'Booking-ór reference','Booking rejected email'=>'Booking rejected B-ciñçí','Booking rejected email subject'=>'Booking rejected B-ciñçí\'r subject','Booking status could not be changed.'=>'Booking hásiyot bodolaí parlam na.','Booking status is invalid.'=>'Booking hásiyot valid nai.','Booking successful, pending confirmation (you will also receive an email once confirmed).'=>'Booking hoiyé, confirmation\'or aguwa (confirm hoile añí B-ciñçí paibó).','Booking successful.'=>'Booking hoiyé.','Booking summary default text'=>'Booking summary asási leká','Booking...'=>'Booking hoitaise...','Bookings'=>'Booking','Bookings %s. Mails Sent.'=>'Booking %s. Mail fathano hoijjé.','Bookings Consent Error'=>'Booking Consent Error','Bookings Forms'=>'Booking Form','Bookings Stats'=>'Booking Stats','Bookings Table Settings'=>'Booking Thebíl Séthín Ókkol','Bookings View'=>'Booking Soó','Bookings are closed for this event.'=>'Ei Ivent\'or lagi booking bon hoiyé.','Bookings are disabled in Events Manager. Migrating tickets turns them on.'=>'Events Manager-ót Booking bondo asé. Ticket migrate gorile ói chalu hoibo.','Bookings closed'=>'Booking bondho','Bookings data'=>'Booking-ór data','Bookings disabled'=>'Booking bongoró','Bookings for %s'=>'%s-ór Booking','Bookings have closed (e.g. event has started).'=>'Booking bondho hoi gesé (zemon ivent shuru hoi gesé).','Bookings that are uncancelled are returned to their previous state (if available), the %1$s PHP constant value or if previous options are not available then pending/approved according to your booking approval settings.'=>'Uncancel hoa booking ókkol ager hásiyot-t (zodi thake), %1$s PHP constant-or maan-t, yá ager optión na thakile tuáñr booking approval séthín onujayi pending/approved hásiyot-t fisé zai.','Bookings to individual %s recurrences will be preserved unless you delete tickets or choose to reschedule and delete rescheduled recurrences.'=>'Alada %s bar bar hoa\'r booking ókkol rakha hóibo, zodi tuñí ticket haçifélo nó gorór yá reschedule goria reschedule hoya bar bar hoa haçifélo nó gorór.','Bookings to individual event recurrences will be preserved if event times and ticket settings are not modified.'=>'Zodi ivent\'r somoy aar ticket\'r séthín bodolo nó hoi, alada ivent bar bar hoa\'r booking ókkol rakha hóibo.','Bookings will be automatically cancelled.'=>'Booking ókkol ótomatik kenselgoróya hóibo.','Bookings will not be confirmed until the event administrator approves it.'=>'Ivent administrator approve na gorle booking confirm hoibo na.','Bookings/Registration'=>'Booking/Registration','Buffer'=>'Buffer','Bulk Actions'=>'Bulk Ékcen ókkol','Bulk actions'=>'Bulk ékcen','Button & page labels'=>'Button & sófa label ókkol','Buy %s'=>'%s kinó','Buy on Woo.com'=>'Woo.com-ót kinó','By default, event spaces become unavailable once there are enough CONFIRMED bookings. To reserve spaces even if unapproved, choose yes.'=>'Asási bhabe, jothesto CONFIRMED booking hoile ivent jaga ókkol pawa zai na. Approve na hoileo jaga reserve gorit ói basílo goró.','By default, events that have an end date later than today will be included in searches, set this to yes to consider events that started \'yesterday\' as past.'=>'Asási hisabe aajkar poré sesh tarík oya Ivent tua\'ót dhaló oiba, \'gotkal\' súru oya Ivent aagot dhoribar lagi Ói basílo koró.','By default, if a calendar day only has one event, it display a single event when clicking on the link of that calendar date. If you select Yes here, you will get always see a list of events.'=>'Asási hisabe, kelendhar\'r kuno din\'ot kebol eke Ivent thakile, oi tarík\'r rabeta click goróle eke Ivent dekhay. Ikkane Ói basílo goróle shodai Ivent\'r liís dekhibo.','By default, if a guest tries to book an event using the email of a user account on your site they will be asked to log in, selecting yes will bypass this security measure.'=>'Asási bhabe, zodi ekta guest tuáñr sáith-or ekta estemalgoróya account-or B-ciñçír Thíkana dia ivent booking gorit cay, tahake bútore gólo gorit koa hoibo, ói basílo gorle ei nirapotta ovitikkrom hoibo.','By default, when a booking is made by a user, this booking is tied to a user account, if the user is not registered nor logged in and guest bookings are enabled, an account will be created for them.'=>'Asási bhabe, estemalgoróya zokhon booking koré, ei booking ekta estemalgoróya account-or sathe zukto hoy, estemalgoróya registered yá bútore gólo na hole ar guest booking cálu thakile, tahar lagi ekta account banano hoibo.','By editing your primary recurrence set, you will change all subsequent default values of your other recurrences.'=>'Tuáñr asol bar bar hoa set sóiyigoriló, tuáñr aar bar bar hoa\'r fisór beggún asási mullo bodol hoi zaibó.','By using formats, you can control how your %s are displayed from within the Events Manager <a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>Formatting</a> tab above without having to edit your theme files.'=>'Cokól ókklo estemal koría tuáñr tehm file sóiyi na koria uporot Events Manager <a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>Cokól</a> tab óttu tuáñr %s kemone dekhaya zaiba tá niyontron koría paró.','CPT'=>'CPT','CPT (Plural)'=>'CPT (Bohubocon)','CPT (Single)'=>'CPT (Ekbocon)','CPT name (plural) must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'CPT nam (bohubocon)-t khali choto hórof, number ar underscore thakibo.','CPT name must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'CPT nam-t khali choto hórof, number ar underscore thakibo.','CPTs'=>'CPT ókkol','CSS File'=>'CSS Fail','CSS box'=>'CSS bóks','CSV file'=>'CSV Fáil','CSV file does not appear to contain valid data.'=>'CSV failot thík data ase mone hoyé na.','Calendar'=>'Kelendhar','Calendar Day Event List Settings'=>'Kelendhar Din Ivent Liís Séthín Ókkol','Calendar Selection'=>'Kelendhar Basílo','Calendar Size'=>'Kelendhar-ór Maf','Calendar events/day limit'=>'Kelendhar Ivent/din limit','Calendar settings'=>'Kelendhar séthín ókkol','Calendar size'=>'Kelendhar-ór Maf','Call get-booking-requirements with this event\'s ID for the exact required fields, their payload locations (attendee fields go under em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee), and a ready-to-submit example.'=>'Thik dorkari field, ítár payload jaga (attendee field óll em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee-t zaibo) ar toiyar example-or lagi ei Ivent-or ID diye get-booking-requirements call goroó.','Calling em_get_option() too early whilst EM\\Archetypes class is not available.'=>'EM\\Archetypes class moujut nai thakibar belá em_get_option() beci aggún dakré.','Can attendees change their RSVP status? You can choose whether they can uncancel an RSVP below as well.'=>'Attendee ókkol ki tahar RSVP hásiyot bodolo gorit pare? Niceo tumi basílo gorit paro tara RSVP uncancel gorit paribo ki na.','Can be in form of pixels or a percentage such as %s or %s.'=>'Pixel yá %s yá %s\'r moton sotkora hisabe oya paré.','Can users cancel their booking?'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkol ki tahar booking kenselgoró gorit pare?','Can users uncancel their booking?'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkol ki tahar booking uncancel gorit pare?','Cancel'=>'Kenselgoró','Cancel Ticket Recreation'=>'Ticket Noya Banani Kenselgoró','Cancel all confirmed and pending bookings automatically.'=>'Beggún confirmed ar pending Booking ojoibo kenselgoró.','Cancel bookings?'=>'Booking kenselgoríba?','Cancelation complete'=>'Kenselgoró sheś','Cancelation error'=>'Kenselgoró error','Cancelation in progress'=>'Kenselgoró cólot asé','Canceling...'=>'Kenselgoré...','Cancellation'=>'Kenselgoró','Cancellation Actions'=>'Kenselgoró Ékcen ókkol','Cancellations'=>'Kenselgoró Ókkol','Cancellations are not permitted for this booking.'=>'Ei booking kenselgoron dilé na.','Cancelled'=>'Kenselgoró hoiyé','Cancelled event email'=>'Cancelled Ivent\'r B-ciñçí','Cannot create a Archetype CPT name %s, this must be at most 20 characters long, containing letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Archetype CPT nam %s banaí parlam na, ítá beshi hole 20 akkhor-or hoóa lagibo, khali ókkhor, shonkha, dash ar underscore thaki parró.','Canvas tabs'=>'Canvas tab óll','Categories'=>'Kisím óll','Categories dropdown label'=>'Kisím óll dropdown label','Categories list page'=>'Kisím liís sófa','Category'=>'Kisím','Category IDs'=>'Kisím ID ókkol','Category Related Placeholders'=>'Kisím Sombondhíya Placeholder ókkol','Category pages'=>'Kisím sófa óll','Category:'=>'Kisím:','Change'=>'Bodolo','Changed timeslots get %s'=>'Bodolano timeslot ókkol %s foibó','Changes a booking status, such as approving, rejecting, or cancelling it.'=>'Booking-or hásiyot bodole, zemon approve, reject yá cancel gorá.','Changes saved'=>'Change bórieragiyé','Changes saved.'=>'Tobdil ókkol bórieragiyé.','Changing the location of this event will delete its %s meeting or broadcast, and anyone holding the old link will no longer be able to join.'=>'Ei ivent-ór jaga bodlaile tar %s meeting ba broadcast haçifélagiyé, aro puráná link ja-r kasé asé hé aro join gorte paribo nai.','Chart Options'=>'Chart Option ókkol','Chart Type'=>'Chart Kisím','Check Dev Versions'=>'Dev Varcén Ókkol Check Goró','Check attendees in at the door by scanning tickets, manage events and bookings, and follow booking and sales status from your phone. Available on the App Store for iPhone and iPad. Included with Pro Plus, or available by subscription for any Events Manager site.'=>'Ticket scan goré dorjat attendee-ré check-in goró, ivent aro booking manage goró, aro apnar fon-tún booking aro bikri-r hásiyot soó. iPhone aro iPad-ór lagi App Store-ót paó. Pro Plus-ót shamil, ba je-kunó Events Manager site-ór lagi subscription-ót paó.','Check this option if you want the event contact to receive an email when someone books places. An email will be sent when a booking is first made (regardless if confirmed or pending)'=>'Zodi Ivent\'r contact\'ke Space booking hoile B-ciñçí fatáibar cao, oi option basílo goró. Booking prothom goróle (confirmed yá pending zei oukk) B-ciñçí fatóya zaibo','Check this option if you want to prevent the WordPress registration email from going out when a user anonymously books an event.'=>'Kuno estemalgoróya anonymous-ve Ivent booking goróle WordPress registration B-ciñçí zaa no cái leo, oi option basílo goró.','Check this option to enable Google Map integration.'=>'Google Map integration enable koríte ei opshon chek koró.','Checking for dev versions.'=>'Dev varcén dékré.','Checking for the latest stable version.'=>'Taza stable varcén dékré.','Checking...'=>'Check kori asi...','Checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release, skipping the staggered rollout delay (which can take up to 24 hours). Any newer stable version will appear on your Plugins or Updates page for a manual update.'=>'Staggered rollout-or deri (24 góndha porzonto lagi zai) na aguwa soriasori WordPress.org-t taza stable relis check goró. Noya stable varcén tuáñr Plugins yá Updates sófat hat dhori kiórzana-r lagi dekha zaibo.','Choose a color for your %s. You can access this using the %s placeholder.'=>'Tuáñr %s\'r lagi ekkún rong basílo goró. Tuñí %s placeholder dia eita estemal gorité fáro.','Choose a settings file saved from a backup or another Events Manager installation and click the \'%s\' button.'=>'Backup yá onno Events Manager installation-ot theke bórieragiyé séthín file basílo goro ar \'%s\' button-t click goró.','Choose an image for your %s, which can be displayed using the %s placeholder.'=>'Tuáñr %s\'r lagi ekkún fothú basílo goró, zeita %s placeholder dia dehá zaite fáre.','Choose another file'=>'Aro file basó','Choose from most used %s'=>'Beci estemal hoba %s tára basílo goró','Choose from most used event categories'=>'Beci estemal hoa Ivent kisím óll tún bacói lo','Choose from most used event tags'=>'Beci estemal hoa Ivent hót óll tún bacói lo','Choose graph type and stacking view options. Some views and stacking may not be available for all setting combinations.'=>'Graph kisím ar stack soóibor option basílo. Kunu kunu soó ar stack hob séthín mélar sob bar\'ot na thakibar fare.','Choose how prices are displayed. <code>@</code> will be replaced by the currency symbol, and <code>#</code> will be replaced by the number.'=>'Price kemone dekha zaibo basílo goró. <code>@</code> currency symbol dia, ar <code>#</code> number dia bodolano hoibo.','Choose how timeslots are listed in booking forms for recurring events and events with multiple timeslots.'=>'Bar bar hoba ivent ar ekadhik timeslot-or ivent ókkolor lagi booking form-t timeslot ókkol kemone list hoibo basílo goró.','Choose how to format your group heading dates. Leave blank for default.'=>'Group matá\'r tarík ókkol\'r cokól kenre hoibo basílo goró. Asási\'r lagi fáka rakó.','Choose how to format your group headings.'=>'Group matá ókkol\'r cokól kenre hoibo basílo goró.','Choose how to show a information about an event when clicking or hovering over a single event on the calendar.'=>'Kelendhar\'ot eke Ivent click yá hover goróle Ivent\'r baabote tothyo kenre dekhaibo basílo goró.','Choose the start date for comparing equivalent date ranges. The latest comparison end date is day before main duration start date.'=>'Tulonar lagi suru\'r tarík basílo. Sesh tulona tarík hoilo mul somoyór suru\'r agór din.','Choose to show events within a specific time range.'=>'Nirdisto wokt moidan\'r Ivent dekhaibar basílo goró.','Choose what to show users on their booking management page.'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkolke tahar booking manage gorar sófat ki dekhaibó basílo goró.','Choose whether or not to display a login form in the booking form area to remind your members to log in before booking.'=>'Tuáñr member ókkolke booking gorar age bútore gólo gorar kotha mone korai dibar lagi booking form ilakat ekta bútore gólo form dekhaibó ki na basílo goró.','Choose whether to display the main search bar. If disabled, advanced search fields will be shown in \'Inline\' mode automatically. You must also choose to enable at least one advanced search field, to avoid having an emtpy search form.'=>'Main tua bar dekhaibo kina basílo goró. Disable thakile torkigoijjá tua field ókkol automatic \'Inline\' mode\'ot dekhaibo. Fáka tua form nohoibar lagi kombe eke torkigoijjá tua field enable goróno lagibo.','Choose whether to show a preview of the upcoming events for the date clicked on, or directly link to the calendar day.'=>'Click goróya tarík\'r ainewala Ivent ókkol\'r agorisoó dekhaibo yá sidha kelendhar din\'ot rabeta dhalibo, basílo goró.','Choose which %s account hosts this event.'=>'Kón %s account-ót ei ivent host hoibo basó.','Choose which order your tickets appear.'=>'Tuáñr ticket ókkol kon order-t dekha zaibo basílo goró.','Choose your currency for displaying event pricing.'=>'Ivent pricing dekhanor lagi tuáñr currency basílo goró.','Choose/Upload Image'=>'Fothú Basílo/Uoretuló','City'=>'Shohor','City/Town'=>'Shohor/Gaon','City/Town:'=>'Sór/Gáo:','Classic Editor'=>'Classic Edhithar','Clear All'=>'Beggún Sáf','Click the button below to mass-convert all your repeating events into recurring events.'=>'Tuáñr sob repeating ivent bar bar hoba ivent-t mass-convert gorar lagi niceor button-t click goró.','Click to toggle'=>'Toggle goribar lagi click goró','Clicking these buttons will not have any effect until you save your settings!'=>'Tuáñr séthín no bórielé ei button ókkol click goróle kuno kaam no hoibo!','Close Ticket Editor'=>'Ticket Edhithar Bongoró','Collapse All'=>'Beggún Nisefor','Color'=>'Rong','Column %d'=>'Kolam %d','Column in the file'=>'File-ór column','Columns for repeating events'=>'Bar bar hoba ivent-ór lagi column ókkol','Columns to choose'=>'Basílor thúni óll','Columns to export'=>'Export gorór thúni óll','Columns to show'=>'Dehá\'r thúni óll','Comma-separated address(es) notified of each withdrawal for manual review. Leave blank to use the site admin email.'=>'Hór withdrawal\'r kotha hata nozor\'r lagi comma dia alada thikana notify hoibo. Sáith admin email estemal gorór lagi fáka rakho.','Comma-separated list of allowed file extensions: %s. Leave blank to allow any.'=>'Ejazot dia fail extension\'or comma-separated list: %s. Kunuta ejazot dibar lagi khali rakhó.','Comment'=>'Rai','Communications Consent'=>'Zogazog Consent','Compare With'=>'Lógot Tulona','Compare features'=>'Feature milaó','Compared to'=>'Lógot tulona','Configure the base settings for your events. These settings affect how events are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'Tuáñr ivent ókkolor lagi base séthín ókkol thik goró. Ei séthín ókkol ivent ókkol database-t kemone rakha zai ar pawa zai ou ere asor pore.','Configure the base settings for your locations. These settings affect how locations are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'Tuáñr jaga ókkolor lagi base séthín ókkol thik goró. Ei séthín ókkol jaga ókkol database-t kemone rakha zai ar pawa zai ou ere asor pore.','Confirm'=>'Confirm goro','Confirm button'=>'Confirm or button','Confirmation email could not be sent to admin. Registrant should have gotten their email (only admin see this warning).'=>'Admin\'ót confirmation email fathano nágelo. Registrant\'e tár email fáiyé hóibo (khali admin\'e ei sotorkota dehé).','Confirmations'=>'Confirmation Ókkol','Confirmed'=>'Confirmed','Confirmed Spaces'=>'Confirmed Jaga','Confirmed booking email'=>'Confirmed booking B-ciñçí','Congratulations! Your email settings work.'=>'Obhinondon! Tuañr email séthín kam kore.','Connect'=>'Connect goró','Connect Events Manager to MCP-compatible AI clients (Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT custom connectors, VS Code, Codex) by exposing Events Manager Abilities through the WordPress MCP Adapter. Clients authenticate through a one-click consent screen and a refreshable Application Password — no manual key juggling.'=>'WordPress MCP Adapter diye Events Manager Abilities dekhai Events Manager-ke MCP-compatible AI client (Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT custom connector, VS Code, Codex) shaithe connect goroó. Client ókkol ek-click consent screen ar refresh gorí parba Application Password diye authenticate gore, key manually sambhalar dorkar nái.','Connect a %s account in the Events Manager settings before using it as an event location.'=>'Ivent jaga hisabe use goribar ágé Events Manager settings-ót ekta %s account connect goró.','Connect an account'=>'Ekta account connect goró','Connect to import events and locations from %s.'=>'%s tuwa Ivent ar Jaga Baártugóla goríbar lagi Connect goró.','Consent'=>'Consent','Consent %s on %s'=>'Consent %s, %s-t','Consent Error'=>'Consent Error','Consent Text'=>'Consent HTML Leká','Consent previously %s on %s'=>'Consent agó %s, %s-t','Consented By Default'=>'Asási Consent','Contact a site administrator for your password.'=>'Húfiawaádh\'or lagi sáith sóoñloya\'r logé zogazog goró.','Content'=>'Hazorjiníc','Content supplied within shortcode tags and the %s parameters will be HTML entity-decoded and sanitized.'=>'Shortcode tag-or bitore dewa hazorjiníc ar %s parameter ókkol HTML entity-decode ar sanitize hoibo.','Content supplied within shortcode tags like %s will be HTML entity-decoded.'=>'%s moto shortcode tag-or bitore dewa hazorjiníc HTML entity-decode hoibo.','Control how subsites use Archetypes. Define network-wide types here and decide whether subsites can create, choose, or must use your list. You can also allow/deny renaming specific base settings.'=>'Subsite ókkol Archetype kemone estemal goribo ou control goró. Network-or lagi kisím ókkol ekhane thik goro ar subsite ókkol tuáñr list-t banaite, basílo gorit yá estemal gorit hoibo ou thik goró. Tumi khass base séthín ókkolor nam bodolano ózazot yá nishedh gorit paro.','Controls how many events being held at a location are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'%s\'r moton placeholder estemal\'ór somoy ek Jaga\'ót hoya Ivent pratek sófa\'ót koto dekha zaiba tá niyontron kore. Kunu sima na lagíle khali rakó.','Controls how many events belonging to a category are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'%s moto placeholder bebohar korle ek category-or Ivent ek sófa-t kotó dekha zaibo ítá thik goroó. Limit na dite khali rakhoó.','Controls how many events belonging to a tag are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'%s moto placeholder bebohar korle ek hót-or Ivent ek sófa-t kotó dekha zaibo ítá thik goroó. Limit na dite khali rakhoó.','Convert ALL Repeating Events'=>'SOB Repeating Ivent Convert Koro','Convert Recurring'=>'Bar Bar Hoba Bodolo','Convert and Deactivate Repeating Events'=>'Bar Bar Hoa Ivent Ókkol Convert Goro ar Bongoró','Coordinates'=>'Koordineit ókkol','Copies your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %s into Events Manager. Nothing in the original plugin is changed or deleted, so you can run this, check the result, and roll it back or run it again.'=>'Apnar ivent, venue, organizer, ticket aro attendee ókkol %s-tún Events Manager-ót copy goré. Asol plugin-ót kichu bodlai ba haçifélai nai, tai ei chalaiya result check gori, rollback ba aro ekbar chalate paro.','Copy default value'=>'Asási mulyo kopí goró','Copy over our new v6 formats to make the best of our new UI design!'=>'Amrar notun UI design-ór puro fayda lóibar lagi notun v6 format ókkol Copy goró!','Cost'=>'Kharsa','Could not check event validation. Saving without pre-check — please verify the event details.'=>'Ivent validation check gorité farí nai. Pre-check na kori Bórierér, doya kori Ivent-ór tofsil soó.','Could not open the PDF file for inspection.'=>'Dékibar lagi PDF fail khulón gelo na.','Could not open the file for inspection.'=>'Dékibar lagi fail khulón gelo na.','Could not read image size information.'=>'Fothúr maf\'ot khobor porón gelo na.','Count'=>'Gon','Country'=>'Desh','Coupons and discount codes'=>'Coupon aro discount code','Create %s'=>'%s bánáo','Create Zoom meetings and webinars from the event editor, and register attendees on Zoom when they book. With Pro, attendees are registered once they pay and receive their own join links.'=>'Ivent editor-tún Zoom meeting aro webinar banaó, aro attendee booking gorile Zoom-ót register goró. Pro-r logé attendee ókkol paisa dile register hoi aro nijor join link paí.','Create a location or start typing to search a previously created location.'=>'Jaga banaw yá agor banano Jaga tuibar lagi leká shuru goró.','Create booking'=>'Booking bonao','Create event'=>'Ivent bonao','Create event ticket'=>'Ivent ticket bonao','Create location'=>'Jaga bonao','Creates a ticket for an Events Manager event.'=>'Ek Events Manager Ivent-or lagi ticket bonae.','Creates an Events Manager %s.'=>'Ek Events Manager %s bonae.','Creates an Events Manager booking. Call get-booking-requirements first to get this event\'s required fields, payload locations, and an example payload.'=>'Ek Events Manager booking bonae. Ei Ivent-or lagbó field, payload-or jaga ar example payload anar lagi age get-booking-requirements call goroó.','Creates an Events Manager event.'=>'Ek Events Manager Ivent bonae.','Creates an Events Manager location.'=>'Ek Events Manager Jaga bonae.','Currency'=>'Mudra','Currency Format'=>'Currency Cokól','Currency code'=>'Mudra code','Currency position (prefix or suffix)'=>'Mudra-ór jaga (prefix ba suffix)','Currency symbol'=>'Mudra-ór symbol','Currently overridden by the EM_GUTENBERG constant in wp-config.php (%s).'=>'Ekhon wp-config.php\'ót EM_GUTENBERG constant\'ór dará overridden oi asé (%s).','Custom Dates'=>'Háaic mozin Tarík ókkol','Custom Link'=>'Nizér Rabeta','Custom Links'=>'Custom Link ókkol','Custom booking forms and individual attendee forms'=>'Custom booking form aro alada alada attendee form','Custom fields are the same as attributes, except you cannot restrict specific values, users can add any kind of custom field name/value pair. Only available in the WordPress admin area.'=>'Custom Field attribute\'ór moton, kintu kunu monir ekko 