nistrators. Once approved you will receive an automatic confirmation.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Priyo #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Añí #_EVENTNAME\'or lagi #_BOOKINGSPACES Jaga cai goijjó.<br/>Kon somoy : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Kote : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Tuáñr booking ekhon amar sóoñloya\'r manjuri\'r aguwa. Manjur hoile añí automatic confirmation paibó.<br/>Tuáñr biswasto,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have successfully reserved #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Priyo #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Añí #_EVENTNAME\'or lagi #_BOOKINGSPACES Jaga thík goijjó.<br/>Kon somoy : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Kote : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Tuáñr biswasto,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Priyo #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>#_EVENTDATES tarík #_EVENTNAME\'ot #_BOOKINGSPACES Jaga\'r lagi tuáñr cai goijjá booking kenselgoijjé.<br/>Tuáñr biswasto,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been rejected.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Priyo #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>#_EVENTDATES tarík #_EVENTNAME\'ot #_BOOKINGSPACES Jaga\'r lagi tuáñr cai goijjá booking bátil hoiyé.<br/>Tuáñr biswasto,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear %s'=>'Priyo %s','Dear Guest, <br/>We regret to inform you that #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'Priyo Mehman, <br/>Dukkhor logé zanaiyí, #_EVENTDATES tarík #_EVENTNAME kenselgoijjé.<br/>Tuáñr biswasto,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Decimal Point'=>'Dosmik Bindu','Decode shortcode content?'=>'Shortcode hazorjiníc decode goribó?','Decode shortcode format parameters?'=>'Shortcode format para