kol','Duplicate %s'=>'%s Kopí goró','Duplicate this event'=>'Ei Ivent duplicate goró','Duplicating Events and Locations has been disabled by Events Manager, to avoid breaking data. You can use our Events Manager duplication features instead.'=>'Data kharab na hoibar lagi Events Manager Ivent ar Jaga duplicate goróbar bon goijjé. Ittar bodole amar Events Manager duplicate fíca estemal goró.','Duration'=>'Somoy Lomba','During'=>'Bítore','E-mail'=>'B-ciñçí','E-mail: %s'=>'B-ciñçí: %s','ERROR : Email Not Sent.'=>'ERROR : B-ciñçí Pathaá Hoí Nái.','Each event can have its own timezone if enabled. If set to no, then all newly created events will have the blog timezone, which currently is set to %s'=>'Enable thakíle pratek Ivent\'ór nijor timezone thakíba paré. No hoíle noya baniyá beggún Ivent\'ór blog timezone hoiba, zéta ekhon %s thik kora asé','Earlier Dates'=>'Agór Tarík ókkol','Edit'=>'Sóiyigoró','Edit %s'=>'%s Sóiyigoró','Edit Booking'=>'Booking Sóiyigoró','Edit Details'=>'Details Sóiyigoró','Edit Event'=>'Ivent Sóiyigoró','Edit Event Category'=>'Ivent Kisím Sóiyigoró','Edit Event Tag'=>'Ivent Hót Sóiyigoró','Edit Location'=>'Jaga Sóiyigoró','Edit Recurring Event'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent Sóiyigoró','Edit Repeating Event'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent Sóiyigoró','Edit User'=>'Estemalgoróya Sóiyigoró','Edit events'=>'Ivent Sóiyigoró','Edit location'=>'Jaga sóiyigoró','Edit locations'=>'Jaga Sóiyigoró','Edit/View'=>'Sóiyigoró/Soó','Editor'=>'Edhithar','Email'=>'B-ciñçí','Email Address'=>'B-ciñçír Thíkana','Email Exists'=>'Email Ageyi Asé','Email Message'=>'B-ciñçí Message','Email Sent.'=>'B-ciñçí Pathaá Hoise.','Email Settings'=>'Email Séthín óll','Email Subject'=>'B-ciñçí Subject','Email address'=>'B-ciñçír Thíkana','Email event owner?'=>'Ivent owner-ke email goribó?','Email events admin?'=>'Ivent admin-ke email goribó?','Email not sent.'=>'Email fatá hoi nai.','Email sent successfully to %s'=>'Email %s-ot thikmoto fatá gesé','Email: %s'=>'B-ciñçí: %s','Emails'=>'Email ókkol','Emb