oking management for WordPress. Recurring events, locations, webinars, google maps, rss, ical, booking registration and more!'=>'WordPress-ot Ivent registration ar booking manejment. Bar bar hoba Ivent, Jaga, webinar, google maps, rss, ical, booking registration ar aro beshi!','Event resubmitted email'=>'Ivent resubmitted B-ciñçí','Event resubmitted subject'=>'Ivent resubmitted\'r subject','Event start date/time, location name'=>'Ivent shuru-ór tarík/somoy, Jaga-ór nam','Event style'=>'Ivent-ór Ecthail','Event submission notifications will be sent to emails added here.'=>'Ivent submission\'r notification oikkane zoga goijjá B-ciñçite fatóya zaibo.','Event submitted email'=>'Ivent submitted B-ciñçí','Event submitted subject'=>'Ivent submitted\'r subject','Event timezones for blog %s have been reset to %s.'=>'Blog %s-or ivent timezone %s-ot reset hoise.','Event timezones have been reset to %s.'=>'Ivent timezone %s-ot reset hoise.','Event timezones on all blogs have been reset to %s.'=>'Sob blog\'or ivent timezone %s-ot reset hoise.','Event title format'=>'Ivent lokób cokól','Event tooltip preview format'=>'Ivent tooltip agorisoó cokól','Event tooltips format'=>'Ivent tooltip cokól','Event website'=>'Ivent website','Event.'=>'Ivent.','Event/Location admin pages'=>'Ivent/Jaga admin sófa óll','Eventful Locations?'=>'Ivent asé Jaga?','Events'=>'Ivent','Events Calendar'=>'Ivent Kelendhar','Events Duration'=>'Ivent-ór Somoy Lomba','Events I\'m Attending'=>'Zé Ivent-t zaíbó','Events List'=>'Ivent Liís','Events Manager'=>'Events Manager','Events Manager - %s'=>'Events Manager - %s','Events Manager 5.9 introduced timezone functionality, which does not require certain fields in your database. To maintain backwards compatibility with earlier versions, these fields will still be created.'=>'Events Manager 5.9-t timezone functionality ánise, ítát tuáñr database-or kisu field lage na. Agó-or varcén-or shaithe compatibility rakhar lagi ei field óll tobu banano hóibo.','Events Manager 6 onwards has optional styling that maximizes consistency accross different themes. If you\'d like your theme to take over in some or all aspects of our plugin, you can disable our styling here.'=>'Events Manager 6 aagot opshon oya styling asé zeta alada alada tehm\'ót ekrokomota bazái. Tuáñr tehm plugin\'ór kunu kunu yá beggún ongso bárai loifélo cáile etháne amár styling disable koría paró.','Events Manager Add-ons'=>'Events Manager Add-on ókkol','Events Manager Bookings'=>'Events Manager Booking','Events Manager Data'=>'Events Manager Data','Events Manager Management'=>'Events Manager Management','Events Manager Pro'=>'Events Manager Pro','Events Manager Pro %s has received a major security update. Please <a href="%s">read our announcement</a> and log into your account for upgrade options.'=>'Events Manager Pro %s boró security update paiyé. <a href="%s">Amar ghoshona poró</a> ar upgrade option\'or lagi akaunt\'ot bútore gólo goró.','Events Manager Settings'=>'Events Manager Séthín ókkol','Events Manager Test Email'=>'Events Manager Test B-ciñçí','Events Manager app'=>'Events Manager Ép','Events Manager bookings'=>'Events Manager booking','Events Manager bookings linked to their WooCommerce orders (Events Manager for WooCommerce)'=>'WooCommerce order-ót lagi Events Manager booking (Events Manager for WooCommerce)','Events Manager can copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %1$s. Nothing in %1$s is changed, so you can check the result before switching it off.'=>'Events Manager apnar ivent, venue, organizer, ticket aro attendee ókkol %1$s-tún copy gorte pare. %1$s-ót kichu bodlai na, tai bondo goribar ágé result check gorte paro.','Events Manager can now show you the latest stable release as soon as it is published, we <b>strongly</b> recommend you do this. Enable this under %1$s. %2$s'=>'Events Manager ekhon baáirgoijjá taza stable release dahaite pare, añí <b>doróbhabé</b> ei kam goróbar cúaric goijjí. %1$s\'ot ei chalu goró. %2$s','Events Manager cannot be uninstalled from this site.'=>'Ei sáith\'ot Events Manager uninstall koribar fare na.','Events Manager for WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce\'r laiggi Events Manager','Events Manager found events from %s on this site and can copy them, with their venues, organizers, tickets and attendees.'=>'Events Manager ei site-ót %s-ór ivent peiyé aro tar venue, organizer, ticket aro attendee shomet copy gorte pare.','Events Manager has been maintained, developed and supported for free since it was released in 2008, positive reviews are one that help us keep going.'=>'Events Manager 2008 sal\'ót release hoar fór\'ot fíri\'ót rakhibar, banaibar ar support dibar hoyé, bála review amar\'ré cholté modot kore.','Events Manager has implemented multiple ways to help prevent or reduce these costs drastically, please check our %s page for more information.'=>'Events Manager ei khoroc rukibar yá boho kom goróbar lagi bohut rasta banaiyé, aro khobor\'or lagi %s sófa dékó.','Events Manager has introduced location types, which can include online locations such as a URL or integrations with webinar platforms such as Zoom! Enable different location types in your settings page, for more information see our %s.'=>'Events Manager Jaga\'r kisím ánaiyé, zeman URL yá Zoom\'or moto webinar platform\'or logé integration\'ot online Jaga. Séthín ókkol sófa\'ot bhinno Jaga kisím chalu goró, aro khobor\'or lagi %s dékó.','Events Manager has introduced new privacy tools to help you comply with international laws such as the GDPR, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a> for more information.'=>'Events Manager GDPR\'or moto antorjatik ain moténé cholibar lagi noya privacy hamor sáman ánaiyé, aro khobor\'or lagi <a href="%s">amar habosfonna dékó</a>.','Events Manager has no rule for %1$s, so this was imported as %2$d date.'=>'%1$s-ór lagi Events Manager-ór kunó rule nai, tai ei %2$d tarík-ór liís hisabe import hoiyé.','Events Manager has no rule for %s.'=>'%s-ór lagi Events Manager-ór kunó rule nai.','Events Manager has no rule for these yet. Such rows are imported as a list of dates, or skipped if you choose that, and the result report names each one.'=>'Ei ókkol-ór lagi Events Manager-ór ekhono kunó rule nai. Ói row ókkol tarík-ór liís hisabe import hoi, ba skip hoi jodi ói bachó, aro result report prottek-tá-ór nam dei.','Events Manager now has a <a href="">mobile app</a> 🥳 🎉, download it now!'=>'Events Manager-ór ekhon ekta <a href="">mobile app</a> 🥳 🎉 asé, ekhoni download goró!','Events Manager now supports multiple timezones for your events! Your events will initially match your blog timezone.'=>'Events Manager ekhon Tuáñr Ivent\'or lagi bohut timezone sapport goré! Tuáñr Ivent suruot tuáñr bologsáith timezone\'ot thakibo.','Events Manager repeats daily, weekly, monthly on a weekday such as the second Tuesday, and yearly, up to an end date. It has no rule for a day of the month or for ending after a number of times. Either way the result report names each row.'=>'Events Manager dainik, saptahik, mashik (jeméne dusra Mongolbar moto hopta-ór din-ót), aro bosori, sesh tarík porjonto repeat goré. Mash-ór din ba kitta bar por sesh hoa-ór kunó rule nai. Je-kunó hoilé result report prottek row-ór nam dei.','Events Manager tools — create and manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and media — for MCP-compatible AI clients.'=>'MCP-compatible AI client-or lagi Events Manager tool, Ivent, booking, Jaga, ticket ar midhia banao ar manage goroó.','Events Manager validation errors from the last save, if any.'=>'Ses save-or Events Manager validation error óll, zodi thaké.','Events Manager was not uninstalled. This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Events Manager uninstall hoi nai. Ei network ekta ivent ar booking table share kore, tai ei sáith\'ot uninstall koile network\'or sob sáith\'or ivent ar booking sorai sorai haçifélano hoibo. Etar bodole %s-ot uninstall koro.','Events Manager\'s permalink settings are changed to match, so links to your events keep working without redirects.'=>'Events Manager-ór permalink settings milaiya bodlai deya hoi, tai redirect na lagé apnar ivent-ór link kam gorté thaké.','Events Types (Archetypes)'=>'Ivent Kisím Ókkol (Archetype)','Events With Bookings Enabled'=>'Booking Enable Asé Ói Ivent óll','Events can choose their own?'=>'Ivent nijéi bachte pare?','Events can have a status associated with them, such as a cancelled event, which can then be filtered out of search listings. By default, or if disabled, events have an %s status.'=>'Ivent\'ór sáthe hásiyot thakíba paré, zémon bátíl kora Ivent, zéta tarpor tua liís\'ót baáre rakha zaiba. Asási hisabe yá disable oíle Ivent\'ór hásiyot %s oya.','Events can have multiple times per day, the timeslots can be selected from booking forms, timeslots do not have their own event page and are housed under the same event.'=>'Ek Ivent\'ót din\'ór modhe ekādhik somoy thakíba paré, booking form óttu timeslot basílo kora zaiba; timeslot\'ór nijor Ivent sófa nai, ekki Ivent\'ór modhe thaké.','Events cannot start after they end.'=>'Ivent sesh hoba\'r agei suru hóite fáribó ná.','Events current and next month'=>'Ei mac ar aggún macór Ivent','Events date modal preview format'=>'Ivent tarík modal agorisoó cokól','Events imported from CSV files'=>'CSV file-tún import hoa ivent','Events list page'=>'Ivent liís sófa','Events list settings'=>'Ivent liís séthín ókkol','Events next month'=>'Aggún macór Ivent','Events on %s'=>'%s\'ot Ivent','Events page'=>'Ivent sófa','Events per day'=>'Prottek din-ór Ivent','Events require a user to own them. In order to allow events to be submitted anonymously you need to assign that event a specific user. We recommend you create a "Anonymous" subscriber with a very good password and use that. Guests will have the same event permissions as this user when submitting.'=>'Ivent\'ór malik hisabe ek estemalgoróya dorkar. Namsárabhabe Ivent zomá dite ei Ivent\'ke ek nirdisto estemalgoróya dite oiba. Amra "Anonymous" nam\'ór ek subscriber baniya bahut bhalo húfiawaádh dia tá estemal koríte cúaric dí. Zomá deyar somoy Guest\'ór ei estemalgoróya\'r moton ekki Ivent anumoti thakiba.','Events shown'=>'Dahano ivent ókkol','Events this month'=>'Ei macór Ivent','Events this month (today onwards)'=>'Ei macór Ivent (aijjar óttu)','Events this week (today to %s)'=>'Ei hoptar Ivent (aijjar óttu %s)','Events this whole week (%s to %s)'=>'Ei pura hoptar Ivent (%s óttu %s)','Events with multiple dates will appear on each of those dates in the calendar.'=>'Zeyada tarík thaka Ivent kelendhar\'r oi proti tarík\'ot dekhaibo.','Events with timeslots can further break up timeslots dynamically by adding timeslot durations, buffers and frequencies to create multiple timeslots from one time range. For example, in the mornings, you can have a timeslot every 45 minutes at the start of each hour.'=>'Timeslot oya Ivent\'ór timeslot\'ke duration, buffer ar frequency zug koría ek somoy sima óttu ekādhik timeslot baniya paré. Zémon, sokale pratek góndha\'r súru\'ót 45 miníth poré poré timeslot thakíte paré.','Events within 12 months'=>'12 mac\'or moddhe Ivent','Events within 2 months'=>'2 mac\'or moddhe Ivent','Events within 3 months'=>'3 mac\'or moddhe Ivent','Events within 6 months'=>'6 mac\'or moddhe Ivent','Events won\'t recurr on the following dates:'=>'Ivent ei tarík ókkol-ót bar bar hoibó na:','Every Minute'=>'Protek Miníth','Everyone'=>'Beggún','Everyone else sees the link text without the link. Attendees whose booking includes virtual access get their own join link once the booking is approved. Without bookings, the link is always shown.'=>'Onno sob-ré link na thaka link-ór leká dekhai. Je attendee-ór booking-ót virtual access asé, booking approve hoilé tara nijor join link paí. Booking na thakle link sórbodá dekha jai.','Everything in Pro'=>'Pro-ót sob kichu',