onthly-ór lagi: first, second, third, fourth ba last.','For more information see our %s.'=>'Aro tothyo\'r lagi amár %s dekó.','For more information see our <a href="%s">data privacy documentation</a>.'=>'Ár khobor-or lagi amar <a href="%s">data privacy documentation</a> soó.','For multiple emails, separate by commas (e.g. email1@test.com,email2@test.com,etc.)'=>'Ekadhik email-or lagi, comma dia alada goró (zemon email1@test.com,email2@test.com,etc.)','For use with the %s placeholder'=>'%s placeholder\'r sathe bebohar goróibar lagi','For weekly: one or more, such as Mon, Wed. For monthly: one, used with the week of the month.'=>'Weekly-ór lagi: ek ba aro beshi, jeméne Mon, Wed. Monthly-ór lagi: ek, mash-ór hopta-ór logé use goribo.','For when start/end %s are present, this will separate the two (include spaces here if necessary).'=>'Start/end %s thakile, eibar duitta\'r moddhe alada goré (dorkar hoile oikkane space dhalo).','Force network-defined list (no subsite choice)'=>'Network-e thik kora list estemal goró (subsite basílo nai)','Formatting'=>'Cokól','Found %d orphaned events, deleted %d successfully'=>'%d orphaned ivent paón gesé, %d thikmoto haçifélano hoise','Found in %s'=>'%s-ót peiyé','Free'=>'Muft','Free companion plugins'=>'Muft companion plugin ókkol','Free plugins from the Events Manager team, available on WordPress.org.'=>'Events Manager team-ór muft plugin ókkol, WordPress.org-ót paó.','Frequency'=>'Kotobar','From '=>'Óttu ','From %1$s to %2$s'=>'%1$s óttu %2$s íkka','From %s a year'=>'Bosór-ót %s-tún','Front-end management pages'=>'Front-end management sófa óll','Full Calendar Options'=>'Full Calendar Option','Full-Size Calendar'=>'Pura Maf\'r Kelendhar','Fully Booked'=>'Beggún Jaga Booking Hoiyé','Fully booked'=>'Pura booking hoi gesé','Further Information'=>'Aro Tothyo','Future'=>'Aijjá','Future Events Only?'=>'Khali Aijjá Ivent?','Future events'=>'Aggún Ivent','Future events only'=>'Khali aijjá Ivent','Gather panels that can\'t run in the canvas into a tabbed "Event Details" box'=>'Canvas\'ót cholé na oya panel ókkol ek tab oya "Event Details" boks\'ót zomá koró','General'=>'Aám','General JS'=>'Aám JS','General Options'=>'Aám Options','General settings'=>'Aám séthín ókkol','Geolocation Search'=>'Geolocation Tua','Get %s'=>'%s lo','Get booking'=>'Booking ano','Get booking requirements'=>'Booking requirement ano','Get event'=>'Ivent ano','Get event availability'=>'Ivent availability ano','Get location'=>'Jaga ano','Get ticket'=>'Ticket ano','Getting Help for Events Manager'=>'Events Manager\'or lagi Modot Paón','Give each date of a recurring event its own meeting link'=>'Bar bar hoba ivent-ór prottek tarík-ré nijor meeting link deó','Give the file to import with --file=<path>.'=>'Import gorer file --file=<path> dóyé deó.','Global %s slug'=>'Global %s slug','Global Map Format'=>'Global Nokśa Cokól','Google Calendar'=>'Google Kelendhar','Google Map Type'=>'Google Map Kisím','Google Maps API Browser Key'=>'Google Maps API Browser Key','Google Maps API provides you with ways to display maps of your locations and help site visitors find events near their desired locations.'=>'Google Maps API tuáñr Jaga\'r nokśa dekhaiyar ar sáith\'ór dekhoya\'r lagi tara pasot Jaga\'r kasot Ivent khuzíbar upay dey.','Google Maps Style'=>'Google Maps Ecthail','Google Maps Styling Wizard'=>'Google Maps Stailing Wizard','Google Maps and Location Services'=>'Google Maps ar Jaga Sheba','Google Maps require an API key, please see our %s page for instructions on obtaining one.'=>'Google Maps\'ór lagi API key dorkar, key paiyar nirdes\'ór lagi amár %s sófa dekó.','Google has introduced new pricing for displaying maps on your site. If you have moderate traffic levels, this may likely affect you with surprise and unexpected costs!'=>'Google tuáñr sáith\'ot map dahábar lagi noya dam chalu goijjé. Tuáñr sáith\'ot moddhom moto ója aile, ei zuré obaak o ocena khoroc hoite pare!','Google may charge you for usage, depending on how much traffic your site receives. For more information about how and where Events Manager uses the Google Maps API, and how to manage costs, please see our %s page.'=>'Tuáñr sáith\'ót koto traffic ashé tar upor depend koría Google estemal\'ór lagi tāka lagaiba paré. Events Manager Google Maps API kot ar kemoné estemal kore ar khoroc kemoné chalaiba tar baabote aro tothyo\'r lagi amár %s sófa dekó.','Google offers different map displays, each with varying prices and free usage allowance. See our %s page for more information on these display options.'=>'Google alada alada nokśa display dey, pratek\'ór dam ar free estemal alada. Ei display opshon\'ór baabote aro tothyo\'r lagi amár %s sófa dekó.','Grid'=>'Grid','Group By'=>'Group Koro','Group Events'=>'Group Ivent','Group Ownership'=>'Group Malikana','Grouped Lists'=>'Gúroup goijjá List','Grouped Lists View'=>'Grouped Liís Soó','Grouped list default'=>'Grouped liís\'r asási','Grouped list format'=>'Grouped liís\'r cokól','Grouped list header'=>'Grouped liís\'r matá','Guest Default User'=>'Guest Asási Estemalgoróya','Guest User'=>'Guest Estemalgoróya','Guest Users'=>'Mehman Estemalgoróya ókkol','HTML Allowed.'=>'HTML dewa zae.','HTML allowed.'=>'HTML dilé.','HTML entity-decoded shortcode content will be sanitized after being decoded, we STRONGLY recommend leaving this enabled.'=>'HTML entity-decode hoa shortcode hazorjiníc decode hoar fisé sanitize hoibo, amra DORÓ bhabe ei optión cálu rakar sarámorso dói.','HTML is not accepted.'=>'HTML maná.','Headings'=>'Matá Ókkol','Help'=>'Modot','Here you can disable individual item styling eompletely or just allow basic styling. Basic styling will try to impose general structuring (such as calendar structures) but won\'t use our Strict styling rules.'=>'Etháne alada alada jiníc\'ór styling ekdom disable yá khali basic styling anumoti dia paró. Basic styling aam structure (zémon calendar structure) lagaiyar chesta koriba kintu amár Strict styling niyom estemal koriba na.','Hidden Links'=>'Luwa Link ókkol','Hidden by default?'=>'Asási hisabe luwa?','Hidden from listings (yes or no)'=>'Liís-tún luwa (yes ba no)','Hidden from upcoming'=>'Aijjá-tún luwa','Hidden link text'=>'Luwa link-ór leká','Hidden links'=>'Luwa link ókkol','Hide'=>'Luwa','Hide Advanced Options'=>'Torkigoijjá Óll Luwa','Hide Advanced Search'=>'Torkigoijjá Tua Luwa','Hide Search'=>'Tua Luwa','Hide form until tickets selected?'=>'Ticket basílo na hoa porzonto form luwaibó?','Hide label'=>'Luwa label','Hide link until %s minutes before the event starts'=>'Ivent suru hoiba %s miníth ágé porjonto link luwó','Hide on %s screen size?'=>'%s screen maf\'ot luwa?','Hold spaces while booking?'=>'Booking-or somoy jaga hold goribó?','Hold time'=>'Hold somoy','Holds'=>'Hold ókkol','Host account'=>'Host Akaunt','Hosted by %s'=>'%s-ór host','Hours'=>'Góndha','How events appear on each calendar day: a labelled pill per event, a single dot, one dot per event (up to the day limit), or a coloured ring around the date. Override per calendar with the %s parameter.'=>'Proti kelendhar din\'ot Ivent kenre dekhay: proti Ivent\'r lagi label thaka pill, eke dot, proti Ivent\'r lagi eke dot (din\'r limit poryonto), yá tarík\'r charodike rongin ring. Proti kelendhar\'r lagi %s parameter diya override goró.','How long before an event can users cancel?'=>'Ivent-or koy somoy age estemalgoróya ókkol kenselgoró gorit paribo?','How many minutes before an event starts its link is shown, when the event has no time of its own.'=>'Ivent-ór nijor somoy na thakle, ivent suru hoiba kéto miníth ágé tar link dekha jaibo.','How many minutes the picked spaces are held for a visitor who has not submitted their booking yet.'=>'Zei visitor ekhono tahar booking submit koré nai tahar lagi basílo kora jaga koy miniht hold thakibo.','How the first rows will import with the columns and options as last previewed. Nothing has been saved yet.'=>'Shés preview hoa column aro option-ór logé fóila row ókkol kéné import hoibo. Ekhono kichu save hoi nai.','However, there were some problems whilst sending confirmation emails to you and/or the event contact person. You may want to contact them directly and letting them know of this error.'=>'Kintu, añár yá Ivent\'or konték manusor logé confirmation B-ciñçí pathóbar belá kisu osubidha hoiyé. Ókkore logé sórasori zogazog goriyé ei error jánai dió.','Hundreds of free hours have gone into making this free plugin, show your support and add a small link to the plugin website at the bottom of your event pages.'=>'Ei free plugin baniyar lagi hozar hozar free góndha lagisé, tuáñr somorthon dekhai Ivent sófa\'ór tolat plugin wébsáith\'ór ek chotu rabeta ezafágoró.','Hybrid'=>'Mishal','Hybrid (Physical/Virtual)'=>'Mishal (Asol/Virtual)','Hybrid Venue (Physical/Virtual)'=>'Mishal Jaga (Asol/Virtual)','I consent to my submitted data being collected and stored as outlined by the site %s.'=>'Añí %s sáith\'or niyom moté amar submit goijjá data jomá ar bórieragiyé, ei kotat raji asi.','I consent to the use of my provided contact information for communication purposes.'=>'Añí zogazog\'or lagi amar dilé konték khobor estemal gorón\'ot raji asi.','I hereby withdraw from the contract for the following booking: %1$s (#%2$d).'=>'Ami ei booking\'r contract tára withdraw goríre: %1$s (#%2$d).','ID'=>'ID','IP: %s'=>'IP: %s','Icon to appear in dashboard admin menu for this Archetype. Accepts URLs to PNG/SVG images, %s or leave blank for default.'=>'Ei Archetype-or lagi dashboard admin mínu-t dekha dewa icon. PNG/SVG fothú-r URL, %s yá asási-r lagi khali rakó.','If File Type is also set, only these extensions within the permitted File Type will be permitted.'=>'Jodi File Type-o set asé, ejazot dia File Type\'or bítore khali ei extension ókkol ejazot paibo.','If HTML emails are enabled, br tags will automatically be added for new lines.'=>'Jodi HTML email enable asé, noya line\'or lagi automatic bhabe br tag ezafágoró hoibo.','If a booking exists for that email address, we have sent a link to manage your withdrawal. Please check your inbox.'=>'Ei b-ciñçír thíkanát Booking thakile, amra tuár withdrawal sambhalibar lagi ek rabeta fatai dició. Doya kori tuár inbox soó.','If a booking is made and an email cannot be sent, this is added to the success message.'=>'Zodi ekta booking kora zai ar email pathano zai na, ei sofol message-t ezafágoró hoy.','If a calendar day has only one event, you can force a direct link to the event (recommended to avoid duplicate content).'=>'Kelendhar\'r kuno din\'ot kebol eke Ivent thakile, Ivent\'r sidha rabeta zorbo kora zay (duplicate hazorjiníc eraibar lagi cúaric goijjá).','If a user has not previously given or revoked consent for a specific submitted data type (such as bookings), do we assume user has given consent by default?'=>'Zodi ek estemalgoróya nirdisto submit kora data kisim (zemon booking) -or lagi agó consent dey yá revoke goré nái, asási hisabe ózi consent disé ói dhorí nióm?','If already attending and double bookings are disabled, this message will be displayed, followed by a link to the users booking page.'=>'Zodi ageyi attend gorot ase ar double booking bongoró, ei message dekhano hoibo, tar pore estemalgoróya-r booking sófa-r rabeta thakibo.','If an event does not have a category assigned when editing, this one will be assigned automatically.'=>'Sóiyi koríbar somoy Ivent\'ór kunu kisím na thakíle ei kisím ojoibo lagaiya zaiba.','If an event is cancelled, the following actions can be taken upon cancellation.'=>'Ivent kenselgoró oíle kenselgoró\'r somoy níce\'r ékcen ókkol lowa zaiba paré.','If an event is cancelled, you can exclude them from event lists. You can display cancelled events in shortcode using the %s parameter.'=>'Ivent kenselgoró oíle Ivent liís óttu baáre rakhía paró. Shortcode\'ót %s parameter diya kenselgoró oya Ivent dekhaya zaiba paré.','If an event lasts all day, this text will show if using the %s placeholder'=>'Ivent beggún din cole %s placeholder bebohar goróle ei HTML Leká dekhaibo','If checked every booking must select one or the minimum number of this ticket.'=>'Tik dile, hóro booking-ót ei Ticket-ór ek yá kómpokke tuk sóngkha bachon goróni lagibó.','If enabled replies to these automated emails will be sent to the person who made the booking. This takes precedence over the event owner Reply-To.'=>'Zodi enable thake, oi automatic B-ciñçí\'r zowab booking goróya manuxor kasé zaibo. Oi Ivent owner Reply-To\'r uporé fádhanno paibo.','If enabled replies to these automated emails will, by default, be sent to the email of the event owner.'=>'Zodi enable thake, oi automatic B-ciñçí\'r zowab asási hisabe Ivent owner\'r B-ciñçite zaibo.','If enabled, Events Manager checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release rather than waiting for the staggered update rollout, which can take up to 24 hours. Releases found this way are shown for a manual update only and are never auto-installed, unless you define the %1$s constant. %2$s'=>'Cálu thakile, Events Manager staggered kiórzana rollout-or lagi 24 góndha porzonto na aguwa soriasori WordPress.org-t taza stable relis check goribo. Ei bhabe peya relis ókkol khali hat dhori kiórzana-r lagi dehano zai, kokkhono auto-install hoy na, zodi tumi %1$s constant na dói. %2$s','If enabled, fully booked timeslots remain visible but cannot be selected.'=>'Cálu thakile, pura booking hoa timeslot ókkol dekha zaibo kintu basílo kora zaibo na.','If enabled, guest visitors can supply an email address and a user account will automatically be created for them along with their booking. They will be also be able to log back in with that newly created account.'=>'Cálu thakile, guest visitor ókkol ekta B-ciñçír Thíkana dili, tahar booking-or sathe tahar lagi auto ekta estemalgoróya account banaibo. Tara oi noya account-ot abar bútore gólo paribo.','If enabled, the entire booking form will show once a space is selected, or if an ticket is already pre-selected with minimum spaces.'=>'Cálu thakile, ekta jaga basílo hoile yá minimum jagar sathe ekta ticket ageyi basílo thakile, purao booking form dekha zaibo.','If enabled, the latest dev version will always be checked instead of the latest stable version of the plugin.'=>'Cálu thakile, plugin-or taza stable varcén-or bodole sobbó somoy taza dev varcén check hoibo.','If enabled, the spaces a visitor picks on the booking form are held for them while they fill in the rest of the form, so nobody else can take them before they submit. Held spaces count as taken for everyone else until the booking is submitted or the hold runs out. A hold can be no larger than one booking, so set a maximum number of spaces per booking on your events or tickets to limit how much of an event one visitor can hold.'=>'Chalu hoile, visitor booking form-ót jé jaga bachibo, form-ór bakí ongsho puron goribar somoy ói jaga tar lagi hold hoi rakhibo, tai submit goribar ágé onno kehé loi nite parim nai. Booking submit na hoa ba hold sesh na hoa porjonto hold hoa jaga onno sob-ór lagi nea hoi goná hoi. Ekta hold ekta booking-ót beshi hoite pare nai, tai ekjon visitor ekta ivent-ór kéto ongsho hold gorte pare ói sima goribar lagi apnar ivent ba ticket-ót booking-ót beshi-te beshi jaga-ór gon set goró.','If enabled, users can book an event more than once.'=>'Cálu thakile, estemalgoróya ókkol ekta ivent ekbarot beshi booking gorit paribo.','If enabled, users can cancel their bookings themselves from their bookings page.'=>'Cálu thakile, estemalgoróya ókkol tahar bookings sófa theke nizor booking nizei kenselgoró gorit paribo.','If guests cannot make bookings, they will be asked to register in order to book. However, enabling this will still show available tickets.'=>'Zodi guest ókkol booking gorit pare na, booking gorar lagi tahar rejicthorgoró gorar kotha koa hoibo. Kintu ei cálu gorle moujut ticket ókkol ekhono dekha zaibo.','If inclusion rules are entered above, this setting is ignored.'=>'Uporé inclusion niom lekhile ei séthín ignore hoibo.','If left blank, no emails will be sent. Separate emails with commas for more than one email.'=>'Zodi fáka thake, kuno B-ciñçí fatóya no zaibo. Eke zeyada B-ciñçi hoile comma diya alada goró.','If left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'Khali rakhile asási mulyo estemal hoibo.','If left blank, this email will not be sent.'=>'Zodi fáka thake, oi B-ciñçí fatóya no zaibo.','If set to yes the capabilities will be applied all your network blogs and you will not be able to set custom capabilities each blog. You can select no later and visit specific blog settings pages to add/remove capabilities.'=>'Ói koile kabiliát ókkol tuañr sob network blog\'ot apply hoibo ar tuí prottek blog\'ot custom kabiliát set koribar fare na. Pore na basíli prottek blog\'or séthín sófat giya kabiliát ezafágoró/larifélo koribar fare.','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of events.'=>'Ói oíle tuáñr Ivent liís\'ór ekdom upore ek tua form dekha zaiba.','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of locations.'=>'Zodi Ói kora hoé, Jaga list-or úpore ek Tua form dekha zaibo.','If set to yes, advanced search fields can toggled by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'Ói basílo goróle "Advanced Search" icon click goriya torkigoijjá tua field ókkol toggle goróno zay.','If set to yes, advanced search fields will be hidden by default and can be revealed by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'Ói basílo goróle torkigoijjá tua field ókkol asási hisabe luwa thakibo ar "Advanced Search" icon click goróle dekhaibo.','If set to yes, full sized images will be used and HTML width and height attributes will be used to determine the size.'=>'Ói oíle fuúl maf fothú estemal hoba ar maf thik koríte HTML fatári ar usol attribute estemal hoba.','If set to yes, the FullCalendar will be used instead of the standard calendar on the events page.'=>'Zodi Ói kora hoé, Ivent sófa-t miyar kelendhar-or bodole FullCalendar bebohar hobo.','If set to yes, your emails will be sent in HTML format, otherwise plaintext.'=>'Ói koile tuañr email HTML cokól\'ot fatá jaibo, nóile plaintext-ot.','If set, the total number of spaces for a single booking to this event cannot exceed this amount.'=>'Dile, ei Ivent-ór ek Booking-ót total Jaga ei sóngkha fáar zaibó na.','If syncing is turned on for a booking status below, when a user RSVPs, the booking status will automatically be changed along with RSVP status.'=>'Niceor ekta booking hásiyot-or lagi syncing cálu thakile, estemalgoróya zokhon RSVP koré, RSVP hásiyot-or sathe booking hásiyot-o auto bodole zaibo.','If the booking is free, this will be displayed instead of the %s heading.'=>'Booking free hole, %s heading-or bodole ei dekhano hoibo.','If the consent checkbox is not checked during a booking, this error will be returned.'=>'Booking-or belá consent checkbox check na gorle ei error dekha zaibo.','If the consent checkbox is not checked when submitting information such as events or locations, this error will be returned.'=>'Ivent yá Jaga moto khobor submit gorár belá consent checkbox check na gorle ei error dekha zaibo.','If the user made a previous booking and cannot double-book.'=>'Zodi estemalgoróya age booking koré gesé ar double booking gorit pare na.','If the user tries to make a booking with spaces that exceeds the maximum number of spaces per booking.'=>'Zodi estemalgoróya ekta booking-t sorbocco jagar sima theke beshi jaga dia booking gorit ceshta koré.','If the user tries to make a booking without requesting any spaces.'=>'Zodi estemalgoróya kono jaga na cay ekta booking gorit ceshta koré.','If there are any new updates, you should now see them in your Plugins or Updates admin pages.'=>'Noya update thakile, ekhon tuáñr Plugin yá Update admin sófa\'ot dékibo.','If there are member-only tickets, you can choose whether or not to show these tickets to guests.'=>'Zodi member-only ticket asé, ei ticket ókkol guest ókkolke dekhaibó ki na tumi basílo gorit paro.','If there\'s no fields to show in the main search section, this button will be used instead at the bottom of the advanced fields.'=>'Main tua ongsho\'ot dekhaibar kuno field no thakile, torkigoijjá field ókkol\'r tole ei button bebohar hoibo.','If this is incorrect, click cancel and try a more specific address.'=>'Ei bul hoile, Kenselgoró dabaiya aró nirdisto thíkana dió.','If translations are left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'Torjuma khali rakhile asási mulyo estemal hoibo.','If viewing a page for events on a specific date, this is the title that would show up. To insert date values, use <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP time format characters</a>  with a <code>#</code> symbol before them, i.e. <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, etc.<br/>'=>'Kuno nirdisto tarík\'r Ivent\'r sófa dekhaile, oi lokób dekhaibo. Tarík\'r mán dhalibar lagi <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP wokt cokól akkor</a> bebohar goró, tar age <code>#</code> chinno dia, zeme <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, ittadi.<br/>','If you are experiencing errors when trying to use any of these accounts, try disconnecting and connecting again.'=>'Ei account ókkolor kunu ekkta estemal goríbar belá error ashile, disconnect goró ar abar connect goró.','If you change time patterns such as start times or durations, any previously created timeslots falling outside the new settings will be %s.'=>'Shuru-ór somoy yá somoy lomba zeman somoy pattern bodolile, notun séthín ókkol-ór bahire agor banano timeslot ókkol %s hoibó.','If you choose \'Pages\' then %s will be shown using your theme default page template, alternatively choose from page templates that come with your specific theme.'=>'\'Sófa óll\' basílo koríle %s tuáñr tehm\'ór asási sófa nomuna diya dekhaya zaiba, noile tuáñr bishesh tehm\'ór saté ashiya sófa nomuna óttu basílo koró.','If you choose a group by mode, your events page will display events in groups of your chosen time range.'=>'Zodi group by mode basílo goró, tuáñr Ivent sófa\'ot basa wokt\'r moidan onuzayi Ivent group goré dekhaibo.','If you choose the Event post type whilst Events Manager is activated, you can also visit the <a href="%s">Events Manager settings page</a> for a few more options when displaying event information on your calendar.'=>'Zodi tuñi Ivent post type basó Events Manager activate thakar belá, tuáñr kelendhar-t Ivent-or khobor dekhanir lagi ár kisu option-or lagi <a href="%s">Events Manager séthín ókkol sófa</a> soó parba.','If you choose to cancel your event, after you save this event, no further bookings will be possible for this event.'=>'Zodi tuñí ivent kenselgoróyó, ei ivent bórieró\'r fisé, ei ivent\'r lagi aar booking hóibo ná.','If you collect personal data, you may want to request their consent. The options below will automatically add checkboxes requesting this consent.'=>'Zodi tuñi personal data collect goró, tuñi tára consent cáió parró. Nise-or option óll ei consent cáór lagi ózi checkbox ezafágoribo.','If you could spare a few minutes, we would appreciate it if you could please leave us a review.'=>'Kunu kunu minit somoy thakile amar\'ré ekta review dile amra khub khushi hom.','If you disable locations, bear in mind that you should remove your location page, shortcodes and related placeholders from your <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">formats</a>.'=>'Jaga disable koríle mone rakhíba, tuáñr Jaga sófa, shortcode ar sombondhít placeholder tuáñr <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">cokól ókklo</a> óttu larifélíte oiba.','If you enable tips, this information will be shown, which can include HTML.'=>'Tip enable goróle ei khobor dekha zaibo, ítát HTML thakí parró.','If you extend or add more dates, the new recurrences will be added to your recurrence set without affecting previously created ones.'=>'Tarík bará yá zíyada ezafágoríle, notun bar bar hoa tuár bar bar hoa-ór setót zuri hoibó, agor banano ókkol-ót kunu asor foribó na.','If you extend or add more times, this will not affect previous timeslots.'=>'Somoy bará yá zíyada ezafágoríle, agor timeslot ókkol-ót kunu asor foribó na.','If you get a lot of pending bookings and you decide to allow more bookings than spaces allow, setting this to yes will allow you to override the event space limit when manually approving.'=>'Zodi tuáñr beshi pending booking asé ar tumi jagar cheye beshi booking ózazot dite sidhanto laó, ei ói thakile hat dhori approve gorar somoy ivent jagar sima overwrite gorit parbo.','If you hare happy with the migration, you can dismiss this message and your old formatting options (i.e. this undo option) will be deleted.'=>'Migration tuár bhala lagile, ei message Hótomgoró goritte fare ar tuár hála formatting option ókkol (mane ei Wapesgoró option) Haçifélá zaibó.','If you just want to deactivate the plugin, <a href="%s">go to your plugins page</a>.'=>'Jodi tuí khali plugin bongoró cáós, <a href="%s">tuañr plugin ókkol sófat jao</a>.','If you modify the dates where recurrences will not occur on, any recurrences falling within these dates will be %s. New recurrences will be created if you remove unavailable dates which previously blocked recurrnce dates.'=>'Bar bar hoba ei tarík ókkol-ót na hoar tarík bodolile, ei tarík ókkol-ór moddhe fará bar bar hoa ókkol %s hoibó. Agor atikka kora tarík Haçifélile notun bar bar hoa banaiya zaibó.','If you prefer a ticket table like with multiple tickets, even for single ticket events, enable this.'=>'Ekbocon ticket ivent-or lagi-o zodi ekadhik ticket-or moto ekta ticket thebíl cao, ei cálu goró.','If you select a default country, that will be pre-selected when creating a new location.'=>'Asási desh basílo koríle noya Jaga baniya\'r somoy ei desh aagot basílo thakiba.','If you shorten the date range or limit your recurrence dates, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be %s.'=>'Tarík hodd chuto goríle yá bar bar hoa-ór tarík kómaiyle, notun hodd-ór bahire fará bar bar hoa ókkol %s hoibó.','If you update this event data and save, it could get overwritten if you edit the repeating event template. To make it an independent, <a href="%s">detach it</a>.'=>'Zodi tuñí ei ivent\'r data kiórzana goria bórieró, bar bar hoba ivent\'r nomuna sóiyigorilé eita mocé zaite fáre. Eitare ekkún swadhin goróté, <a href="%s">detach goró</a>.','If you use the %s <a href="%s">shortcode</a>, you can display a map of all your locations and events, the settings below will be used.'=>'%s <a href="%s">shortcode</a> estemal koríle tuáñr beggún Jaga ar Ivent\'ór nokśa dahaya paríba; níce\'r séthín ókkol estemal hoba.','If you use the <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">placeholder</a> when displaying individual event and location information, the settings below will be used.'=>'Ek Ivent ar Jaga\'r tothyo dahaya\'r somoy <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">placeholder</a> estemal koríle níce\'r séthín ókkol estemal hoba.','If you want to edit general options for Events Manager, visit the main %s.'=>'Jodi tuí Events Manager\'or aám option sóiyi koribar cáós, main %s-ot jao.','If you would like every event booking confirmation email sent to an administrator write their email here (leave blank to not send an email).'=>'Zodi tumi prottek ivent booking confirmation email ekta administrator-ke pathaite cao tahar email ekhane leká (email na pathaite khali rakó).','If you would like to add extra classes to your body html tag when a single %s page is displayed, enter it here. May be useful or necessary if your theme requires special class names for specific templates.'=>'Ek %s sófa dekhaya\'r somoy tuáñr body html tag\'ót ekstra class ezafá koríte cáile etháne likó. Tuáñr tehm bishesh nomuna\'r lagi bishesh class nam cáile dorkari yá upokari oya paré.','If you would like to disable comments entirely, disable this, otherwise you can disable comments on each single %s. Note that %s with comments enabled will still be until you resave them.'=>'Ekdom rai disable koríte cáile ei disable koró, noile pratek ek %s\'ót rai disable koría paró. Khetal rakó rai enable thaka %s tuáñr abar save na kora porzonto thakiba.','If you would like to download a dev version, but just as a one-off, you can force a dev version check by clicking the button below. If there is one available, it should appear in your plugin updates page as a regular update.'=>'Zodi tumi ekbar-or lagi dev varcén download gorit cao, niceor button-t click gori dev varcén check zoboro goritó paro. Zodi ekta thake, ou tuáñr plugin kiórzana sófat sadharon kiórzana hisabe dekha zaibo.','If you would prefer all your locations to belong to your main blog, users in sub-sites will still be able to create locations, but the actual locations are created and reside in the main blog.'=>'Jodi tuí cáo tuañr sob jaga main blog\'or hoibo, sub-site\'or estemalgoróya ókkol tobu jaga banaite faribo, kintu asol jaga ókkol main blog\'ot banai ar thake.','If you would prefer to hide this page, add %s to your wp-config.php file.'=>'Ei sófa luwite chaile, apnar wp-config.php file-ót %s jog goró.','If you\'re using the Google Maps, the more detail you provide, the more accurate Google can be at finding your location. If your address isn\'t being found, please <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>try it on maps.google.com</a> by adding all the fields below separated by commas.'=>'Tuí Google Maps estemal goríle, zeto bóut tofsil dibá, Google tuár Jaga ghuñjiyá feibar ottoyo thik hoibó. Tuár thíkana na fáile, doya kori nićé-ór beggún field comma dió alada kori <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>maps.google.com-ót kuciç goró</a>.','Image'=>'Fothú','Image Dimensions'=>'Fothú Lambai Fatári','Image input must be an attachment ID, URL, or object with source_url / content_base64 / file.'=>'Fothú input ek attachment ID, URL yá source_url / content_base64 / file thaka object hoóa lagibo.','Import'=>'Import goró','Import %1$s, %2$s'=>'Import goró %1$s, %2$s','Import Settings'=>'Séthín Ókkol Import Goró','Import a %s'=>'Ekta %s import goró','Import and Migrate'=>'Import aro Migrate','Import as'=>'Hisabe import goró','Import as a list of dates'=>'Tarík-ór liís hisabe import goró','Import events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, or copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from another events plugin. Either can be rolled back, and the original data is left untouched.'=>'CSV file-tún ivent, jaga ba organizer import goró, ba onno ivent plugin-tún apnar ivent, venue, organizer, ticket aro attendee copy goró. Duitai rollback gorte paró, aro asol data-ót kichu bodlai na.','Import into Events Manager'=>'Events Manager-ót import goró','Import/Export Settings'=>'Séthín Ókkol Import/Export','Imported, with a note'=>'Import hoiyé, ekta note-ór logé','Importing rows'=>'Row import hoitaasé','Imports'=>'Import ókkol','Imports events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, one row for each. A repeating event is one row too. Run it, check the result, and roll the import back if it is not what you wanted.'=>'CSV file-tún ivent, jaga ba organizer import goré, prottek-ór lagi ek row. Bar bar hoba ivent-ó ek row. Chalaó, result check goró, aro jodi jé chaiyó na hoilé import rollback goró.','In order to use attributes, you must define some in your templates, otherwise they\'ll never show. Go to Events > Settings > General to add attribute placeholders.'=>'Attribute estemal goróbar lagi, tuáñr nomuna ókkol\'ot kisu thík goróbar lagé, nohoile kokhono dékibo na. Attribute placeholder ezafágoróbar lagi Events > Settings > General\'ot zao.','In single ticket mode, users can only create one ticket per event (and will not see options to add more tickets).'=>'Ekbocon ticket mode-t, estemalgoróya ókkol prottek ivent-or lagi khali ekta ticket banaite paribo (ar aro ticket ezafágoró gorar optión dekhibo na).','In the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>, you\'ll find various textboxes where you can edit how event information looks, such as for event and location lists. Using the placeholders below, you can choose what information should be displayed.'=>'<a href=\'%s\'>séthín sófa</a>\'ót tuí nana textbox paibo jéta\'ot ivent ar jaga list\'or moto ivent information kemon dekhaibo ségula sóiyi koribar fare. Nicé\'r placeholder ókkol diye tuí basílibar fare ki information dahá hoibo.','In the boxes below, you are expected to write the page IDs. For multiple pages, use comma-separated values e.g. 1,2,3. Entering 0 means EVERY page, -1 means the home page.'=>'Níce\'r boks ókkot sófa ID likó. Ekādhik sófa\'r lagi comma diya alada koró, zémon 1,2,3. 0 mane BEGGÚN sófa, -1 mane gór sófa.','In this case, a user can confirm their own booking even if the booking is pending.'=>'Ei khetre, booking pending hoileo estemalgoróya nizor booking nizei confirm gorit pare.','Include %s'=>'%s Include Goró','Include Countries'=>'Desh Dhaló Koró','Include all'=>'Beggún dhukaió','Include cancelled events?'=>'Kenselgoró oya Ivent dhaló koríba?','Include in WordPress Searches?'=>'WordPress Tua\'ót dhaló koríba?','Include on'=>'Etháne dhaló koró','Include only guest submissions'=>'Khali guest submission dhukaió','Include only these %1$s IDs, for multiple values separate by commas such as %2$s.'=>'Kebol ei %1$s ID ókkol include goró, zeyada mán\'r lagi comma diya alada goró, zeme %2$s.','Include pages where you use shortcode or PHP to display event submission forms.'=>'Ivent zomá form dekhaya\'r lagi shortcode yá PHP estemal kora sófa óll dhaló koró.','Include pages where you use shortcodes or widgets to display event search forms.'=>'Ivent tua form dekhaya\'r lagi shortcode yá widget estemal kora sófa óll dhaló koró.','Include past events'=>'Gúzoré ivent shamil goró','Included in %s'=>'%s-ót shamil','Included with your %s'=>'Apnar %s-ór logé shamil','Includes hybrid events, which can also be attended physically.'=>'Hybrid ivent shamil, jéta physical-ó attend gora jai.','Incomplete Bookings'=>'Osompurno Booking','Individual Components'=>'Alada Component óll','Individual tickets with remaining spaces will not be available if total booking spaces reach this limit. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Booking-ór total Jaga ei hodd-ót pouñsile, baki Jaga thakilew alada Ticket moujut hoibó na. Hodd na lagile khali rakkó.','Inherit your theme settings'=>'Tuáñr tehm séthín inherit koró','Initial lengths'=>'Prarombhik lambai','Inline'=>'Lainorbútore','Insert the address of the notification sender.'=>'Notification fataniya\'r thíkana dhaló.','Insert the display name of the notification sender.'=>'Notification fataniya\'r dahá nam dhaló.','Insert the password to be used to access your SMTP server'=>'Tuañr SMTP server-ot access koribar lagi estemal koribo ói húfiawaádh dhaló','Insert the username to be used to access your SMTP server.'=>'Tuañr SMTP server-ot access koribar lagi estemal koribo ói estemalgoróya\'r nam dhaló.','Install'=>'Install goró','Installed'=>'Install hoiyé','Installed, not active'=>'Install hoiyé, chalu hoi nai','Invalid Number'=>'Bhul Nombor','Invalid file upload.'=>'File upload valid nai.','Invalid interval format for %s'=>'%s\'r lagi interval cokól bhul','Invalid request'=>'Thík na request','Invalid source URL.'=>'Source URL valid nai.','Involid token credentials, the folloiwng are missing: %s.'=>'Token credentials bhul, ei ókkol nái: %s.','Is consent required?'=>'Consent dorkar?','It looks like you have WPML enabled on your site. We advise you also install our extra <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> plugin which helps the two work better together. <a href="%s">Dismiss message</a>'=>'Mone hoi tuañr sáith\'ót WPML enable asé. Amra tuañr\'ré amar extra <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> plugin fíthgoró\'r fórámorsho dii, jita duitta\'ré bála kori kam kora\'ibar modot kore. <a href="%s">Message hótomgoró</a>','JavaScript Files'=>'JavaScript File óll','Join'=>'Join goró','Join online'=>'Online join goró','Keep The Events Calendar\'s web addresses for events, venues, organizers, categories and tags'=>'The Events Calendar-ór ivent, venue, organizer, kisím aro hót-ór web thíkana rakho','Keep your current settings, or individuall revert to default formats.'=>'Tuár hála séthín ókkol rakkó, yá alada kori asási format-ót Wapesgoró.','Kilometers'=>'Kilomitar','Label'=>'Lebel','Labels'=>'Label ókkol','Language Booked'=>'Booking\'or Bhasa','Large'=>'Dhoóñr','Last %d Months'=>'Gotó %d Mac','Last Month'=>'Gotó Mac','Last Name'=>'Ahéri Nam','Last Year'=>'Gotó Bosór','Last checked via %1$s on %2$s.'=>'Shés %2$s-ót %1$s-tún check hoiyé.','Last page'=>'Shés sófa','Last sync failed: %s'=>'Shés sync hoi nai: %s','Latitude'=>'Akkhangsho','Learn More'=>'Aro Jano','Learn more'=>'Aro jano','Leave blank for default archetype setting.'=>'Asási archetype séthín\'or lagi khali rakho.','Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Hodd na lagile khali rakkó.','Leave blank to use the built-in default for your site\'s language.'=>'Tuáñr sáith\'r bhasar lagi built-in asási estemal gorór lagi fáka rakho.','Leave blank to use the default format from Settings.'=>'Séthín ókkol-ór asási format estemal goribar lagi khali rakkó.','Leave blank to use the default format. Accepts event placeholders such as #_EVENTLINK.'=>'Asási format bebohar goribar lagi faka rakho. #_EVENTLINK nisé ivent placeholder grohon goré.','Leave blank to use the default format. Accepts location placeholders such as #_LOCATIONLINK.'=>'Asási format bebohar goribar lagi faka rakho. #_LOCATIONLINK nisé jaga placeholder grohon goré.','Leave either blank for no upper/lower limit.'=>'Uppor/tole hodd na lagile duitta khali rakkó.','Leave this field empty'=>'Ei field khali rakkó','License expired'=>'License expire hoiyé','License not activated'=>'License activate hoi nai','Licensed'=>'License asé','Limit JS file loading?'=>'JS file load sima koríba?','Limit loading of our CSS files?'=>'Amár CSS file load sima koríba?','Limits the number of events on each calendar day. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Proti kelendhar din\'ot Ivent\'r sonkhya limit goré. Limit nai cole fáka rakó.','Limits the number of future events shown (0 = unlimited).'=>'Dekháno ainewala Ivent\'r sonkhya limit goré (0 = limit nai).','Line Graph'=>'Line Graf','Link'=>'Rabeta','Link Text'=>'Rabeta\'r Leká','Link directly to event on day with single event?'=>'Eke Ivent thaka din\'ot Ivent\'r sidha rabeta dhalo?','Link sub-site %s directly to sub-site?'=>'Sub-site %s sorasori sub-site\'ot link koribo?','Link text used for link to user bookings.'=>'Estemalgoróya booking-or rabeta-r lagi estemal hoa rabeta leká.','List'=>'Liís','List %s'=>'%s list','List Limits'=>'List Limit','List bookings'=>'Booking list','List event tickets'=>'Ivent ticket list','List events'=>'Ivent list','List events by date title'=>'Tarík\'r lokób diya Ivent liís goró','List footer format'=>'Liís Tola format','List header format'=>'Liís Matá format','List item footer format'=>'Liís jiníc-ór Tola format','List item format'=>'Liís jiníc\'r Cokól','List item header format'=>'Liís jiníc-ór Matá format','List location countries'=>'Jaga-or desh list','List location regions'=>'Jaga-or region list','List location states'=>'Jaga-or state list','List location towns'=>'Jaga-or sháor list','List locations'=>'Jaga list','Load minified %s files?'=>'Minified %s file load koríba?','Load minified/compressed files, reducing the file size, load times and bandwidth usage on your site.'=>'Minified/compressed file load koró, file maf, load somoy ar bandwidth estemal komaiba.','Loading Map....'=>'Map Load hórér....','Loading...'=>'Load hóiyé...','Loads our own JS file if no other dependencies are already loaded, which is still needed for many items generated by EM using JavaScript such as Calendars, Maps and Booking Forms/Buttons'=>'Onno dependency aagot load na thakíle amár nijor JS file load kore, zeta Calendar, Nokśa ar Booking Form/Button\'ór moton JavaScript diya EM\'ór baniya kora bohu jiníc\'ór lagi ekhono dorkar','Location'=>'Jaga','Location ID.'=>'Jaga ID.','Location Image'=>'Jaga Fothú','Location Name'=>'Jaga Nam','Location Related Placeholders'=>'Jaga Sombondhíya Placeholder ókkol','Location Submission Forms'=>'Jaga Submission Form','Location Type'=>'Jaga-ór Kisím','Location Types'=>'Jaga\'r Kisím','Location balloon format'=>'Jaga balun cokól','Location coordinates'=>'Jaga\'r coordinate','Location could not be deleted.'=>'Jaga haçifélo gorí parlam na.','Location could not be saved.'=>'Jaga save gorí parlam na.','Location data is invalid.'=>'Jaga data valid nai.','Location map and coordinates have been updated. Please re-save your location to update the map.'=>'Jaga\'r map aar coordinate kiórzana hoijjé. Map kiórzana gorór lagi mehrobani goria tuáñr jaga abar bórieró.','Location name'=>'Jaga\'r nam','Location name and address'=>'Jaga\'r nam ar thíkana','Location not found'=>'Jaga fawa zae nai','Location not found, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Jaga pawa zai nái, tai upload kora fothú ítár featured fothú hisabe thik hoí nái.','Location not found.'=>'Jaga pawa zai nái.','Location pages'=>'Jaga sófa óll','Locations'=>'Jaga','Locations imported from CSV files'=>'CSV file-tún import hoa jaga','Locations list page'=>'Jaga liís sófa','Locations list settings'=>'Jaga liís séthín ókkol','Locations on main blog?'=>'Main blog\'ot Jaga?','Locations submitted by guest users are not included, unless they are linked to events also submitted by them.'=>'Guest estemalgoróya-r submit kora Jaga dhukibó na, zodi na ózi tára submit kora Ivent-or shaithe zuri.','Log'=>'Log','Log In'=>'Bútore Gólo','Log in if you already have an account with us.'=>'Amar logé akaunt thakile bútore gólo goró.','Logged In Users'=>'Bútore gólá Estemalgoróya ókkol','Longitude'=>'Deshantor','Looking for the rest of the FullCalendar Options? They\'ve moved <a href="%s">here</a>, the options below are for overriding specific bits relevant to Events Manager.'=>'FullCalendar-or baki option óll khujíse? Ítá <a href="%s">ukhane</a> sorise, nise-or option óll Events Manager-or lagi nirdisto kisu ongsho overrite gorár lagi.','Lost your password?'=>'Húfiawaádh haraiyó?','Mail sending method'=>'Mail fatibar poddhoti','Main Search Fields'=>'Main Tua Field Ókkol','Main recurrence set %s are required.'=>'Asol bar bar hoa set %s dorkar.','Make this the default view.'=>'Eitare asási soó bonai de.','Makes Events Manager translatable with WPML, including tickets, location addresses, booking forms and email templates. Supports recurring events and multisite. Requires WPML.'=>'Events Manager-ré WPML-ór logé translate gorte dei, ticket, jaga-ór thíkana, booking form aro email template shamil. Bar bar hoba ivent aro multisite support goré. WPML lagé.','Manage %s Bookings'=>'%s Booking Manejment Koro','Manage Person\'s Booking'=>'Manuh\'or Booking Manejment Koro','Manage booking: %s'=>'Booking manage goró: %s','Manage bookings'=>'Booking manage goroó','Manage bookings link text'=>'Bookings manage rabeta leká','Manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and other related features.'=>'Ivent, booking, Jaga, ticket ar onno related feature manage goroó.','Manage in your account'=>'Apnar account-ót manage goró','Manage licenses'=>'License manage goró','Manage my bookings'=>'Amar booking ókkol dékó','Many themes display extra meta information on post pages such as \'posted by\' or \'post date\' information, which may not be desired. Usually, page templates contain less clutter.'=>'Bohu tehm poigam sófa\'ót \'posted by\' yá \'post date\'r moton ekstra meta tothyo dekhai, zeta dorkar nai oya paré. Shadharon sófa nomuna\'ót kom jhamela thaké.','Map'=>'Nokśa','Map Unavailable'=>'Map Moujut Nai','Maps'=>'Nokśa óll','Match the needed columns, then update the preview.'=>'Lagiya column ókkol milaó, tarpor preview update goró.','Max'=>'Beshi','Max events shown per calendar day (0 = no limit).'=>'Prottek calendar din-ót zíyada kotu Ivent dahano zaibó (0 = hodd nai).','Max events shown per calendar day (0 = no limit; blank = site default).'=>'Prottek calendar din-ót zíyada kotu Iven