alada hoóa lagibo.','Note: %s'=>'Nuth: %s','Notfication email?'=>'Notification email?','Nothing, migrate the tickets only'=>'Kichu na, shudhu ticket migrate goró','Notification sender address'=>'Notification fataniya\'r thíkana','Notification sender name'=>'Notification fataniya\'r nam','Notification types'=>'Notification kisím óll','Notify admin email(s)'=>'Admin email notify goró','Now there are #_BOOKEDSPACES spaces reserved, #_AVAILABLESPACES are still available.'=>'Ekhon #_BOOKEDSPACES Jaga booking hoiyé, #_AVAILABLESPACES Jaga ekkono moujut asé.','Number of events'=>'Ivent-ór sóngkha','Number of locations'=>'Jaga-ór sóngkha','OAuth application information incomplete.'=>'OAuth application tothyo adhura.','On'=>'Ót','On by default hides the link of every virtual event until the default time below. Off by default only hides the link of an event that is given a time of its own.'=>'Default-ót chalu hoilé nisér default somoy porjonto prottek virtual ivent-ór link luwi rakhé. Default-ót bondo hoilé shudhu nijor somoy dewa ivent-ór link luwi rakhé.','Once a booking has been made, you can also allow a user to RSVP that booking, which confirms their intention of attending. This can be independent of the booking status itself.'=>'Ekbar booking kora hoile, tumi estemalgoróya-ke oi booking RSVP gorar ózazot dibó paro, zegula tahar attend gorar iccha nicchit goré. Ei booking hásiyot theke alada hoite paré.','Once cancelled, you can allow susers to re-instate their booking, provided there are still enough spaces.'=>'Kenselgoró hoar fisé, jothesto jaga thakile tumi estemalgoróya ókkolke tahar booking abar cálu gorit dibó paro.','Once you have entered valid API information, you will see a button below to connect your site to %s.'=>'Thik API khobor dewa\'r fisé, tuáñr sáith %s\'ót connect gorór lagi nise ekkún button dekhíbó.','One Line'=>'Eke Lain','Online bookings are not available for this event.'=>'Ei Ivent\'or lagi online booking moujut nai.','Only %1$d space is left for %2$s.'=>'Khali %1$d jaga %2$s-or lagi baki asé.','Only show events starting within a certain time limit on the events page. Default is future events with no end time limit.'=>'Ivent sófa\'ót khali ek nirdisto somoy sima\'ór modhe súru oya Ivent dahá. Asási oiyé sesh somoy sima nai oya aasiya thaka Ivent.','Only show this link to attendees with virtual access'=>'Ei link shudhu virtual access asé attendee-ré dekhaó','Only site admins see these changes.'=>'Khali site admin ókkole ei bodol soó.','Only the selected countries will be included in the country selection list. This takes precedence over excluded countries.'=>'Khali basílo kora desh óll desh basílo liís\'ót thakiba. Zeta baáre rakha desh\'ór upor ogroadhikar pai.','Option value has been reverted. Please save your settings for it to take effect.'=>'Option\'r mullo fisé gelo. Eita kajot lagibar lagi mehrobani goria tuáñr séthín ókkol bórieró.','Optional PHP date format for timeslot dates. Leave blank to use the default event date format. Example: %s'=>'Timeslot tarík-or lagi optional PHP date cokól. Asási ivent tarík cokól estemal gorit khali rakó. Udaharon: %s','Optional PHP date format for timeslot times. Leave blank to use the default event time format. Example: %s'=>'Timeslot wokt-or lagi optional PHP date cokól. Asási ivent wokt cokól estemal gorit khali rakó. Udaharon: %s','Options'=>'Option ókkol','Order'=>'Tortíb','Order By'=>'Sajibar Ovittí','Order Tickets By'=>'Ticket Ókkol Order Goró','Order by'=>'Sajibar Ovittí','Order by %s'=>'%s osile sazó','Order by end date, end time, then event name'=>'Sesh tarík, sesh somoy, tarpor Ivent\'ór nam hisabe sajo','Order by event name, then event start time'=>'Ivent nam onuzayi order goró, tarpor Ivent start wokt','Order by event start time, then event name'=>'Ivent start wokt onuzayi order goró, tarpor Ivent nam','Order by name'=>'Nam hisabe sajo','Order by name, end date, then end time'=>'Nam, sesh tarík, tarpor sesh somoy hisabe sajo','Order by name, start date, then start time'=>'Nam, súru\'r tarík, tarpor súru\'r somoy hisabe sajo','Order by start date, start time'=>'Súru\'r tarík, súru\'r somoy hisabe sajo','Order by start date, start time, then event name'=>'Súru\'r tarík, súru\'r somoy, tarpor Ivent\'ór nam hisabe sajo','Order of the locations'=>'Jaga ókkol-ór Tortíb','Organizer'=>'Organizer','Organizer name'=>'Organizer-ór nam','Organizer names'=>'Organizer-ór nam ókkol','Organizers'=>'Organizer ókkol','Organizers are shared between events and hold contact details. Show them with #_EVENTORGANIZERS or #_EVENTORGANIZERSLIST.'=>'Organizer ókkol ivent-ór moddhe share hoi aro contact biboron rakhé. #_EVENTORGANIZERS ba #_EVENTORGANIZERSLIST-ór logé dekhaó.','Organizers imported from CSV files'=>'CSV file-tún import hoa organizer','Orphaned events may show on your event lists but not point to real event pages, and can be deleted.'=>'Orphaned ivent ókkol tuáñr ivent list-t dekha zaite paré kintu asol ivent sófat rabeta nai, ar ou haçifélo zaite paré.','Other'=>'Onno','Our CSS file will be EXCLUDED on all of these pages. Takes precedence over inclusion rules.'=>'Amár CSS file ei beggún sófa\'ót BAÁRE rakha zaiba. Dhaló kora niyom\'ór upor ogroadhikar pai.','Our CSS file will only be INCLUDED on all of these pages.'=>'Amár CSS file khali ei beggún sófa\'ót DHALÓ hoba.','Our theme has multiple CSS variables that can be overriden easily. The options below could be overriden just as easily via one line of CSS in your %s settings area, for example %s'=>'Amár tehm\'ót bohu CSS variable asé zeta shoze override kora zai. Níce\'r opshon ókkol tuáñr %s séthín bhag\'ót ek line CSS diyao ekdom shoze override koría paró, zémon %s','Output format (advanced)'=>'Output cokól (torkigoijjá)','Override Default Formats?'=>'Asási Cokól Override Goró?','Override Defaults'=>'Asási Override Goró','Override Excerpts with Formats?'=>'Nuthgoró Ókkol Cokól Diya Override Goró?','Override calendar on events page?'=>'Ivent sófa-t kelendhar overrite goróm?','