=>'Review-ór opekkhat pending','Performance Optimization'=>'Hamdóon Optimization','Permalink Slug'=>'Permalink Slug','Permalink Slugs'=>'Permalink Slug óll','Permalink slug must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens and forward slashes.'=>'Permalink slug-t khali choto hórof, number, hyphen ar forward slash thakibo.','Permanently deletes an Events Manager booking.'=>'Ek Events Manager booking sórai haçifélo gore.','Personal Details'=>'Niji Details','Personal details have successfully been modified.'=>'Personal details bhalo kore bodolaá goríse.','Phone'=>'Fon','Phone Number'=>'Fon Nómbor','Phone Numbers'=>'Phone Number óll','Phone number'=>'Phone Number','Phone numbers can be used for further contact for both those that make bookings and submit events. We offer an advanced international-compatible phone input field with multiple options which standardize and ensure valid/consistent international phone numbers are provided by your users.'=>'Booking dayok ar Ivent zomá dayok duitor lagi aro zogazog\'ór lagi Phone Number estemal koría paré. Amra bohu opshon oya ek unnoto antorzatik-compatible phone input field dí, zéta tuáñr estemalgoróya óll\'ór dey antorzatik Phone Number sotik ar ekrokom oyar niskoyota dey.','Physical'=>'Asol','Physical Locations'=>'Physical Jaga','Physical Spaces'=>'Physical Jaga','Physical Venue'=>'Asol Jaga','Pie Chart'=>'Pai Cart','Pills'=>'Pills','Pixelite'=>'Pixelite','Placeholders for customizing event pages'=>'Ivent sófa mozin koribar lagi Placeholder ókkol','Placeholders: %1$s and %2$s plus the usual booking placeholders.'=>'Placeholder: %1$s aar %2$s aar sadharon booking placeholder.','Please <a href="%s">Log In</a> to view your bookings.'=>'Tuár Booking soibar lagi doya kori <a href="%s">Bútore gólo</a>.','Please add a User ID.'=>'Ek Estemalgoróya ID ezafágoró.','Please check the communications consent box so we can contact you if necessary.'=>'Dorkar hoile amara añáre zogazog goron lagi zogazog\'or manjuri box\'ot tik dió.','Please check the consent box so we can collect and store your submitted information.'=>'Tuáñr submit kora khobor collect ar store gorár lagi consent box check goroó.','Please choose a virtual platform for this event.'=>'Ei ivent-ór lagi ekta virtual platform basó.','Please confirm that you wish to withdraw from the following booking. This step submits your declaration of withdrawal.'=>'Doya kori confirm goró tuí nićé-ór Booking-ór fon óttu Withdraw goribá chao. Ei dhafa tuár withdrawal-ór ghosona jomá dey.','Please enter a valid URL for this event location.'=>'Mehrobani goria ei ivent jaga\'r lagi thik URL dió.','Please enter a valid URL.'=>'Ek valid URL dioó.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Ek valid B-ciñçír Thíkana dioó.','Please enter a valid phone number.'=>'Mehrobani goria thik phone nombor dió.','Please enter a valid ticket price e.g. 10.50 (no currency signs)'=>'Mehrobani goria thik ticket dam dió zemon 10.50 (currency sin nái)','Please enter dates and times for your first recurrence pattern in the recurrence section.'=>'Bar bar hoa section-ót tuár fóila bar bar hoa pattern-ór tarík ar Somoy dió.','Please enter your Location ID, or leave blank for no location.'=>'Tuáñr Jaga ID dió, yá kunu Jaga na lagíle khali rakó.','Please enter your Location ID.'=>'Tuáñr Jaga ID dió.','Please fill in all required fields correctly.'=>'Doya gori sob dorkari field thik bhabe puron goró.','Please provide a dashicons class, url to a png/svg file, or leave blank for default menu icon.'=>'Doya gori ekta dashicons class, png/svg file-or url dó, yá asási mínu icon-or lagi khali rakó.','Please provide a valid phone number.'=>'Ek valid Phone Number dioó.','Please provide some link text for this event location URL.'=>'Mehrobani goria ei ivent jaga URL\'r lagi kisu rabeta leká dió.','Please select a valid location.'=>'Mehrobani goria ekkún thik jaga basílo goró.','Please select at least one space to proceed with your booking.'=>'Booking cholibar lagi kom hoile ekta Jaga basílo goró.','Please specify what days of the week this event should occur on.'=>'Mehrobani goria ei ivent hótu hótu dinot hóibo zanai dió.','Please supply a valid email format.'=>'Mehrobani goria thik email cokól dió.','Please update your network and when you\'re happy with the changes you can also finalize the migration by deleting unecessary data in the %s page.'=>'Tuáñr network kiórzana goró, bodol thík lagile %s sófa\'ot dorkar nai data haçifélaiye migration sesh goron pare.','Please upload a valid txt file containing Events Manager import settings.'=>'Events Manager import séthín thaka ekta thik txt fail upload koro.','Please visit the %s to see migration options.'=>'Migration option dékibar lagi %s dékó.','Please wait while the booking is being submitted.'=>'Booking jomá hoibar somoi mehrobani goria opekkha goró.','Plural'=>'Bohubocon','Plural version of the Custom Post Type (CPT) name, used internally.'=>'Custom Post Type (CPT) nam-or bohubocon version, bitore estemal hoy.','Plural version of the Custom Post Type name, used internally.'=>'Custom Post Type nam-or bohubocon version, bitore estemal hoy.','Plural version of the Type Key, used internally. For example, workshop would be workshops.'=>'Type Key-or bohubocon version, bitore estemal hoy. Zemon, workshop-or bohubocon workshops.','Popular %s'=>'Mocóur %s','Popular Event Categories'=>'Mocóur Ivent Kisím óll','Popular Event Tags'=>'Mocóur Ivent Hót óll','Post Classes'=>'Post Class óll','Postcode'=>'Postcode','Preparing'=>'Toiyar hoitaasé','Prevent unnecessary loading of JavaScript files on pages where they are not needed.'=>'Zei sófa\'ót dorkar nai tát JavaScript file proyojonhin load roko.','Preview Formats'=>'Agorisoó Cokól Ókkol','Preview Start Times'=>'Shuru-ór Somoy Agorisoó','Preview mode is enabled. Only site admins will see the difference, our new default formats will be used instead of your current formats. You can continue to edit/save this settings page without overwriting saved settings.'=>'Preview mode Enable asé. Khali site admin ókkole fark dekhibó, tuár hála format-ór fobi amrar notun asási format estemal hoibó. Saved séthín ókkol overwrite na kori tuí ei séthín ókkol sófa Sóiyigoró/Bórieró gorité fare.','Previous Period'=>'Fisór Somoy','Previous Year'=>'Fisór Bosór','Previous page'=>'Ágér sófa','Price'=>'Dam','Pricing'=>'Dam ókkol','Privacy Consent'=>'Razdari Consent','Privacy Policy and Consent'=>'Privacy Policy ar Consent','Pro Add-On'=>'Pro Add-On','Pro installs alongside the free Events Manager plugin. Every license includes one year of updates and Pro support.'=>'Pro muft Events Manager plugin-ór logé install hoi. Prottek license-ót ek bosór-ór update aro Pro support asé.','Processing ...'=>'Cholé ...','Profile'=>'Prófail','Progress'=>'Ogróti','Provide one of `id`, `source_url`, `content_base64`, or a multipart `file` upload.'=>'`id`, `source_url`, `content_base64` yá multipart `file` upload-or ek dioó.','Published'=>'Prokash hoiyé','Published Event'=>'Baáirgoijjá Ivent','Push notifications for the <a href="%s">mobile app</a>. When enabled, registered devices receive real-time pushes for bookings and events on this site, and the app exposes per-type notification preferences to the user.'=>'<a href="%s">mobile app</a>\'ór lagi Push notification. Enable oíle rejicthor kora device ei sáith\'ór Booking ar Ivent\'ór lagi real-time push pai, ar app estemalgoróya\'ke pratek notification kisím\'ór pochondo dey.','QR code check-in from your phone'=>'Apnar fon-tún QR code check-in','Quantity'=>'Gonti','RSS'=>'RSS','RSS Scope'=>'RSS Moidan','RSS description format'=>'RSS tofsil cokól','RSS limit'=>'RSS sima','RSS main description'=>'RSS\'ór asol tofsil','RSS main title'=>'RSS\'ór asol lokób','RSS title format'=>'RSS lokób cokól','RSVP'=>'RSVP','RSVP - %s'=>'RSVP - %s','RSVP Modifications'=>'RSVP Bodolo Ókkol','RSVP Status'=>'RSVP Hásiyot','RSVP Syncing'=>'RSVP Sinking','Re-Check Updates'=>'Kiórzana Aro Check Goró','Re-Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'Abbar Submit goijjá Ivent, Manjuri\'r Aguwa','Re-order.'=>'Notun kori sajó.','Read more on our blog'=>'Amar blog-t aro poró','Read our announcement'=>'Amar ghoshona poró','Read-only abilities for retrieving Events Manager events, locations, bookings, categories, and tags.'=>'Events Manager-or Ivent, Jaga, booking, category ar hót anar lagi read-only ability.','Reason (optional)'=>'Karon (zoruri noi)','Received on: %s'=>'Fawar tarík: %s','Received: %s'=>'Fawa: %s','Recent Bookings'=>'Taza Booking óll','Recent Events Manager updates have made security improvements to how events are output, specifically with Shortcodes. The result is that some shortcode created prior to these updates will be displayed as raw/escaped HTML rather than content.'=>'Taza Events Manager kiórzana ókkol ivent output hoibar poddhoti\'ot, bises kori Shortcode\'ot, razdari bála koriyé. Ihar karone ei kiórzana\'r agór banano kunu kunu shortcode content\'or bodole raw/escaped HTML hisabe dahá hoibo.','Reconnect'=>'Aker Connect goró','Recurrence %s'=>'Bar bar hoa %s','Recurrence %s cannot start after they end.'=>'Bar bar hoa %s sesh hoba\'r agei suru hóite fáribó ná.','Recurrence Interval'=>'Bar bar hoa Fargu','Recurrences'=>'Bar bar hoa','Recurrences last all day.'=>'Bar bar hoa beggún din cole.','Recurrences that currently take place within new unavailable dates will be %s'=>'Notun moujut na hoa tarík-ór moddhe aijjá bar bar hoa ókkol %s hoibó','Recurrences will end on:'=>'Bar bar hoa ei tarík-ót sesh hoibó:','Recurrences will span between:'=>'Bar bar hoa ei duitta-ór moddhe hoibó:','Recurrences will start from:'=>'Bar bar hoa ei óttu shuru hoibó:','Recurring'=>'Bar bar hoba','Recurring %s'=>'Bar bar hoba %s','Recurring Event'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent','Recurring Events'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent óll','Recurring Events Picker'=>'Bar Bar Hoba Ivent Ókkol Picker','Recurring events (Pro)'=>'Bar bar hoba ivent (Pro)','Recurring events allow you to create one event page with recurring dates on the same page. Recurrences have their own bookings assigned to them, but can be linked with shared tickets.'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent\'ór dará ek Ivent sófa\'ót bar bar hoba tarík rakha zai. Pratek bar bar hoa\'r nijor Booking thaké, kintu shared Ticket\'ór sáthe zug kora zai.','Recurring events have a picker in order to load the right booking form, choose your picker style for your booking forms.'=>'Bar bar hoba ivent ókkolor thik booking form load gorar lagi ekta picker asé, tuáñr booking form ókkolor lagi picker-or style basílo goró.','Redirect any other old addresses, such as single dates of recurring events, series pages and calendar views, once The Events Calendar is deactivated'=>'The Events Calendar bondo hoilé onno puráná thíkana, jeméne bar bar hoba ivent-ór ekbocon tarík, series sófa aro kelendhar view redirect goró','Refresh'=>'Aker Load goró','Region'=>'Region','Region:'=>'Elaka:','Registration Email Templates'=>'Registration B-ciñçí Nomuna Ókkol','Registration Information'=>'Registration Tothyo','Registration email'=>'Registration B-ciñçí','Registration email subject'=>'Registration B-ciñçí\'r subject','Reject'=>'Rejected','Rejected'=>'Rejected','Rejected booking email'=>'Rejected booking B-ciñçí','Remember Me'=>'Añáre Yadráko','Remember and hide checkbox'=>'Mone rakhó ar checkbox luwa','Remember and show checkbox'=>'Mone rakhó ar checkbox dahá','Remember filtering options'=>'Filter option ókkol moné rakho','Remember these settings'=>'Ei séthín ókkol moné rakho','Remembering Consent'=>'Consent Mone Rakha','Remove'=>'Larifélo','Remove Image'=>'Fothú Larifélo','Remove Orphaned Events'=>'Orphaned Ivent Ókkol Larifélo','Remove or reorder columns below.'=>'Nise\'r thúni óll larifélo yá abar odhargoró.','Remove this recurrence.'=>'Ei bar bar hoa Larifélo.','Remove this ticket booking'=>'Ei ticket booking larifélo','Rename %s?'=>'%s nam bodolo goribó?','Renew license'=>'License renew goró','Renew or upgrade'=>'Renew ba upgrade goró','Repeat a number of times'=>'Kéto bar repeat goró','Repeat interval "%s" is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'Repeat interval "%s" 1 ba taar beshi ekta puro gon nai.','Repeat interval (every 1, 2, 3 ...)'=>'Repeat interval (prottek 1, 2, 3 ...)','Repeat on day of the month (1 to 31, or last)'=>'Mash-ór din-ót repeat goró (1 tún 31, ba last)','Repeat on these dates'=>'Ei tarík ókkol-ót repeat goró','Repeat on week of the month (first to fourth, or last)'=>'Mash-ór hopta-ót repeat goró (first tún fourth, ba last)','Repeat on weekdays'=>'Hopta-ór din ókkol-ót repeat goró','Repeat rules Events Manager does not have'=>'Events Manager-ór nai ói repeat rule ókkol','Repeat until (date)'=>'Bar bar hoba (tarík) porzonto','Repeat value "%s" is not understood. Use daily, weekly, monthly or yearly.'=>'Bar bar hoba mullo "%s" bujha zay na. daily, weekly, monthly ba yearly bebohar goró.','Repeated events are similar to recurrences, but each event is independent of each other with its own page on your site and entirely separate bookings. You can mass-edit the recurrences by editing your repeating event.'=>'Repeat kora Ivent bar bar hoa\'r moton, kintu pratek Ivent ekke\'r óttu alada, tuáñr sáith\'ót nijor sófa ar sompurno alada Booking thaké. Repeat Ivent sóiyi koríle sob bar bar hoa ekshonge sóiyi koría paró.','Repeating'=>'Bar bar hoba','Repeating %s'=>'Bar bar hoba %s','Repeating Event'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent','Repeating Events'=>'Bar Bar Hoba Ivent','Repeating Events Template'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent Nomuna','Repeats'=>'Bar bar hoy','Repeats (daily, weekly, monthly or yearly)'=>'Bar bar hoy (daily, weekly, monthly ba yearly)','Replace TEC shortcodes and blocks in posts and pages with Events Manager equivalents'=>'Post ar sófa óllot TEC shortcode ar block óll Events Manager\'or somanor dhi bodol goró','Require locations for events?'=>'Ivent\'ór lagi Jaga dorkar?','Required'=>'Dorkar','Required?'=>'Zoruri?','Reschedule'=>'Notun Somoy Dió','Reschedule %s Times?'=>'%s Somoy Notun kori Dió?','Reschedule Events'=>'Ivent Reschedule goroó','