 by ID if visible to the current user.'=>'Ekhonkar estemalgoróya-r dekhá gele ID diye ek booking ane.','Retrieves tickets for one Events Manager event.'=>'Ek Events Manager Ivent-or ticket ane.','Returns countries with their ISO-3166 alpha-2 code and translated display name. By default returns the full ISO list — useful for populating a country picker. Pass `only_available: true` to narrow the result to countries that have at least one stored location row.'=>'Desh óll ISO-3166 alpha-2 code ar anubad kora nam shaithe ane. Asási hisabe puro ISO list dee, desh basanir lagi kam lage. Zé desh-t kómot ek Jaga row save asé khali ítá dekhanir lagi `only_available: true` dioó.','Returns the distinct list of region names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` to narrow results to one country.'=>'Events Manager Jaga-t thaka alada region nam-or list ane. Ek desh-or lagi sími korar lagi `country` dioó.','Returns the distinct list of state/province names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` and/or `region` to narrow results.'=>'Events Manager Jaga-t thaka alada state/province nam-or list ane. Sími korar lagi `country` ar/yá `region` dioó.','Returns the distinct list of town/city names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country`, `region`, and/or `state` to narrow results.'=>'Events Manager Jaga-t thaka alada town/city nam-or list ane. Sími korar lagi `country`, `region` ar/yá `state` dioó.','Returns the exact fields, payload locations, payment options, and a ready-to-submit example payload needed to create a booking for one event. Call this before create-booking.'=>'Ek Ivent-or booking banaár lagi lagbó field óll, payload-or jaga, payment option ar submit-or lagi toiyar example payload ane. Create-booking-or agó ei call goroó.','Revert to viewing your previously saved fromats.'=>'Agor Bórieragiyé format ókkol soibar lagi Wapesgoró.','Revoked'=>'Bátil kora','Right of Withdrawal (EU)'=>'Fira nóuar Dendháke (EU)','Rings'=>'Rings','Roll back'=>'Fisé zao','Rollback'=>'Fisé Zaó','Rolled back'=>'Fisé gelo','Row'=>'Sar','Rows imported'=>'Import hoiyé row ókkol','Rows skipped'=>'Sharia dewa row ókkol','Run again (sync changes)'=>'Aker chalu goró (bodol sync goró)','Running…'=>'Chalu hoitaasé…','SMTP Encryption'=>'SMTP Encryption','SMTP authentication is often needed. If you use Gmail, make sure to set this parameter to Yes'=>'SMTP authentication proy dorkar hoi. Jodi tuí Gmail estemal koros, ei parameter Ói-ot set koribo lagibo','SMTP password'=>'SMTP húfiawaádh','SMTP username'=>'SMTP estemalgoróya\'r nam','Sale Averages'=>'Sale Average ókkol','Sales'=>'Bikri','Same as <em>Date Format</em>, but this is used for the datepickers used by Events Manager.'=>'<em>Tarík or Cokól</em>\'r moto, kintu Events Manager\'r datepicker ókkol\'ot ei bebohar hoy.','Same concept as the body classes option, but some themes also use the <code>post_class()</code> function within page content to differentiate styling between post types.'=>'Body class opshon\'ór moton ekki dharona, kintu kunu kunu tehm sófa hazorjiníc\'ór modhe <code>post_class()</code> function\'o estemal koría poigam kisím\'ór moddhe styling alada kore.','Sanitize shortcode content?'=>'Shortcode hazorjiníc sanitize goribó?','Save'=>'Bórieró','Save %d%%'=>'%d%% bachao','Save Changes'=>'Change Save Koro','Save Settings'=>'Séthín Bórieró','Save Ticket'=>'Ticket Bórieró','Save imported events and locations as'=>'Import hoiya ivent ar jaga óll ei hisabe bórieró','Save your settings for this to take effect!'=>'Oita kaam goribar lagi tuáñr séthín bórieró!','Saved, but the featured image could not be attached: %s. To fix it: call upload-media (use content_base64 if the source blocks server-side fetches, e.g. Unsplash), then either pass featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location on that same upload-media call, or pass the returned attachment id as featured_image to update-event / update-location.'=>'Save hoise, kintu featured fothú attach gorí parlam na: %s. Thik gorár lagi: upload-media call goroó (zodi guijja server-side fetch block gore, zemon Unsplash, content_base64 bebohar goroó), tarpore ei upload-media call-t featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location dioó, nahole phirti aá attachment id update-event / update-location-t featured_image hisabe dioó.','Scope'=>'Moidan','Scope of the locations'=>'Jaga ókkol-ór Moidan','Scope of the locations?'=>'Jaga ókkol-ór Moidan?','Search'=>'Tua','Search %s'=>'%s Tua','Search %s...'=>'%s Tua...','Search Event Categories'=>'Ivent Kisím óll Tua','Search Event Tags'=>'Ivent Hót óll Tua','Search Events'=>'Ivent Tua','Search Filter Label'=>'Tua Filter Label','Search Form'=>'Tua Form','Search Forms'=>'Tua Form óll','Search Locations'=>'Jaga Tua','Search Repeating Events'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent Tua','Search Results View Type'=>'Tuar Rizalt Dehaba\'r Kisím','Search bookings'=>'Booking tua','Search button text'=>'Tua button\'r HTML Leká','Search form will be pre-selected with this country.'=>'Tua form\'ot ei desh age thaki basílo goróya thakibo.','Search forms'=>'Tua form óll','Searching...'=>'Tuíre...','See All'=>'Beggún Dékó','See original translation.'=>'Mul torjuma dékó.','Select Location'=>'Jaga Basílo','Select a Timezone to reset all your blog events to.'=>'Tuáñr sob bologsáith ivent ókkol reset gorar lagi ekta Timezone basílo goró.','Select a blog and click the button next to it to clean up that specific blog. You must clean up one blog at a time.'=>'Ekta bologsáith basílo goro ar ou bologsáith-or pasot button-t click gori ou bologsáith cleanup goró. Tumi ekbarot ekta bologsáith cleanup gorit hoibo.','Select a blog...'=>'Ekta bologsáith basílo goró...','Select a date'=>'Tarík basílo goró','Select a group you admin to attach this event to it. Note that all other admins of that group can modify the booking.'=>'Ei Ivent gróp-ót lagaibar lagi tuí zei gróp-ór admin ói, ouddá basílo. Ei gróp-ór baki admin ókkole Booking Bodolo goritte fare.','Select a time'=>'Somoy basílo goró','Select date range'=>'Tarík range basílo','Select dates'=>'Tarík Basílo','Select number of spaces'=>'Jaga\'r gon basílo goró','Select the booking you wish to withdraw from.'=>'Tuí zei Booking-ór fon óttu Withdraw goribá chao, ouddá basílo.','Select the editor type you\'d like to use for submitting content in your dashboard.'=>'Tuáñr dashboard\'ót hazorjiníc zomá deyar lagi kon edhithar estemal koríba tá basílo koró.','Select the method to send email notification.'=>'Email notification fatibar poddhoti basílo.','Select the options below and export all the records you have currently filtered (all pages) into a spreadsheet format.'=>'Nise\'r option ókkol basílo goria, tuáñr filter goróya beggún record (beggún sófa) spreadsheet cokól\'ót export goró.','Select the view types a user can select to display on the default search form, you can override this selection using the %s argument in shortcodes and PHP functions.'=>'Estemalgoróya asási tua form\'ot kon soó kisím basílo goribo, oita basílo goró. Shortcode ar PHP function\'ot %s argument diya ei basílo override goróno zay.','Select which archetypes this site will use and choose a default type.'=>'Ei sáith kon archetype ókkol estemal goribo basílo goro ar ekta asási kisím basílo goró.','Select yes to allow bookings and tickets for events.'=>'Ivent\'ór lagi Booking ar Ticket anumoti deyar lagi Ói basílo koró.','Select yes to disable Events Manager from enabling thumbnails (some themes may already have this enabled, which we cannot be turned off here).'=>'Events Manager\'ke thumbnail enable koríte na dibar lagi Ói basílo koró (kunu kunu tehm\'ót aagot enable asé oya paré, zéta ekhane bon kora zaiba na).','Select yes to enable the attributes feature'=>'Attribute feature enable koríte Ói basílo koró','Select yes to enable the category features'=>'Kisím feature enable koríte Ói basílo koró','Select yes to enable the tag features'=>'Hót feature enable koríte Ói basílo koró','Select yes to select location from a drop-down menu; location selection will be faster, but you will lose the ability to insert locations with events'=>'Drop-down mínu óttu Jaga basílo koríte Ói basílo koró; Jaga basílo tará-tari oiba, kintu Ivent\'ór sáthe Jaga dhaló koríbar khomota hárai zaiba','Sell event tickets through your WooCommerce cart and checkout, with bookings kept in sync with orders, and take payment with any gateway WooCommerce supports. Sold separately on Woo.com and not included in Pro Plus.'=>'Tomar WooCommerce cart ar checkout-ot ivent\'or ticket bikri goró, booking order\'or loge sync thakibo, ar WooCommerce\'or sofort kora zekono gateway-ot dam niyo. Woo.com-ot alada bikri hoy, Pro Plus-ot nai.','Send Email'=>'Email Fatá','Send HTML Emails?'=>'HTML Email Fatibo?','Send cancelled booking email?'=>'Kenselgoró oya Booking email pathaiba?','Sends a general email to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled, which is customized in your %s setings.'=>'Kenselgoró oya Ivent\'ór beggún confirmed ar pending Booking\'ke ek aám email pathai, zéta tuáñr %s séthín ókkot háaic mozin sethgoró zai.','Sent to the consumer as the legally-required acknowledgment of receipt. It records the withdrawal statement and the exact date and time of receipt, and confirms receipt only — not the validity of the withdrawal.'=>'Ainí dorkar acknowledgment of receipt hisabe consumer\'ót fathano hoi. Eita withdrawal statement aar fawa\'r thik tarík aar somoy record goré, aar khali fawa confirm goré — withdrawal thik hoba nó.','Separate %s with commas'=>'%s comma dia alada goró','Separate Range Inputs?'=>'Alada Moidan Input Ókkol?','Separate event categories with commas'=>'Ivent kisím óll comma dorí alada goró','Separate event tags with commas'=>'Ivent hót óll comma dorí alada goró','Series pass, paid with booking #%d'=>'Series pass, booking #%d dia dam deya hoiyé','Server API Credentials'=>'Server API Credentials','Set booking status'=>'Booking hásiyot thik goroó','Setting this to no will allow you to submit events without locations. You can use the <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> or <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> conditional placeholder to selectively display location information.'=>'No basílo koríle Jaga na dia Ivent zomá dia zaiba. Jaga\'r tothyo bachoniyábhabe dahaya <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> yá <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> conditional placeholder estemal koría paró.','Setting this to yes will also make your images crop efficiently with the %s feature in the %s plugin.'=>'Ói basílo koríle %s plugin\'ór %s feature diya tuáñr fothú óll bhalobhabe crop hoba.','Setting this to yes will make all events save in the main site event tables (EM must also be activated). This allows you to share events across different blogs, such as showing events in your network whilst allowing users to display and manage their events within their own blog. Bear in mind that activating this will mean old events created on the sub-blogs will not be accessible anymore, and if you switch back they will be but new events created during global events mode will only remain on the main site.'=>'Ei ói koile sob ivent main sáith\'or ivent table\'ot save hoibo (EM-o activate thakibo lagibo). Ihar karone tuí alada alada blog\'ot ivent share koribar fare, jemon network\'ot ivent dahá koribar somoy estemalgoróya ókkol nijor blog\'ot nijor ivent dahá ar manejment koribar fare. Mone rakhó jé ei activate koile sub-blog\'ot agé banano fur\'ana ivent ókkol aar paón jaibo na, ar fisé gele paón jaibo kintu global ivent mode\'ot banano noya ivent ókkol khali main sáith\'ot thakibo.','Setting this to yes will make categories display as a page rather than an archive.'=>'Ói kore dile category arkaiv-or bodole sófa hisabe dekha zaibo.','Settings'=>'Séthín ókkol','Settings > Emails'=>'Séthín ókkol > Email ókkol','Settings Page'=>'Séthín Sófa','Settings have been reset back to default. Your events, locations and categories have not been modified.'=>'Séthín ókkol asási\'ot fisé gesé. Tuañr ivent, jaga ar kisím bodolano hoi nai.','Settings imported.'=>'Séthín import hoise.','Shortcode HTML Entity Decoding'=>'Shortcode HTML Entity Decoding','Shortcodes and blocks'=>'Shortcode ar block óll','Shorten the calendar headings containing the days of the week, use 0 for the full name.'=>'Kelendhar\'r soptaho\'r din\'r matá chuto goró, pura nam\'r lagi 0 bebohar goró.','Show'=>'Dahá','Show "all events" link at bottom'=>'Tole "beggún Ivent" rabeta Dahá','Show Advanced Options'=>'Torkigoijjá Óll Dahá','Show Advanced Search'=>'Torkigoijjá Tua Dahá','Show Flags'=>'Pota Dahá','Show Long Events?'=>'Lamba Ivent Dahá?','Show Search'=>'Tua Dahá','Show Selected Dialcode'=>'Basílo kora Dialcode Dahá','Show all events link'=>'Beggún ivent-ór rabeta dahá','Show all events link at bottom?'=>'Tole "beggún Ivent" rabeta dahibó?','Show categories?'=>'Kisím óll dahá?','Show countries?'=>'Desh ókkol dahá?','Show date range?'=>'Tarík moidan dahá?','Show dates in timeslots?'=>'Timeslot-t tarík dekhaibó?','Show distance options?'=>'Dhur option dahá?','Show events search?'=>'Ivent tua dahaiba?','Show footer link?'=>'Footer rabeta dahá gorió?','Show form again?'=>'Form ar ekbar dekhaiba?','Show fully booked timeslots?'=>'Pura booking hoa timeslot ókkol dekhaibó?','Show geolocation search?'=>'Geolocation tua dahá?','Show hide/show trigger?'=>'Luwa/dahá trigger dahá?','Show how many locations?'=>'Kotó jaga dahá?','Show label'=>'Dahá label','Show list on day with single event?'=>'Eke Ivent thaka din\'ot liís dahá?','Show locations search?'=>'Jaga tuayí dekháibo?','Show long events'=>'Lomba Ivent Dahá','Show main search bar?'=>'Main tua bar dahá?','Show member-only tickets?'=>'Member-only ticket ókkol dekhaibó?','Show multiple tickets if logged out?'=>'Bútore gólo na thakile ekadhik ticket dekhaibó?','Show number of locations'=>'Jaga-ór sóngkha Dahá','Show regions?'=>'Region ókkol dahá?','Show search filters on page load'=>'Sófa load hoile search filter dahá','Show some love?'=>'Bálobasa dekhaiba?','Show sorting icon?'=>'Sorting icon dahá?','Show spaces left?'=>'Bakí jaga dekhaibó?','Show states?'=>'State ókkol dahá?','Show tags?'=>'Hót óll dahá?','Show text search?'=>'HTML Leká tua dahá?','Show the flag of the selected country code and in the country selection list of the phone input field.'=>'Basílo kora desh kudh\'ór pota ar phone input field\'ór desh basílo liís\'ót dahá.','Show the join link publicly, for example on the event page and in calendar feeds'=>'Join rabeta sobbaré dahá, zemon ivent sófa ar kelendhar feed-ot','Show the sorting icon to change the ordering of search results.'=>'Tua\'r result\'r order bodolaibar lagi sorting icon dahá.','Show ticket table in single ticket mode?'=>'Ekbocon ticket mode-t ticket thebíl dekhaibó?','Show towns/cities?'=>'Shohor/gaon ókkol dahá?','Show unavailable tickets?'=>'Moujut nai ticket ókkol dekhaibó?','Show upcoming timeslots on the initial booking form load before a visitor chooses a calendar date.'=>'Visitor kelendhar tarík basílo gorar age, prothom booking form load hoar somoy aguwa timeslot ókkol dekhó.','Show upcoming timeslots?'=>'Aguwa timeslot ókkol dekhaibó?','Show virtual events filter?'=>'Virtual ivent filter dahabo?','Show/Hide Filters'=>'Filter Dahá/Luwa','Shown in place of the link until then. %s is replaced with the number of minutes.'=>'Oto somoy porzonto rabeta\'r zaigat dahano hoy. %s miníth\'or songkhyar loge bodlano hoy.','Shows events, posts or other post types in an AJAX month, week or day calendar that visitors can filter by category or tag. Events Manager integrates with it automatically.'=>'Ivent, post ba onno post type AJAX mash, saptah ba din kelendhar-ot dahay, zeta visitor ókkol kisím ba hót dia filter goror fare. Events Manager eta\'r loge auto zuré.','Sign In'=>'Bútore Gólo','Sign Up'=>'Rejicthor Goró','Similar to label but used in instances when referring to one single %s type.'=>'Label-or moto kintu ekta %s kisím-or kotha koi somoy estemal hoy.','Since the event is recurring, you must specify an event end date greater than the start date.'=>'Ivent bar bar hoi bolé, tuáñre suru tarík\'r fisé sesh tarík dite lagibó.','Single'=>'Ekbocon','Single %s Format'=>'Ek %s Cokól','Single %s Page'=>'Eke %s Sófa','Single %s page format'=>'Eke %s sófa\'r cokól','Single %s title format'=>'Eke %s lokób\'r cokól','Single Location/Event Map Format'=>'Ek Jaga/Ivent Nokśa Cokól','Single dot'=>'Eke dot','Single ticket mode?'=>'Ekbocon ticket mode?','Site Categories'=>'Sáith\'r Kisím Óll','Site admins will be allowed to rename the base event and location %s on their individual sites.'=>'Sáith admin ókkol nizor sáith-t base ivent ar jaga %s nam bodolano ózazot pabo.','Skip rows already on this site: events with the same name and start, locations with the same name'=>'Ei site-ot asé row ókkol sharia dó: eki nam ar suru\'r ivent, eki nam\'or jaga óll','Skip the row'=>'Row sharia dó','Skipped'=>'Sharia dewa hoiyé','Slug'=>'Slug','Slugs'=>'Slug ókkol','Small'=>'Choto','Small Calendar'=>'Choto Kelendhar','Sold Out'=>'Sold Out','Some WordPress themes don\'t follow best practices when generating navigation menus, and so the automatic title rewriting feature may cause problems, if your menus aren\'t working correctly on the event pages, try setting this to \'Yes\', and provide an appropriate HTML title format below.'=>'Kunu kunu WordPress tehm navigation mínu baniya\'r somoy bhalo niyom mane na, tai automatic lokób rewrite feature somossa baniba paré. Ivent sófa\'ót tuáñr mínu thik kam na koríle \'Ói\' basílo koría níce uchit HTML lokób cokól dió.','Something went wrong saving your %s to the index table. Please inform a site administrator about this.'=>'Tuáñr %s index thebíl\'ót bórierér somoi kisu goblot hoijjé. Mehrobani goria sáith admin\'ót zanai dió.','Something went wrong with the recurrence update...'=>'Bar bar hoa kiórzana gorór somoi ekkún goblot hoijjé...','Sorting'=>'Sorting','Sorting Order'=>'Sajibar Tortíb','Spaces'=>'Jaga','Spaces confirmed'=>'Jaga confirmed','Split by timeslots?'=>'Timeslot onuzayi alada goró?','Spreadsheet'=>'Spreadsheet','Stack By'=>'Stack Koro','Stacked metaboxes'=>'Stack kora metabox óll','Standard'=>'Miyar','Standard Ticket'=>'Miyar Ticket','Start'=>'Suru goró','Start Date'=>'Suru Tarík','Start Time'=>'Suru Somoy','Start comparison date'=>'Tulona suru\'r tarík','Start date'=>'Suru tarík','Start import'=>'Import suru goró','Start migration'=>'Migration suru goró','Start time'=>'Suru somoy','Start time is required.'=>'Suru hoba\'r somoy dorkar.','Start/End'=>'Shuru/Sesh','Started'=>'Suru hoiyé','State'=>'State','State or province'=>'State ba province','State/County'=>'Rázyo/Zila','State/County:'=>'Rázzo/Kaunti:','Statistic Averages/Totals'=>'Statistic Average/Total','Status'=>'Hásiyot','Status reason'=>'Hásiyot\'or karon','Status: %s'=>'Hásiyot: %s','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager by subscribing to our newsletter!'=>'Amar newsletter-ot subscribe kori Events Manager\'or taza feature, tip ar khobor loi updated thako!','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager!'=>'Events Manager\'or taza feature, tip ar khobor loi updated thako!','Step 1 button'=>'Step 1 or button','Stopped on an error'=>'Bhul\'ót bondo hoiyé','Styling Options'=>'Styling Opshon óll','Sub Total'=>'Úpor Total','Submit %s'=>'%s Submit Goró','Submit Booking'=>'Booking Submit Goró','Submit Changes'=>'Change Submit Koro','Submit button text'=>'Submit button leká','Submit button text (payment)'=>'Submit button leká (payment)','Submit button text (processing)'=>'Submit button leká (processing)','Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'Submit goijjá Ivent, Manjuri\'r Aguwa','Subscribe'=>'Sabskraib koro','Subscribe Now'=>'Etíyi Subscribe Koro','Subscribe to Our Newsletter'=>'Amar Newsletter-ot Subscribe Koro','Subscribe to our newsletter to receive exclusive content, early access to new features, and helpful event management tips directly to your inbox.'=>'Exclusive content, notun feature\'r agór access ar ivent manejment\'or kam\'or tip tuañr inbox-ot paibar lagi amar newsletter-ot subscribe koro.','Subsite Archetype Mode'=>'Subsite Árkitaip Mod','Subsites choose from network list'=>'Subsite ókkol network list-ot theke basílo goribo','Subtotals will exclude taxes and display taxes separately.'=>'Subtotal ókkolot tax thakibo na ar tax alada bhabe dekhano hoibo.','Success Message'=>'Success-or Khobor','Successful booking'=>'Sofol booking','Successful pending booking'=>'Sofol pending booking','Successfully Updated Message'=>'Sofolbhabe Tazagoijjá Message','Successfully deleted all timeranges.'=>'Beggún timerange haçifélaigiyé.','Successfully saved %d timeranges.'=>'%d timerange bórieragiyé.','Successfully saved %s'=>'%s bórieragiyé','Successfully updated %s'=>'%s thikmoto kiórzana hoijjé','Super Advanced Mode'=>'Boro Torkigoijjá Mode','Surcharges (After Taxes)'=>'Surcharge ókkol (Tax\'or Fisór)','Surcharges Before Taxes'=>'Tax\'or Agór Surcharge ókkol','Tabbed metaboxes'=>'Tab oya metabox óll','Tag'=>'Hót','Tag Related Placeholders'=>'Hót Sombondhíya Placeholder ókkol','Tag pages'=>'Hót sófa óll','Tags'=>'Hót óll','Tags dropdown label'=>'Hót óll dropdown label','Tags list page'=>'Hót liís sófa','Take bookings and payments on your own site, through your own payment gateway account, with no commission taken.'=>'Nizor site-ot, nizor payment gateway account dia booking ar dam niyo, kono commission na kati.','Tax'=>'Tax','Tax Rate'=>'Tax Rate','Taxes'=>'Tax ókkol','Taxes included'=>'Tax shoho','Taxonomy not found.'=>'Taxonomy pawa zai nái.','Term could not be deleted.'=>'Term haçifélo gorí parlam na.','Term name is required.'=>'Term nam dorkar.','Term not found.'=>'Term pawa zai nái.','Test Email Settings'=>'Test Email Séthín','Text shown in place of the link until then'=>'Oto somoy porzonto rabeta\'r zaigat dahano leká','Text with link to calendar day page with all events for that day if there are more events than the limit above, leave blank for no link as the day number is also a link.'=>'Uporór limit\'r cheye zeyada Ivent thakile, oi din\'r beggún Ivent\'r kelendhar din sófa\'r rabeta thaka HTML Leká, rabeta no cole fáka rakó karon din\'r sonkhya o rabeta.','That is not a CSV file. In your spreadsheet program, save or export the sheet as CSV first.'=>'Eta CSV file noy. Tomar spreadsheet program-ot, sheet-ta age CSV hisabe bórieró ba export goró.','That was tried a moment ago. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'Eta ekhóni korar chesta hoiyé. Ek miníth opeksha kori aker chesta goró.','The %s account that hosts this event is no longer connected. Reconnect it or choose another account for the event.'=>'Ei ivent\'or host kora %s account aker connect nai. Aker connect goró ba ivent\'or lagi onno account basho.','The Events Calendar is still active. It doesn\'t need to be: Events Manager reads its data directly, so you can deactivate it and its add-ons first. Once migrated, Events Manager uses the same web addresses, so the two plugins compete for them until The Events Calendar is deactivated. Your Events Calendar data is not changed either way.'=>'The Events Calendar ekhono chalu asé. Eta chalu thakar dorkar nai: Events Manager tar data shoja poré, tai age eta ar eta\'r add-on óll deactivate gorté paro. Migrate hoilé Events Manager eki web thíkana bebohar goré, tai The Events Calendar deactivate na hoa porzonto duita plugin ei thíkana\'r lagi lorai goré. Tomar Events Calendar data kono bhabe bodle na.','The SMTP host. Usually it corresponds to \'localhost\'. If you use Gmail, set this value to \'tls://smtp.gmail.com:587\'.'=>'SMTP host. Shadharon bhabe eita \'localhost\'-er sôho mélé. Jodi tuí Gmail estemal koros, ei value \'tls://smtp.gmail.com:587\' set koro.','The add-on list can be refreshed once a day. Please try again tomorrow.'=>'Add-on liís din\'ót ekbar refresh gorté paro. Kal aker chesta goró.','The advanced search can be styled in a section-based format, with expandable sections, or directly inline with static headings. If you want headings for some sections and not others, choose Headings and leave specific section heading labels blank in settings further down.'=>'Torkigoijjá tua section-based cokól\'ot expand hoite paro section diya yá sidha inline static matá diya ecthail goróno zay. Kichu section\'ot matá cao ar kichu section\'ot nai, tóle Matá Ókkol basílo goró ar niçór séthín\'ot nirdisto section\'r matá label ókkol fáka rakó.','The bundled OAuth library is not loaded, so the AI / MCP setup screen is unavailable.'=>'Bundled OAuth library load hoí nái, tai AI / MCP setup screen pawa zai na.','The calendar headings uses abbreviated weekdays'=>'Kelendhar\'r matá abbreviated weekdays bebohar goré','The country'=>'Desh','The country "%s" is not recognized and was left empty.'=>'Desh "%s" chena zay na ar khali rakha hoiyé.','The date "%s" in the list of dates is not understood.'=>'Tarík liís\'ót tarík "%s" bujha zay na.','The day of the month "%s" is not understood. Use 1 to 31, or last.'=>'Mashor din "%s" bujha zay na. 1 thi 31 ba last bebohar goró.','The default minimum width, in pixels, that each grid item can shrink to fit on one line.'=>'Proti grid item eke lainot ana\'r lagi ziyada kom zeyada pixel Fatári hoite paré.','The default value is blank so that the booking submission button appears just below the %s section.'=>'Asási maan khali jate booking submission button %s section-or ekdom niceyi dekha zay.','The description of the event that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Kelendhar\'ot dekhaibo Ivent\'r tofsil.','The email "%s" is not an email address and was left out.'=>'B-ciñçí "%s" B-ciñçír Thíkana noy ar bad dewa hoiyé.','The end date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Sesh tarík "%s" bujha zay na.','The end is before the start.'=>'Sesh suru\'r age.','The end time "%s" is not understood.'=>'Sesh somoy "%s" bujha zay na.','The event name. Example: Birthday party'=>'Ivent\'or nam. Zeman: Zonmodin party','The featured image was left out: %s'=>'Featured fothú bad dewa hoiyé: %s','The file content does not match its file extension.'=>'Failor hazorjiníc failor extension\'ot milé na.','The file could not be read.'=>'File poro zay nai.','The file did not upload. Choose a CSV file and try again.'=>'File upload hoy nai. CSV file basho kori aker chesta goró.','The file does not appear to be a valid Microsoft Office document.'=>'Ei fail thík Microsoft Office document hoyé mone hoyé na.','The file does not appear to be a valid PDF.'=>'Ei fail thík PDF hoyé mone hoyé na.','The file has no column named "%s".'=>'File\'ót "%s" nam\'or kono column nai.','The file is empty.'=>'File khali.','The file is too big! Maximum allowed size: '=>'Fail beci boró! Beci hoile ítta dilé: ','The file needs a first row of column names and at least one row below it.'=>'File\'ót column nam\'or fóila row ar tar niche kómpokke ek row dorkar.','The first row holds the column names. On the next screen you match each column to a field and see how the first rows will import, before anything is saved. A file made for the CSV importer of The Events Calendar works as it is.'=>'Fóila row\'ót column nam asé. Poroto screen\'ót tumi proti column ekta field\'or loge milaibo ar kisu bórieró\'r age fóila row óll kemon import hoibo dekhibo. The Events Calendar\'or CSV importer\'or lagi banano file zemon asé temoni kam goré.','The following blog timezones could not be successfully reset:'=>'Nicé\'r blog timezone ókkol thikmoto reset hoite fare nai:','The following booking is %s :'=>'Ei booking %s :','The following options will re-enable this behaviour. If you notice escaped content (raw HTML) displayed on your site, you can enable these temporarily whilst you fix the underlying issue.'=>'Itólla optión ókkole ei kamot fisé cálu goribo. Jodi tuáñr sáithot escaped hazorjiníc (raw HTML) dekhá zái, tóle asol somossya thik gorar somoy ei ókkol somoyik cálu gori rakibó paro.','The format of a single %s in a list.'=>'Liís\'ot eke %s\'r cokól.','The format of a single %s page title.'=>'Eke %s sófa\'r lokób\'r cokól.','The format of a single %s page.'=>'Ek %s sófa\'r cokól.','The format of a single category page title.'=>'Ek kisím sófa\'r lokób\'ór cokól.','The format of a single tag page title.'=>'Ek hót sófa\'r lokób\'ór cokól.','The format of any events in a list.'=>'Liís\'ot thaka kuno Ivent\'r cokól.','The format of each event when displayed in the full calendar.'=>'Pura kelendhar\'ot dekhaile proti Ivent\'r cokól.','The format of the description of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'Ivent RSS feed\'ór pratek jiníc\'ór tofsil\'ór cokól.','The format of the events the list inserted in the category page through the %s element.'=>'%s element\'ór lagi kisím sófa\'ót dhaló kora Ivent liís\'ór cokól.','The format of the events the list inserted in the location page through the %s element.'=>'%s element\'ór lagi Jaga sófa\'ót dhaló kora Ivent liís\'ór cokól.','The format of the events the list inserted in the tag page through the <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> element.'=>'<code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> ar <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> element\'ór lagi hót sófa\'ót dhaló kora Ivent liís\'ór cokól.','The format of the month/year header of the calendar.'=>'Kelendhar\'r mac/bosór matá\'r cokól.','The format of the next upcoming event in this %s.'=>'Ei %s\'ót baade ashiyá thaka Ivent\'ór cokól.','The format of the text appearing in the balloon describing the location.'=>'Jaga\'r baabote bornona kora balun\'ót dekha zaoya leká\'r cokól.','The format of the title of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'Ivent RSS feed\'ór pratek jiníc\'ór lokób\'ór cokól.','The format used to display %s content on single pages or elsewhere on your site.'=>'Eke sófa\'ot yá tuáñr sáith\'r onno zagat %s hazorjiníc dekhaibar cokól.','The image is too big! Maximum allowed dimensions: '=>'Fothú beci boró! Beci hoile ítta lambai fatári dilé: ','The image is too small! Minimum allowed dimensions: '=>'Fothú beci gúrí! Kom hoile ítta lambai fatári lagé: ','The image uploaded successfully but was not set as a featured image: %s The attachment ID is in this response — pass it to update-event/update-location `featured_image` once the target is editable.'=>'Fothú bhalo kore upload hoise, kintu featured fothú hisabe thik hoí nái: %s Attachment ID ei response-t asé, target sóiyigoró zaóar pore ítá update-event/update-location `featured_image`-t dioó.','The input field is an example of our phone number input field. Play with the settings below and the it will update automatically to show you a preview.'=>'Ei input field amár phone number input field\'ór ek example. Níce\'r séthín ókkol niya khelo, ei auto-update oya preview dekhaiba.','The language used to make this booking was %s'=>'Ei booking goróbar belá bhasa asil %s','The largest share of an event\'s spaces, as a percentage, that all visitors\' holds together can take at once, so nobody can hold a whole event. Once it is reached, visitors can still book the remaining spaces but they are not held for them. Enter 100 for no limit.'=>'Ek ivent\'or jagar sobcheye boro bhag, shotkora hisabe, zeta sob visitor\'or hold ekshonge ekbar nite fare, zate keu pura ivent hold gorté na fare. Ei sima poúché gele visitor ókkol baki jaga booking gorté fare kintu hold hoy na. Kono sima na thakle 100 likho.','The last date the event can fall on.'=>'Ivent zei sesh tarík\'ót hoite fare.','The latitude and longitude are not a pair of coordinates and were left out.'=>'Latitude ar longitude koordineit\'or zora noy ar bad dewa hoiyé.','The link will be shown %s minutes before the event starts.'=>'Ivent suru hoar %s miníth age rabeta dahano hoibo.','The location "%1$s" could not be created: %2$s'=>'Jaga "%1$s" banano zay nai: %2$s','The location "%s" was not on this site, so it was created with its name only. Add its address, or import a locations file first.'=>'Jaga "%s" ei site-ot asilo na, tai khali nam dia banano hoiyé. Tar Thíkana ezafágoró ba age jaga file import goró.','The location address'=>'Jaga\'r thíkana','The location information that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Kelendhar\'ot dekhaibo jaga\'r tothyo.','The location town'=>'Jaga\'r sohor','The main description of your RSS events feed.'=>'Tuáñr RSS Ivent feed\'ór asol tofsil.','The main title of your RSS events feed.'=>'Tuáñr RSS Ivent feed\'ór asol lokób.','The maximum allowed size for images uploaded, in bytes'=>'Upload kora fothú\'or sob\'ere boro ejazot dia maf, byte-ot','The maximum height an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Upload kora fothú\'or sob\'ere boro usol. Aro boro fothú bardoo hoibo. Kunu maf ejazot dibar lagi khali rakhó.','The maximum number of files a user can upload at once. Leave blank for unlimited.'=>'Estemalgoróya ekbare koyta fail upload koribar fare. Sími na dite khali rakhó.','The maximum size in bytes per uploaded file.'=>'Prottek upload kora fail\'or sob\'ere boro maf byte-ot.','The maximum width an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Upload kora fothú\'or sob\'ere boro fatári. Aro boro fothú bardoo hoibo. Kunu maf ejazot dibar lagi khali rakhó.','The message displayed when no %s are available.'=>'%s moujut na thakíle dahaya zaiba oya bortá.','The message displayed when no events are available.'=>'Kuno Ivent no thakile ei message dekhaibo.','The message to be displayed in the list generated by %s when no events are available.'=>'Ivent moujut na thakíle %s\'ór duari baniyá liís\'ót dahaya zaiba oya bortá.','The message to be displayed in the list generated by <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> when no events are available.'=>'Ivent moujut na thakíle <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> ar <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> duari baniyá liís\'ót dahaya zaiba oya bortá.','The minimum height an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Upload kora fothú\'or sob\'ere soto usol. Aro soto fothú bardoo hoibo. Kunu maf ejazot dibar lagi khali rakhó.','The minimum width an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'Upload kora fothú\'or sob\'ere soto fatári. Aro soto fothú bardoo hoibo. Kunu maf ejazot dibar lagi khali rakhó.','The name is empty.'=>'Nam khali.','The name of the location'=>'Jaga-ór nam','The number of times to repeat, "%s", is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'Bar bar hoar songkhya "%s" 1 ba tar beshi pura songkhya noy.','The numerical units shown to those searching by distance. Use comma-separated numbers, such as "25,50,100".'=>'Dhur diya tua goróya ókkolke dekháno sonkhya unit. Comma diya alada goróya sonkhya bebohar goró, zeme "25,50,100".','The option below allows you to disable user accounts, yet you will still see the supplied personal information for each booking.'=>'Niceor optión estemalgoróya account bongoró gorit dey, tobu tumi prottek booking-or lagi dewa bektigoto tothyo dekhibó.','The options below are applied to the %s placeholders.'=>'Níce\'r opshon ókkol %s placeholder\'ót lagoo oi.','The page containing the %s shortcode. Create a page with that shortcode and select it here.'=>'Zeita %s shortcode asé ói sófa. Ói shortcode dia ekkún sófa baná goria eitá basílo goró.','The port through which you e-mail notifications will be sent. Make sure the firewall doesn\'t block this port'=>'Jé port diye tuañr e-mail notification fatá jaibo. Nischit hoó jé firewall ei port block kore na','The provider rate limit was reached, so this will be retried shortly.'=>'Provider\'or rate limit poúché gelo, tai eta ekhóni aker chesta hoibo.','The repeat rule and the extra dates were combined into a list of %d dates.'=>'Bar bar hoar niyom ar ostiriktó tarík ókkol mila %d tarík\'or liís hoiyé.','The repeat rule gives more than %d dates.'=>'Bar bar hoar niyom %d\'or beshi tarík dey.','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date, so the event has no dates yet.'=>'Bar bar hoar niyom suru tarík ar bar bar hoar sesh tarík\'or moddhe kono tarík dey na, tai ivent\'or ekhono kono tarík nai.','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date.'=>'Bar bar hoar niyom suru tarík ar bar bar hoar sesh tarík\'or moddhe kono tarík dey na.','The repeat-until date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Bar bar hoar sesh tarík "%s" bujha zay na.','The repeat-until date is before the start date.'=>'Bar bar hoar sesh tarík suru tarík\'or age.','The repeating event has been converted into a recurring event.'=>'Bar bar hoba Ivent bar bar hoa Ivent\'ot bodolaigiyé.','The repeating events have been converted into recurring events.'=>'Repeating ivent ókkol recurring ivent-ot convert hoise.','The right-of-withdrawal feature is currently disabled in Events Manager settings.'=>'Right-of-withdrawal feature bortoman Events Manager séthín ókkolót disabled asé.','The selected country code will also show the dialcode, such as +1 for the US.'=>'Basílo kora desh kudh dialcode\'o dekhaiba, zémon US\'ór lagi +1.','The selected country will be chosen by default if auto-detect is disabled, additionally any numbers submitted whilst Phone Numbers were disabled will be considered as belonging to this country and reformatted accordingly when used for communication or display purposes.'=>'Auto-detect disable oíle basílo kora desh asási hisabe thakiba, tar ualawa Phone Number disable thakar somoy zomá oya number ei desh\'ór dhoriya zaiba ar zogazog yá display\'ór somoy tar moton cokól kora zaiba.','The setting above is new, due to our new calendar display options. Your previous format was %s'=>'Uporór séthín noya, amrar noya kelendhar dekhaibar option\'r karone. Tuáñr age\'r cokól oilo %s','The settings below are used when using the %s placeholder'=>'%s placeholder estemal koríle níce\'r séthín ókkol estemal hoba','The start date "%s" is not understood.'=>'Suru tarík "%s" bujha zay na.','The start date is empty.'=>'Suru tarík khali.','The start time "%s" is not understood.'=>'Suru somoy "%s" bujha zay na.','The statutory cooling-off period is 14 days. Late submissions are still accepted and flagged for your review rather than silently rejected.'=>'Ainí cooling-off somoy 14 din. Deri hoba jomá tarebi newa hoi aar nozor\'r lagi cihno lagai, cupe cupe batil nó gorí.','The text shown when a booking is being submitted, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'Booking submit hoar somoy dekhano leká, %s dia bakí total amount bodolano hoibo.','The text shown when a booking is not free, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'Booking free na hole dekhano leká, %s dia bakí total amount bodolano hoibo.','The text used by the submit button. To use an image instead, enter the full url starting with %s or %s.'=>'Submit button-e estemal hoa leká. Leká-or bodole fothú estemal gorit, %s yá %s dia shuru hoa purapuri url dó.','The ticket %s is no longer available.'=>'Ticket %s ar moujut nai.','The time zone "%s" is not recognized. Use a name such as America/New_York or an offset such as UTC+2.'=>'Somoy zone "%s" chena zay na. America/New_York zemon nam ba UTC+2 zemon offset bebohar goró.','The tip text that is shown for the advanced search trigger.'=>'Torkigoijjá tua trigger\'r lagi dekháno tip HTML Leká.','The title that will appear in the calendar.'=>'Kelendhar\'ot dekhaibo zei lokób.','The unique name (singular) used to identify %s in the database. Use lowercase alphanumeric characters, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Database-t %s cinar lagi unique nam (ekbocon). Khali choto hórof alphanumeric, dash ar underscore estemal goró.','The uploaded file is no longer on the server. Upload it again.'=>'Upload kora file ar server-ot nai. Aker upload goró.','The uploads folder is not writable.'=>'Upload óll folder-ot lekha zay na.','The virtual location for this event is not ready yet. Please try again shortly.'=>'Ei ivent\'or virtual jaga ekhono tayyar noy. Kisu pore aker chesta goró.','The website "%s" is not a web address and was left out.'=>'Website "%s" web thíkana noy ar bad dewa hoiyé.','The week of the month "%s" is not understood. Use first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'Mashor soptah "%s" bujha zay na. first, second, third, fourth ba last bebohar goró.','The weekday "%s" is not understood.'=>'Soptahor din "%s" bujha zay na.','Theme Templates'=>'Tehm Nomuna óll','There are not enough physical spaces left for this booking.'=>'Ei booking\'or lagi zothesto physical jaga baki nai.','There are not enough virtual spaces left for this booking.'=>'Ei booking\'or lagi zothesto virtual jaga baki nai.','There is a newer version of Events Manager Pro which is recommended for this current version of Events Manager as new features have been added. Please go to the plugin website and download the latest update.'=>'Events Manager Pro\'r noya varcén asé, noya fíca zuré ei Events Manager varcén\'or lagi cúaric goijjá. Plugin wébsáith\'ot zaiyé taza update nambá.','There was a problem adding custom fields to your recurring events.'=>'Tuáñr bar bar hoba ivent\'ót háaic field ezafágorór somoi somossa hoijjé.','There was a problem adding tickets to your recurrences.'=>'Tuáñr bar bar hoa\'ót ticket ezafágorór somoi somossa hoijjé.','There was a problem creating a user account, please contact a website administrator.'=>'Estemalgoróya akaunt banaibar belá osubidha hoiyé, wébsáith sóoñloya\'r logé zogazog goró.','There was a problem deleting bookings for the event.'=>'Ivent\'r booking haçifélo gorór somoi somossa hoijjé.','There was a problem deleting the timerange.'=>'Timerange haçifélo gorór somoi somossa hoijjé.','There was a problem saving the booking.'=>'Booking save gorár belá ek somossa hoise.','There was a problem saving the event timeslots to the database. Please contact an administrator if the issue persists.'=>'Ivent timeslot database\'ót bórierér somoi somossa hoijjé. Somossa cólité thakilé mehrobani goria admin\'ót zanao.','There was a problem saving the recurring events.'=>'Bar bar hoba ivent bórierér somoi ekkún somossa hoijjé.','There was a problem saving the ticket booking.'=>'Ticket booking bórierér somoi somossa hoijjé.','There was a problem saving the ticket.'=>'Ticket bórierér somoi somossa hoijjé.','There was a problem saving the timerange.'=>'Timerange bórierér somoi somossa hoijjé.','There was a problem updating tickets to your recurrences.'=>'Tuáñr bar bar hoa\'r ticket kiórzana gorór somoi somossa hoijjé.','There was an error connecting to %s: %s'=>'%s\'ót connect gorór somoi error hoijjé: %s','There was an error upgrading your site, please try again or contact support.'=>'Tuáñr sáith upgrade gorár belá error hoise, abbar kucícgoró yá support-or shaithe jogajog goroó.','There was an error uploading the image.'=>'Fothú uoretulár belá error hoiyé.','There was an error whilst migrating your times to our new timezone-aware formats. Below is a list of errors:'=>'Tuáñr somoy noya timezone-aware cokól\'ot migrate goróbar belá error hoiyé. Nice error\'or list:','There were some errors saving your location.'=>'Tuáñr jaga bórierér somoi kisu error hoijjé.','There were some issues whilst disconnecting from your %s account(s) :'=>'Tuáñr %s account(s) tuwa disconnect goríbar belá kiccu somossá hoijjé :','These can be overridden when using shortcode or template tags.'=>'Shortcode yá template tag estemal\'ór somoy ei ókkol override koría zai.','These countries will be excluded from the country selection list.'=>'Ei desh óll desh basílo liís óttu baáre thakiba.','These formats can be used on %s pages or on other areas of your site displaying an %s.'=>'Ei cokól ókkol %s sófa\'ot yá tuáñr sáith\'r onno zagat %s dekhaile bebohar goróno zay.','These formats can be used when WordPress automatically displays %s excerpts on your site and %s is enabled in your %s settings tab.'=>'WordPress tuáñr sáith\'ot automatic %s nuthgoró dekhaile ar tuáñr %s Séthín tab\'ot %s enable thakile ei cokól ókkol bebohar goróno zay.','These formats will be used on your events page. This will also be used if you do not provide specified formats in other event lists, like in shortcodes.'=>'Ei cokól ókkol tuáñr Ivent sófa\'ot bebohar hoibo. Shortcode\'r moto onno Ivent liís\'ot cokól no dile ei bebohar hoibo.','These headings appear above sections of the booking form. Leave blank for no heading.'=>'Ei heading ókkol booking form-or section ókkolor uppor dekha zay. Heading na cale khali rakó.','These options are the defaults applied to lists being showing in Grouped List view mode and can be overriden in individual lists using shortcodes, blocks, widgets etc.'=>'Grouped Liís Soó mode\'ot liís dekhaile ei option ókkol asási hisabe lagé ar alada alada liís\'ot shortcode, block, widget ittadi diya override goróno zay.','These options have security implications and are intended for transition! For more information, please see our %s.'=>'Ei optión ókkolor nirapotta somporke guruttu asé, ar ókkol transition-or lagi! Beshi zanar lagi, doya gori amar %s dekhó.','These pages allow you to provide an event management interface outside the admin area on whatever page you want on your website. Bear in mind that this is overridden by BuddyPress if activated.'=>'Ei sófa óll diye admin area-r bahire tuáñr wébsáith-or zekon sófa-t Ivent management interface dite parró. Mone rakhíbó, BuddyPress activate thakle ítái ei sófa overrite gorí dée.','These spaces cannot be held for you right now, but you can still book them while they are available.'=>'Ei jaga óll ekhon tomar lagi hold kora zay na, kintu moujut thakle booking gorté paro.','This %s has timeslots, you are viewing'=>'Ei %s-ót timeslot asé, tuí soóyós','This %s was submitted by a guest. You will find their details in the <em>Anonymous Submitter Info</em> box'=>'Ei %s ekkún guest jomá goijjé. Tár tofsil <em>Namsára Jomá Goróya\'r Khobor</em> boxót fáibó','This CPT name is already used by an existing WordPress post type. Please choose another name.'=>'Ei CPT nam ageyi ekta WordPress post type-t estemal hoi gesé. Doya gori onno nam basílo goró.','This Month'=>'Ei Mac','This Year'=>'Ei Bosór','This accepts %s and %s placeholders.'=>'Ei %s ar %s placeholder grohon kore.','This accepts %s placeholders.'=>'Ei %s placeholder grohon kore.','This accepts %s, %s and %s placeholders.'=>'Ei %s, %s ar %s placeholder grohon kore.','This action aill be applied to every attendee belonging to the selected %s. Do you want to continue?'=>'Ei ékcen basílo %s\'r hór attendee\'ot lagibó. Tuñí cólibó cái?','This action will be applied to the entire booking the %s belongs to. Do you want to continue?'=>'Ei ékcen %s\'r pura booking\'ot lagibó. Tuñí cólibó cái?','This action will be applied to the entire booking the selected %s belong to. Do you want to continue?'=>'Ei ékcen basílo %s\'r pura booking\'ot lagibó. Tuñí cólibó cái?','This booking form has expired, please reload the page and try again.'=>'Ei booking form\'or somoy sesh hoiyé, sófa abbar lód goró ar abbar kucícgoró.','This booking has already been submitted, please check your email for its confirmation.'=>'Ei booking agei jomá hoijjé, confirmation\'r lagi tuáñr email soó goró.','This booking has already been submitted.'=>'Ei booking agót submit hoiyé.','This button text would be shown for a free booking'=>'Ei button leká free booking-or lagi dekhano hoibo','This cannot be undone.'=>'Eita fisór kiré fáribó ná.','This confirms receipt of your declaration only. We will review it and contact you regarding any refund due.'=>'Ei khali tuár ghosona fawar nissoyota. Amra ouddá soó kori fawna refund thakile tuár lógé zugazug goribó.','This content will appear just above your code for the %s list format below. Default is blank'=>'Ei hazorjiníc niçór %s liís cokól\'r kudh\'r thikkoi uporé dekhaibo. Asási fáka','This content will appear just above your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'Ei hazorjiníc asási Ivent liís cokól\'r kudh\'r thikkoi uporé dekhaibo. Asási fáka','This content will appear just below your code for the %s list format above. Default is blank'=>'Ei hazorjiníc uporór %s liís cokól\'r kudh\'r thikkoi niçé dekhaibo. Asási fáka','This content will appear just below your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'Ei hazorjiníc asási Ivent liís cokól\'r kudh\'r thikkoi niçé dekhaibo. Asási fáka','This disables user registrations for bookings.'=>'Ei booking-or lagi estemalgoróya rejicthorgoró bongoró goré.','This email already exists in our system, please log in to register to proceed with your booking.'=>'Ei B-ciñçí agót amar systemot asé, booking cholibar lagi bútore gólo goró.','This event has been cancelled.'=>'Ei Ivent kenselgoijjé.','This event has ended and can no longer be joined.'=>'Ei ivent sesh hoiyé ar aker join kora zay na.','This event has no virtual location to join.'=>'Ei ivent\'or join gorar kono virtual jaga nai.','This event has validation errors and cannot be published until they are fixed:'=>'Ei Ivent-ót validation error asé ar ouddá thik na hoa fozzonto Baáirgoritte fariba na:','This event is fully booked.'=>'Ei Ivent\'or beggún Jaga booking hoiyé.','This event is not available or has been cancelled'=>'Ei Ivent moujut nai yá cancelled hoise','This event is not available or has been cancelled.'=>'Ei Ivent moujut nai yá kenselgoijjé.','This event is not open for joining yet.'=>'Ei ivent ekhono join gorar lagi khola noy.','This event spans every day between the beginning and end date, with start/end times applying to each day.'=>'Ei Ivent shuru ar sesh tarík-ór moddhe beggún din cole, shuru/sesh Somoy prottek din lagé.','This file holds'=>'Ei file\'ót asé','This is a %s event.'=>'Ei ek %s Ivent.','This is a %s recurrence of %s.'=>'Eita %s\'or ekta %s recurrence.','This is a recurring %s. You can find all %s on this page, or click on individual %s to view recurrence-specific bookings.'=>'Eita ekta recurring %s. Tuí ei sófa\'ót sob %s paibo, yá recurrence-specific booking soó\'ibar lagi alada %s-ot click koro.','This is a translated event, therefore your time, location and booking information is handled by your original event translation.'=>'Ei torjuma goijjá Ivent, tai tuáñr somoy, Jaga ar booking khobor mul Ivent torjuma dorí chalé.','This is a translated location, so address information is handled by your original location translation. You can provide translations for certain fields which will override the original translation.'=>'Ei torjuma goijjá Jaga, tai thíkana\'r khobor mul Jaga torjuma dorí chalé. Kisu field\'or torjuma dió pare, zeta mul torjuma\'r upór hoibo.','This is also the default setting for responsive calendars without a fixed size.'=>'Fixed maf nai responsive kelendhar\'r lagi oita asási séthín.','This is for advanced users, you should know what you\'re doing here or things will not work properly. For more information on how these options work see our <a href="%s" target="_blank">optimization recommendations</a>'=>'Ei torkigoijjá estemalgoróya\'r lagi, tuáñr ki koríso jana dorkar noile kisu thik moton kam koríba na. Ei opshon kemoné kam kore tar baabote aro tothyo\'r lagi amár <a href="%s" target="_blank">optimization cúaric</a> dekó','This is not a required step to enable any extra functionality, and therefore is not urgent. Only until you are happy with the upgrade and are confident you don\'t need to downgrade, finalize your upgrade by deleting and discontinuing these fields.'=>'Ei step lagibo na, kunó extra functionality enable gorár lagi, tai tárahúra nái. Upgrade-t khushi ar downgrade lagibo na ítá nishchit hole, ei field óll haçifélo kore upgrade finalize goroó.','This is only applicable when %s is not active.'=>'Oi kebol %s active no thakile lagé.','This is only used when showing events from other blogs.'=>'Onno blog\'r Ivent dekhaile kebol oi bebohar hoibo.','This is sent when a person\'s booking is confirmed. This will be sent automatically if approvals are required and the booking is approved. If approvals are disabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'Kuno manuxor booking confirmed hoile oi fatóya zay. Approval lage ar booking approved hoile automatic fatóya zaibo. Approval disable thakile, estemalgoróya prothom booking submit goróle fatóya zaibo.','This is sent when a person\'s booking is pending. If approvals are enabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'Kuno manuxor booking pending hoile oi fatóya zay. Approval enable thakile, estemalgoróya prothom booking submit goróle fatóya zaibo.','This is specific to bookings made by the user, not bookings that may have been made to events they own.'=>'Ei khali estemalgoróya-r nízor kora booking-or lagi, tára Ivent-t onno-or kora booking-or lagi na.','This is the definite date after which bookings will be closed for this event, regardless of individual ticket settings above. Default value will be the event start date.'=>'Uppor-ór Ticket Séthín ókkol zeittát thakuk, ei tarík fisór ei Ivent-ór Booking bong hoi zaibó. Asási tarík Ivent shuru hoar tarík.','This is your primary recurrence, other recurring %s will use these advanced settings as their default settings if left blank.'=>'Ei tuár asol bar bar hoa, labdi khali thakile baki bar bar hoba %s ei torkigoijjá Séthín ókkol asási hisabe estemal goribó.','This join link is not valid. Please use the link from your booking confirmation.'=>'Ei join rabeta thik noy. Tomar Booking Confirmation\'or rabeta bebohar goró.','This link is invalid or has expired. Please request a new one.'=>'Ei rabeta bhul yá mehad sesh. Mehrobani goria noya ekkún cao.','This location has validation errors and cannot be published until they are fixed:'=>'Ei jagat validation error ókkol ase, ar hik hoibar age prokash hoibo nó-paré:','This month'=>'Ei mac','This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Ei network ekta ivent ar booking table share kore, tai ei sáith\'ot uninstall koile network\'or sob sáith\'or ivent ar booking sorai sorai haçifélano hoibo. Etar bodole %s-ot uninstall koro.','This only setting only matters if you selected \'Yes\' to above. You will notice the events page titles aren\'t being rewritten, and you have a new title underneath the default page name. This is where you control the HTML of this title. Make sure you keep the #_PAGETITLE placeholder here, as that\'s what is rewritten by events manager. To control what\'s rewritten in this title, see settings further down for page titles.'=>'Uporot \'Ói\' basílo koríle khali ei séthín kam kore. Tuáñr dekhiba Ivent sófa\'ór lokób rewrite oitési na, ar asási sófa nam\'ór níce ek noya lokób asé. Etháne ei lokób\'ór HTML niyontron koró. Etháne #_PAGETITLE placeholder rakhíba, karon eta events manager rewrite kore. Ei lokób\'ót ki rewrite hoba niyontron koríte sófa lokób\'ór lagi níce\'r séthín dekó.','This option allows you to select the default category when adding an event.'=>'Ivent ezafá koríle asási kisím basílo koríte ei opshon dey.','This option allows you to select the default location when adding an event.'=>'Ivent ezafá koríle asási Jaga basílo koríte ei opshon dey.','This option allows you to select which page to use as an events page. If you do not select an events page, to display event lists you can enable event archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'Ei opshon dia Ivent sófa hisabe kon sófa estemal koríba basílo koría paró. Ivent sófa na basílo koríle Ivent liís dekhaya\'r lagi Ivent arkaiv enable yá uchit shortcode ar/yá template tag estemal koría paró.','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page.'=>'Ei option diye tuñi basíb parba kon sófa %s sófa hisabe bebohar hobo.','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page. If you do not select a %s page, to display lists you can enable archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'Ei option diye tuñi basíb parba kon sófa %s sófa hisabe bebohar hobo. Zodi tuñi %s sófa na basó, list dekhanir lagi arkaiv enable goroó yá uzit shortcode ar/yá template tag bebohar goroó.','This options allows to display the full-sized calendar on the events page, instead of the default list.'=>'Ei opshon asási liís\'ór bodole Ivent sófa\'ót fuúl maf kelendhar dekhaya dey.','This page corresponds to the <strong>Events Manager</strong> %s page. Its content will be overridden by Events Manager, although if you include the word CONTENTS (exactly in capitals) and surround it with other text, only CONTENTS will be overwritten. If you want to change the way your events look, go to the <a href=\'%s\'>settings</a> page. '=>'Ei sófa <strong>Events Manager</strong> %s sófa\'r loi mélé. Ihar content Events Manager\'ér dwara override hoibo, kintu jodi tuí CONTENTS waádh (thik boro hórof\'ót) lekhis ar ar leka diye gheri dis, khali CONTENTS-é overwrite hoibo. Jodi tuañr ivent\'or dekhon bodolaite saós, <a href=\'%s\'>séthín</a> sófat jao. ','This page is where people that have made bookings for an event can go and view their previous bookings.'=>'Zará ek Ivent-or lagi booking goríse, ítára ei sófa-t gói tára agó-or booking óll soó parró.','This section allows you to configure parts of this plugin that will improve performance on your site and increase page speeds by reducing extra files from being unnecessarily included on pages as well as reducing server loads where possible. This only applies to pages outside the admin area.'=>'Ei bhag ei plugin\'ór kunu ongso configure koríte dey zeta tuáñr sáith\'ór hamdóon bazáiba ar sófa\'ót proyojonhin file na ashar upay koría sófa gotí bazáiba ar yete paré server load komaiba. Ei khali admin ilakar bahire sófa\'ót proyojjo.','This setting was not changed.'=>'Ei séthín bodolano hoi nai.','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a fixed-size %s calendar.'=>'Tuñi nirdisto goré fixed-maf %s kelendhar dekhaile ei séthín lagibo.','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a size %s calendar.'=>'Tuñi nirdisto goré maf %s kelendhar dekhaile ei séthín lagibo.','This setting will not apply to bookings using payment gateways, see individual gateways for approval settings.'=>'Payment gateway estemal gora booking ókkolor lagi ei séthín lagibo na, approval séthín-or lagi alada gateway ókkol dekhó.','This site is activated under a license that has expired. Deactivate it from your licenses page, then activate it again here and choose your %s license.'=>'Ei site ekta expire hoiya zawa license dia chalu asé. Tomar license sófa thi eta deactivate goró, tarpor ekhane aker chalu kori tomar %s license basho.','This text will be shown only if the default (free) button is not an image.'=>'Ei leká khali tokhon dekhano hoibo zokhon asási (free) button fothú na.','This ticket is the child of a recurring event ticket. Values can be overriden for this recurrence. Blank text values will default to the parent ticket value, checkboxes like this %s will inherit parent ticket values.'=>'Ei Ticket bar bar hoba Ivent Ticket\'or bacca. Ei bar bar hoa\'or lagi mulyo bodolon zay. Khali leká mulyo uore Ticket\'or mulyo hoibo, ei %s moto checkbox uore Ticket\'or mulyo dorí.','This uses a slightly different format to the others on here, for a list of characters to use, visit the <a href="%s">reference page</a>'=>'Ei cokól onnoitta\'r cheye ektu alada, bebohar goróya akkor\'r liís dekhibar lagi <a href="%s">reference sófa</a> dekhó','This week'=>'Ei softa','This will be sent automatically when a booking is rejected. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'Booking rejected hoile automatic oi fatóya zaibo. Booking\'ot approval nolagile oi lagé no.','This will be sent to event admins when a booking is rejected.'=>'Booking rejected hoile Ivent admin ókkolke oi fatóya zaibo.','This will be sent to the person when they first submit their booking. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'Manuxe prothom booking submit goróle oi tánke fatóya zaibo. Booking\'ot approval nolagile oi lagé no.','This will be sent when a user cancels their booking.'=>'Estemalgoróya booking kenselgoróle oi fatóya zaibo.','This will be used in admin menus and other areas identifying the type of %s you are working with.'=>'Ei admin mínu ar onno ilakat estemal hoibo zegula tuáñr kam gora %s kisím cinaibo.','This will control how many %s are shown on one list by default.'=>'Ei hán asási hisabe ek list-t kotó %s dekha zaibo ítá thik goríbo.','This will control how many events are shown on one list by default.'=>'Eta asási hisabe ek liís\'ót koto Ivent dekha zaiba tá niyontron koriba.','This will delete all event recurrence posts/pages, and unify them into one URL. Any 404 pages resulting from these will automatically 302-redirect to the recurring event (which will be a new URL).'=>'Ei sob ivent recurrence poigam/sófa haçifélibo, ar ekta URL-ót unify koribo. Ihar karone jé kunu 404 sófa hoibo ségula automatic bhabe recurring ivent\'ot (jita noya URL hoibo) 302-redirect hoibo.','Thousands Separator'=>'Hazar Alada Cihno','Thumbnails'=>'Thumbnail óll','Ticket'=>'Ticket','Ticket %s has a higher minimum spaces requirement than the maximum spaces allowed.'=>'Ticket %s\'r komésom jaga\'r dorkar anumoti hoba beci jaga\'r cheye beci.','Ticket Capacity'=>'Ticket\'r Khomota','Ticket Description'=>'Ticket\'r Tofsil','Ticket ID'=>'Ticket ID','Ticket ID.'=>'Ticket ID.','Ticket Name'=>'Ticket\'r Nam','Ticket Name (Ascending)'=>'Ticket Nam (Bare)','Ticket Name (Descending)'=>'Ticket Nam (Kombe)','Ticket Options'=>'Ticket Óll','Ticket Price'=>'Ticket\'r Dam','Ticket Price (Ascending)'=>'Ticket Dam (Bare)','Ticket Price (Descending)'=>'Ticket Dam (Kombe)','Ticket Spaces'=>'Ticket\'r Jaga','Ticket Total'=>'Ticket or Total','Ticket Type'=>'Ticket Kisím','Ticket UUID'=>'Ticket or UUID','Ticket booking created'=>'Ticket booking baná hoijjé','Ticket could not be deleted.'=>'Ticket haçifélo gorí parlam na.','Ticket could not be saved.'=>'Ticket save gorí parlam na.','Ticket created'=>'Ticket baná hoijjé','Ticket for %s'=>'%s\'or lagi Ticket','Ticket not found.'=>'Ticket pawa zai nái.','Tickets'=>'Ticket','Tickets / Booking'=>'Ticket / Booking','Tickets and RSVPs'=>'Ticket ar RSVP','Tickets with bookings cannot be deleted.'=>'Booking thaka ticket haçifélo gorí zai na.','Tickets within recurrences that already have bookings WILL NOT be deleted, the ticket will be deactivated instead to prevent further bookings.'=>'Booking asé bar bar hoa\'r ticket ókkol haçifélo NÓ HÓIBO, ticket\'r bodole deactivate hóibo zate aar booking nó hoi.','Tickets within recurrences without any bookings will be deleted.'=>'Booking nái bar bar hoa\'r ticket ókkol haçifélo hóibo.','Time Format'=>'Wokt or Cokól','Time Separator'=>'Wokt Alada Goróya','Time zone'=>'Somoy zone','Timerange'=>'Somoy or sima','Timeranges cannot overlap with each other.'=>'Timerange ókkol ekkunór uor ekkún mishé zaite fáribó ná.','Times'=>'Somoy','Timeslot date format'=>'Timeslot tarík cokól','Timeslot time format'=>'Timeslot wokt cokól','Timeslots'=>'Timeslot ókkol','Timeslots require %s and has been disabled automatically to prevent undesired results.'=>'Timeslot\'ór lagi %s dorkar ar ojoibo ol-ful ekaite disable kora oiyé.','Timezone'=>'Táim zon','Title'=>'Lokób','To help with the transition, we\'re providing you with a Preview mode you can activate below, which will temporarily use our new formatting options only for you to see (other site visitors will see your site as usual). If you\'re happy with the changes, you can switch over completely, or revert individual formats within these settings pages.'=>'Bodolor shohoz goribar lagi, amra tuáke ek Preview mode dició zeitta tuí nićé-ór óttu activate goritte fare, ei mode khali tuár dekhibar lagi amrar notun formatting óll temporary estemal goribó (baki site visitor ókkole tuár site agor moton dekhibó). Bodol ookay hoile, puro switch gorité fare, yá ei séthín ókkol sófa-ór moddhe alada format Wapesgorité fare.','To manage the whole set, <a href="%s">edit the repeating event template</a>.'=>'Pura set manage gorór lagi, <a href="%s">bar bar hoba ivent\'r nomuna sóiyigoró</a>.','To update your network blogs with the latest Events Manager automatically, click the update button below.'=>'Tuañr network blog ókkol taza Events Manager diye automatic bhabe kiórzana koribar lagi nicé\'r kiórzana button-ót click koro.','To view your bookings, please visit %s after logging in.'=>'Tuáñr booking dékibar lagi bútore gólo goijjá baade %s\'ot zao.','Today'=>'Aijje','Today\'s events'=>'Aijjar Ivent','Tomorrow\'s events'=>'Kailer Ivent','Tooltip'=>'Tulték','Total'=>'Mot','Total Bookings'=>'Total Booking','Total Price'=>'Total Dam','Total Sales'=>'Total Bikri','Total Spaces'=>'Total Jaga','Total Tickets'=>'Total Ticket','Town'=>'Sháor','Translated Event Information'=>'Torjuma goijjá Ivent Khobor','Translated Location Information'=>'Torjuma goijjá Jaga Khobor','Try again'=>'Aker chesta goró','Trying to perform an illegal action.'=>'Bé-ainí ékcen goróbar cesta goijjó.','URL'=>'URL','URLs'=>'URL óll','Uh Oh! For some reason WordPress could not create an events page for you (or you just deleted it). Not to worry though, all you have to do is create an empty page, name it whatever you want, and select it as your events page in your <a href="%s">settings page</a>. Sorry for the extra step! If you know what you are doing, you may have done this on purpose, if so <a href="%s">ignore this message</a>'=>'Ói Ói! Kunu karone WordPress tuañr lagi ivent sófa banaite fare nai (yá tuí haçifélaisó). Chinta na koro, fúkát ekta khali sófa banaó, jé kunu nam dió, ar tuañr séthín sófat <a href="%s">ivent sófa</a> hisabe basílo. Ekhtu beshi step\'or lagi dukkhito! Jodi tuí jano ki koros, tuí ekhtu iccha kori kori kori thakibar fare, ói hoile <a href="%s">ei message bardoo koro</a>','Unapprove'=>'Approve ókkon na goro','Unauthorized Access'=>'Ejazot Nai','Unavailable Dates'=>'Moujut Na Hoa Tarík','Unconfirm'=>'Unconfirm','Unconfirmed'=>'Unconfirmed','Undo'=>'Wapesgoró','Undo Changes'=>'Bodol Wapesgoró','Undo Migration'=>'Migration Wapesgoró','Uninstall'=>'Ánínstol koro','Uninstall Events Manager'=>'Events Manager Uninstall Koro','Uninstall and Deactivate'=>'Uninstall ar Bongoró','Uninstall/Reset'=>'Ánínstol/Risét','Unknown migration source.'=>'Ochena migration utsho.','Unless overriden with the %s parameter in shortcode or PHP arguments, the calendar will by default split events by timeslot if on the same day or show one event for the day which includes the whole range of timeslots.'=>'Shortcode yá PHP argument\'ot %s parameter diya override no goróle, kelendhar asási hisabe eke din\'ot thaka Ivent timeslot onuzayi alada goribo yá pura timeslot moidan thaka eke Ivent dekhaibo.','Unless speficied with the %s parameter, the calendar will by default remain the chosen size regardless of calendar width. Responsive calendar size will adjust from small to large according to the calendar width on screen.'=>'%s parameter diya nirdisto no goróle, kelendhar\'r Fatári zei hok, asási hisabe basa maf\'ot thakibo. Responsive kelendhar maf screen\'ot kelendhar\'r Fatári onuzayi choto thaki boro hoibo.','Unrecognized file format, could not match file MIME type according to file extension.'=>'Fail kisím cinon gelo na, fail extension\'ot MIME type milé na.','Unrecognized image format, corrupted or non-present image EXIF header data.'=>'Fothú kisím cinon gelo na, fothúr EXIF header data nai yá kharab.','Up to %d%% off'=>'%d%% porzonto chut','Upcoming'=>'Aijjá','Upcoming %s'=>'Aggún %s','Upcoming Events'=>'Aggún Ivent','Upcoming timeslot limit'=>'Aguwa timeslot sima','Update %s'=>'%s Kiórzana goró','Update 7.3.7 also includes improvements to the block (Gutenberg) editor. Check out our %s for the details.'=>'Update 7.3.7\'ot block (Gutenberg) editor\'or bodolo\'o asé. Khobor\'or lagi amar %s dékó.','Update Blogs'=>'Blog Kiórzana','Update Event Category'=>'Ivent Kisím Kiórzana','Update Event Tag'=>'Ivent Hót Kiórzana','Update Network'=>'Network Kiórzana','Update booking'=>'Booking kiórzana goroó','Update event'=>'Ivent kiórzana goroó','Update location'=>'Jaga kiórzana goroó','Update preview'=>'Preview kiórzana goró','Update process has finished.'=>'Kiórzana process sesh hoise.','Update ticket'=>'Ticket kiórzana goroó','Update your address information above to generate a preciese map location.'=>'Thik map Jaga banaibar lagi uppor-ór thíkana Update goró.','Updated'=>'Kiórzana hoijjé','Updates an Events Manager %s.'=>'Ek Events Manager %s kiórzana gore.','Updates an Events Manager booking. The payment gateway cannot be changed after the booking is made: sending a different gateway is rejected, and resending the current one is ignored.'=>'Ek Events Manager booking kiórzana gore. Booking hoóar pore payment gateway bodolaá zai na: onno gateway pathale reject hoé, ekhon ózi ítá phirti pathale ignore hoé.','Updates an Events Manager event.'=>'Ek Events Manager Ivent kiórzana gore.','Updates an Events Manager location.'=>'Ek Events Manager Jaga kiórzana gore.','Updates an Events Manager ticket.'=>'Ek Events Manager ticket kiórzana gore.','Updates and support until %s'=>'%s porzonto Kiórzana ar shahajjo','Upgrade to %s'=>'%s-ot upgrade goró','Upgrade to %s for more options!'=>'Aro opshon\'ór lagi %s\'ót upgrade koró!','Upload Limits'=>'Upload Sími','Upload a file'=>'Ekta file upload goró','Upload a file first.'=>'Age ekta file upload goró.','Upload and match columns'=>'Upload goró ar column milao','Upload media'=>'Midhia upload goroó','Upload the zip under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'Plugins > Noya Ezafágoró Plugin\'or niche zip upload goró, tarpor tar séthín ókkol thi tomar license chalu goró.','Upload/change picture'=>'Chobi Upload/Bodolo goró','Uploaded file type not allowed. Permitted file types are: %s'=>'Uoretulá fail kisím dilé na. Dilé fail kisím: %s','Uploads'=>'Upload óll','Uploads an image (or other media) to the WordPress media library and returns its attachment ID. Accepts a `source_url` to sideload a public image, base64-encoded bytes via `content_base64` + `filename`, or an existing `id` to look up an existing attachment. If a public URL blocks server-side fetches (e.g. Unsplash) use `content_base64` instead. To make the upload an event/location featured image in one call, pass `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; otherwise pass the returned ID as `featured_image` to update-event / update-location, or as `image` to update-category / update-tag. (Note: `post_id` only files the attachment under a post in the library — it does NOT set the featured image.)'=>'WordPress Midhia Laibri-t ek fothú (yá onno midhia) upload gore ar ítár attachment ID ane. Public fothú sideload korar lagi `source_url`, `content_base64` + `filename` diye base64-encoded bytes, yá agó-or attachment dekhanir lagi ek `id` nioó. Zodi public URL server-side fetch block gore (zemon Unsplash), `content_base64` bebohar goroó. Upload-ke ek call-t Ivent/Jaga-or featured fothú banaá lagle `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location` dioó; nahole phirti aá ID update-event / update-location-t `featured_image` hisabe, yá update-category / update-tag-t `image` hisabe dioó. (Nuth: `post_id` khali ek poigam-or ódhin Laibri-t attachment rakhe, ítá featured fothú thik gore na.)','Use 24h Format?'=>'24 góndha Cokól Bebohar Goró?','Use Defaults'=>'Asási Bebohar Goró','Use SMTP authentication?'=>'SMTP authentication estemal koribo?','Use Visual Editor?'=>'Saíbar Edhithar estemal koríba?','Use abbreviations, e.g. Friday = Fri. Useful for certain languages where abbreviations differ from full names.'=>'Abbreviation bebohar goró, zeme Cúkkubar = Cúk. Kichu bhasa\'ot abbreviation pura nam\'r cheye alada hoy, oikkane kaam\'or.','Use dropdown for locations?'=>'Jaga\'r lagi dropdown estemal koríba?','Use international format starting with `+` and a country code, e.g. `+447400123456`.'=>'`+` ar desh code diye shuru kora international cokól bebohar goroó, zemon `+447400123456`.','Use the UI builder below to create and manage additional event types (archetypes).'=>'Aro ivent kisím (archetype) banaite ar cálaite niceor UI builder estemal goró.','Use the buttons below to uninstall Events Manager completely from your system or reset Events Manager to original settings and keep your event data.'=>'Events Manager tuáñr system-ot theke purapuri uninstall gorar lagi yá Events Manager asol séthín ókkol-t reset gori ivent data rakar lagi niceor button ókkol estemal goró.','Used if an excerpt has been defined.'=>'Nuthgoró nirdisto thakile bebohar hoy.','Used if an excerpt has not been defined.'=>'Nuthgoró nirdisto no thakile bebohar hoy.','Used to format each event in a list when previewing a single date in a modal popup.'=>'Modal popup\'ot eke tarík\'r agorisoó dekhaile liís\'ot proti Ivent cokól goróibar lagi bebohar hoy.','Used to show a single event when preview mode is set to %s.'=>'Agorisoó mode %s hoile eke Ivent dekhaibar lagi bebohar hoy.','User Capabilities'=>'Estemalgoróya Kabiliát ókkol','User Fields'=>'Estemalgoróya Field ókkol','User can book'=>'Estemalgoróya booking gorit pare','User can create and edit %s'=>'Estemalgoróya %s banaibar ar sóiyigoribar fare','User can delete %s categories and tags.'=>'Estemalgoróya %s kisím ar hót ókkol haçifélibar fare.','User can delete other users %s'=>'Estemalgoróya onno estemalgoróya ókkol\'or %s haçifélibar fare','User can delete their own %s'=>'Estemalgoróya nijor %s haçifélibar fare','User can edit %s categories and tags.'=>'Estemalgoróya %s kisím ar hót ókkol sóiyigoribar fare.','User can edit other users %s'=>'Estemalgoróya onno estemalgoróya ókkol\'or %s sóiyigoribar fare','User can manage other users individual bookings and event booking settings.'=>'Estemalgoróya onno estemalgoróya\'r alada booking ar ivent booking séthín manejment koribar fare.','User can upload images along with their events and locations.'=>'Estemalgoróya nijor ivent ar jaga\'r sôho fothú upload koribar fare.','User can use and manage bookings with their events.'=>'Estemalgoróya nijor ivent\'or sôho booking estemal ar manejment koribar fare.','User can use other user locations for their events.'=>'Estemalgoróya nijor ivent\'or lagi onno estemalgoróya\'r jaga estemal koribar fare.','User can view private %s'=>'Estemalgoróya háas %s soóibar fare','User must log in'=>'Estemalgoróya-ke bútore gólo gorit hoibo','Username'=>'Estemal goróya\'r nam','Username: %s'=>'Estemalgoróya\'r nam: %s','Users can manage bookings for their events on this page.'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkol ei sófa-t tára Ivent-or booking manage gorí parró.','Users can now use the WordPress editor for easy HTML entry in the submission form.'=>'Estemalgoróya óll ekhon zomá form\'ót shoze HTML dibar lagi WordPress edhithar estemal koría paré.','Users can publish %s and skip any admin approval'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkol %s baáirgoribar fare ar kunu admin approval bardoo koribar fare','Users can view their bookings for other events on this page.'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkol ei sófa-t tára onno Ivent-or booking soó parró.','Users can view, add and edit their %s on this page.'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkol ei sófa-t tára %s soó, ezafágoró ar sóiyigoró parró.','Users will be able to create additional custom event post types on their own sub-sites.'=>'Estemalgoróya ókkol nizor sub-sáith ókkot aro custom ivent post type banaite parbo.','Users with accounts (which would be created by other means when this mode is enabled) will still be able to log in and make bookings linked to their account as normal.'=>'Account thaka estemalgoróya ókkol (zegula ei mode cálu hole onno upaye banano hoibo) ekhono sadharon bhabe bútore gólo gorit ar tahar account-or sathe zukto booking gorit paribo.','Users with the relevant permissions can manage their own events and bookings to these events on the following pages.'=>'Thik permission asé ázé estemalgoróya ókkol nise-or sófa óll-t tára nízor Ivent ar ei Ivent-or booking manage gorí parró.','Value'=>'Mullo','Venue capacity, shared by all tickets that include physical access. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Physical access thaka sob ticket\'or somanor venue\'or khomota. Kono sima na thakle khali rakho.','Venues'=>'Venue','View'=>'Soó','View %s'=>'%s Soó','View As'=>'Hísabe Soó','View Bookings'=>'Booking Soó','View Event'=>'Ivent Soó','View Event Bookings'=>'Ivent Booking Soó','View Location'=>'Jaga Soó','View Range'=>'Soóibor Range','View Timeslot'=>'Timeslot Soó','View Types'=>'Soó Kisím','View all posts in %s'=>'%s\'r beggún poigam soó','View event details'=>'Ivent\'or Details soó','View license'=>'License soó','View/Edit Event'=>'Ivent Soó/Sóiyigoró','Viewing a general WordPress taxonomy page such as %s will show a list of events just like it would regular posts for a regular category or tag. Below you can edit things such as the order events are displayed, or completely override the archive look with our formats feature.'=>'%s moto general WordPress taxonomy sófa soóle regular poigam-or category yá hót-or moto Ivent-or list dekha zaibo. Nise Ivent dekhanir sazón yá cokól feature diye arkaiv-or dekhon puro bodolaí déoa zaibo.','Views'=>'Soó Ókkol','Virtual'=>'Virtual','Virtual Events'=>'Virtual Ivent','Virtual Locations'=>'Virtual Jaga','Virtual Platform'=>'Virtual Platform','Virtual Spaces'=>'Virtual Jaga','Virtual Venue'=>'Virtual Jaga','Virtual and Hybrid Events'=>'Virtual ar Hybrid Ivent','Virtual capacity, shared by all tickets that include virtual access. Leave blank for no limit, or the limit of your virtual platform if it has one.'=>'Virtual access thaka sob ticket\'or somanor virtual khomota. Kono sima na thakle khali rakho, ba tomar virtual platform\'or sima thakle sheta dó.','Virtual events only'=>'Khali virtual ivent','WARNING : Restrict your API key to prevent unauthorized use and quota theft. See our %s page for more information.'=>'SOTORKOTA : Onoanumoditó estemal ar quota curi rukíte tuáñr API key sima koró. Aro tothyo\'r lagi amár %s sófa dekó.','WARNING! This cannot be undone and will overwrite all event timezones, you may want to back up your database first!'=>'WARNING! Ei kaj ager moto kora zai na, ar sob ivent timezone overwrite hoibo, age tuáñr database backup gori rakó!','WARNING! You will delete ALL recurrences of this event, including booking history associated with any event in this recurrence. To keep booking information, go to the relevant single event and save it to detach it from this recurrence series.'=>'SOTORKO! Añí ei Ivent\'or beggún bar bar hoa haçifélaibo, ei bar bar hoa\'ot kono Ivent\'or booking itihas\'o. Booking khobor rakhibar lagi, sombondho thaká ekkar Ivent\'ot zaiyé bórieró, zeta ei bar bar hoa series óttu alada hoibo.','WARNING: This action cannot be undone.'=>'SOTOK: Ei ékcen abbar fisé ana jaibo na.','WARNING: This is a %s.'=>'SOTORKO: Ei ekkún %s.','WARNING: This is a event belonging to the group "%s". Other group admins can also modify this event.'=>'SOTORKO: Ei ivent "%s" gurupót asé. Aar gurup\'r admin\'e ei ivent bodolo gorité fáre.','WARNING: This is a recurrence in a set of repeating events.'=>'SOTORKO: Ei ekkún bar bar hoba ivent\'r set\'r bar bar hoa.','WP FullCalendar'=>'WP FullCalendar','WPML Compatibility'=>'WPML\'r Shoth Mil','Waiting to sync with the provider.'=>'Provider\'or loge sync hoar opeksha.','Waitlist'=>'Waitlist','Waitlist Approved'=>'Waitlist Approved','Waitlist Expired'=>'Waitlist Expired','Want to use the block editor? You can now enable this on your %s page.'=>'Block editor estemal goron cao? Añí ekhon tuáñr %s sófa\'ot ei chalu goron pare.','Warning!'=>'Sotorko!','Warning: Changing the CPT name can have wider implications and may affect any other plugins that specifically work with this custom post type name. Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'Warning: CPT nam bodolale boro asor poribo ar ei custom post type nam-or sathe kam gora onno plugin ókkolor upor asor poribo paré. Tumi ki nicchit aguwa zaibó?','Warning: Changing these values may result in exposing previously hidden information to all users.'=>'Sotok: Ei value bodolaile age lukano information beggún estemalgoróya\'r kacé khule jaibar fare.','We are going to use %s for searching.'=>'Amra tuibar lagi %s estemal goribó.','We collect and store information you submit to us about events (and corresponding locations) you would like to publish on our site.'=>'Tuí amar sáith\'ot baáirgoribar cáo ivent (ar milé jaga) \'r information amra jomai ar rakhi.','We collect and store information you submit to us when making a booking, for the purpose of reserving your requested spaces at our event and maintaining a record of attendance.'=>'Booking koribar somoy tuí jé information dis ségula amra jomai ar rakhi, tuañr cáoa jaga amar ivent\'ot reserve koribar ar hajira\'r record rakhibar lagi.','We could not find a booking matching that reference and email address. Please check both and try again.'=>'Ói reference aar email thíkanar booking amra fái nai. Mehrobani goria duitta soó goria abbar kucícgoró.','We could not find any active bookings for your email address.'=>'Tuáñr email thíkanar honó active booking amra fái nai.','We could not verify that booking. Please start again.'=>'Amra ói booking verify gorité fári nai. Mehrobani goria abar suru goró.','We impose some theme styling rules which help normalize the look of Events Manager accross themes and overrides general theming. This is limited to our components but will prevent your theme from taking over things like fonts, font-sizes, form structures etc. You can also disable strict styling for individual components below.'=>'Amra kisu tehm styling niyom lagai zeta alada alada tehm\'ót Events Manager\'ór dekhon ekrokom rakhíte modot kore ar aám tehm\'ke override kore. Eta khali amár component\'ót sima ar tuáñr tehm\'ke font, font size, form structure ityadi bárai loite dey na. Níce alada alada component\'ór lagi strict styling\'o disable koría paró.','We may use cookies to temporarily store information about a booking in progress as well as any error/confirmation messages whilst submitting or managing your events and locations.'=>'Booking cholté thakibar information ar tuañr ivent ar jaga submit yá manejment koribar somoy kunu error/confirmation message temporary bhabe rakhibar lagi amra cookie estemal koribar fari.','We recommend enabling this feature, as all numbers are stored in the international standard %s. Even if you require national numbers from one country, to ensure compatibility with all phone-related features, otherwise a simple text field is provided for phone input.'=>'Amra ei feature enable koríte cúaric dí, karon beggún number antorzatik miyar %s\'ót rakha zai. Ek desh\'ór national number dorkar oíle\'o, beggún phone-sombondhít feature\'ór sáthe compatible rakhíbar lagi, noile phone input\'ór lagi shoze text field dewa oiba.','We recommend leaving this on unless you are experiencing issues configuring your email.'=>'Tuañr email configure koribar somoy somossa na hoile eita chalu rakhibar cúaric amra dii.','We recommend you back up your database! Once the upgrade is finalized, you cannot downgrade to an earlier version of the plugin. This cannot be undone.'=>'Tuáñr database backup rakhíbó cúaric goijjá! Upgrade finalize hole, plugin-or agó-or varcén-t downgrade gorí parba na. Ítá bodolaí déoa zaibo na.','We strongly recommend you check out our %s before disabling any styling here, in most cases you can make profound changes with a few line of CSS or PHP'=>'Kunu styling disable koríbar aage amár %s dekhíte bahut cúaric dí, beshirbhag khetre kisu line CSS yá PHP diya bohu bodol anna zai','We strongly suggest you back up your database before proceding with this action, it cannot be undone otherwise!'=>'Ei kaj goror age amra DORÓ bhabe sarámorso dói tuáñr database backup gori rakó, nai-le ager moto kora zaibo na!','We use Google services to generate maps and provide autocompletion when searching for events by location, which may collect data via your browser in accordance to Google\'s <a href="%s">privacy policy</a>.'=>'Amra map banaibar ar jaga dhori ivent tuabar somoy autocompletion dibar lagi Google service estemal kori, jita Google\'or <a href="%s">razdari niti</a> onujayi tuañr browser\'or maddome data jomaibar fare.','We will attempt to detect the location of the user based on their browser timezone and auto-select the corresponding country accordingly.'=>'Amra estemalgoróya\'r browser timezone\'ór upor bhitti koría tara jaga khuzíbar chesta koría tar mil asé desh auto-basílo koríba.','We\'re always making improvements, adding features and fixing bugs between releases. We incrementally make these changes in between updates and make it available as a development version. You can download these manually, but we\'ve made it easy for you. <strong>Warning:</strong> Development versions are not always fully tested before release, use wisely!'=>'Amra sobbó somoy bhalo kora, noya feature ezafágoró ar bug thik gorot ase. Ei bodolo ókkol amra relis-or modhye ekkhon ekkhon gori development varcén hisabe dói. Tumi hat dhori download gori paro, kintu amra ou shohoz goriyi. <strong>Warning:</strong> Development varcén relis-or age sob somoy pura test hoy na, bhalo bhabe estemal goró!','Website'=>'Websait','Week %d'=>'Hoptá %d','Weekly'=>'Saptahik','Welcome to Events Manager v6! This latest update includes some major UI improvements, which requires you to update your formats.'=>'Events Manager v6\'ot estekbal! Ei taza update\'ot boró UI bodol asé, zeta\'r lagi tuáñr cokól ókkol kiórzana goron dorkar.','What the file holds'=>'File\'ót ki asé','When'=>'Kun Wokt','When Events Manager displays lists of events the default behavior is ordering by start date in ascending order. To change this, modify the values above.'=>'Events Manager Ivent\'r liís dekhaile asási order oi start tarík ascending. Eke bodolaibar lagi uporór mán ókkol bodolo.','When a booking cannot be made due to an error when filling the form. Below this, there will be a dynamic list of errors.'=>'Form puron gorar somoy error-or karone zokhon booking kora zai na. Er niceo error-or ekta dynamic list thakibo.','When a booking cannot be made due to lack of spaces.'=>'Jaga na thakar karone zokhon booking kora zai na.','When a booking is made by a user, a feedback message is shown depending on the result, which can be customized below.'=>'Estemalgoróya zokhon booking koré, fol onujayi ekta fídhbék message dekhano hoy, zegula niceo customize gora zai.','When a booking is registered and confirmed.'=>'Zokhon ekta booking registered ar confirmed hoy.','When a booking is registered but pending.'=>'Zokhon ekta booking registered kintu pending hoy.','When a guest tries to book using an email registered with a user account.'=>'Zokhon ekta guest estemalgoróya account-ot registered ekta B-ciñçír Thíkana dia booking gorit cay.','When a guest user makes a booking for the first time in Events Manager, a new user account is created for them and they are sent their credentials in a separate email, which can be modified below.'=>'Kuno guest estemalgoróya Events Manager\'ot prothom booking goróle, tar lagi noya estemalgoróya account banáya zay ar tar credential ókkol alada B-ciñçite fatóya zay, zeta niçé bodolano zay.','When a user cancels their booking, this message will be displayed confirming the cancellation.'=>'Estemalgoróya zokhon tahar booking kenselgoró goré, kenselgoró nicchit gorar lagi ei message dekhano hoibo.','When a user chooses to cancel a booking, this warning is displayed for them to confirm.'=>'Estemalgoróya zokhon booking kenselgoró gorit cay, nicchit gorar lagi ei warning dekhano hoy.','When a user modifies a previously published event, it will be put back into pending review status and will not be published until you re-approve it.'=>'Estemalgoróya age publish hoijjá Ivent bodolóle, oi pending review hásiyot\'ot fisé zaibo ar tuñi abar approve no goróle publish no hoibo.','When a user must log in before making a booking.'=>'Zokhon booking gorar age estemalgoróya-ke bútore gólo gorit hoy.','When a user submits their event, you can display a new event form again.'=>'Estemalgoróya Ivent zomá dile ar ekbar noya Ivent form dekhaya zaiba paré.','When an event is cancelled, a general email is sent to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled.'=>'Ivent cancelled hoile, oi cancelled Ivent\'r beggún confirmed ar pending booking\'ke aám B-ciñçí fatóya zaibo.','When creating a new event, this timezone will be applied by default.'=>'Noya Ivent baniya\'r somoy ei timezone asási hisabe lagaiya zaiba.','When creating events, would you like your times to be shown in 24 hour format?'=>'Ivent banáile, tuáñr wokt 24 góndha cokól\'ot dekháno cao?','When displaying embedded maps for a location, choose what information Google will use to generate a map from, each producing varying results.'=>'Jaga\'r lagi embedded nokśa dekhaiya\'r somoy Google kon tothyo diya nokśa baniba basílo koró, pratek ek ek ful dey.','When displaying global %s on the main site you have the option of users viewing the %s details on the main site or being directed to the sub-site.'=>'Main sáith\'ot global %s dahabar somoy estemalgoróya ókkol main sáith\'ot %s details soóibo yá sub-site\'ot jaibo ségula tuí basílibar fare.','When displaying ticket prices and booking totals, include the tax automatically?'=>'Ticket price ar booking total dekhanor somoy tax auto ezafágoró goribó?','When enabled, phone number fields will include special international (or national) formatting and validation.'=>'Enable oíle phone number field\'ót bishesh antorzatik (yá national) cokól ar yacai thakiba.','When enabled, the mobile app can register devices and receive push notifications. Turning this off stops all outgoing pushes and hides the notification options in the app for this site.'=>'Enable oíle mobile app device rejicthorgoró ar push notification paré. Disable koríle beggún bahir\'ot push bon oiba ar ei sáith\'ór lagi app\'ót notification opshon luwa zaiba.','When enabled, users can custom-order their tickets using drag and drop. If enabled, saved ordering supercedes the default ticket ordering below.'=>'Cálu thakile, estemalgoróya ókkol drag and drop dia tahar ticket ókkol custom-order gorit paribo. Cálu thakile, bórieragiyé ordering niceor asási ticket ordering-ke ovitikkrom goré.','When listing categories, this order is applied.'=>'Category list korar belá ei sazón lagibo.','When listing event archives for a %s, this order is applied.'=>'%s-or Ivent arkaiv list korar belá ei sazón lagibo.','When listing tags, this order is applied.'=>'Hót list korar belá ei sazón lagibo.','When no tickets are selected, this text will appear in place of a booking summary, prompting users to select a ticket.'=>'Kono ticket basílo na hole, estemalgoróya-ke ekta ticket basílo gorar kotha koiyé booking summary-r jaiga-t ei leká dekha zaibo.','When selecting tickets on a booking form, the price will dynamically be broken down in a summary before the booking confirmation button.'=>'Booking form-t ticket basílo gorar somoy, booking confirmation button-or age price ekta summary-t dynamic bhabe bhag hoi dekhano hoibo.','When submitting events, you can choose to use a single date picker for start/end dates, or separate fields for each date.'=>'Ivent submit goróle, start/end tarík\'r lagi eke tarík picker yá proti tarík\'r lagi alada field bebohar goróno zay.','When the booking is cancelled, the cancellation status email can also be sent independently of a general event cancellation notification.'=>'Booking kenselgoró oíle aam Ivent kenselgoró notification\'ór alada kenselgoró hásiyot email\'o pathaya zaiba paré.','When the size of the %s is less than %s, the search fields and buttons in the main bar can either remain on one line and resize accordingly, or break into multiple lines. If you want to keep all your search terms options, multiple lines will look better as they will look squashed on smaller screens and provide a worse search exprience. You can also hide individual search fields in settings further down to reduce screen clutter as the search from shrinks.'=>'%s\'r maf %s\'ore kom hoile, main bar\'r tua field ar button ókkol eke lainot thaki maf onuzayi chuto hoite paré, yá zeyada lainot bhagoi zaibo. Zodi tuñi beggún tua option rakibar cao, zeyada lain bhalo dekhaibo, karon chuto screen\'ot choto dekhaibo ar tua obhigota kharab hoibo. Tua form choto hoile niçór séthín\'ot alada alada tua field luwai screen\'r bhir komaibar paro.','When the size of the %s is less than %s, this field can be hidden on the main search form to save viewing space. You can still enable this field to show in advanced search settings.'=>'%s\'r maf %s\'ore kom hoile, jaga bacaibar lagi ei field main tua form\'ot luwa zay. Torkigoijjá tua séthín\'ot ei field enable goriya dekháno zay.','When you save this %s, all recurrences of this set will be deleted. Would you like to proceed?'=>'Tuñí ei %s bórieró goriló, ei set\'r beggún bar bar hoa haçifélo hóibo. Tuñí cólibó cái?','Where'=>'Kotá','Whether this ticket lets attendees attend physically, virtually, or both, on a hybrid event.'=>'Hybrid ivent\'ót ei ticket attendee ókkolke physical, virtual ba duitaté attend gorté dey ki na.','Why'=>'Kiyó','Will be imported'=>'Import hoibo','Will be skipped'=>'Sharia dewa hoibo','With the %s placeholder, the below texts will be used.'=>'%s placeholder-or sathe, niceor leká ókkol estemal hoibo.','Withdrawal page'=>'Withdrawal sófa','Withdrawal period (days)'=>'Withdrawal somoy (din)','Withdrawal policy / instructions'=>'Withdrawal policy / nirdesh','Withdrawal received for booking #%d'=>'Booking #%d\'r lagi withdrawal fawa gelo','Within'=>'Moddhe','Within the network admin area, only network-specific settings will be exported or imported. For individual site settings please visit the relevant site within your network.'=>'Network admin ilakar bitore khali network-or nizor séthín ókkol export yá import hoibo. Alada sáith séthín ókkolor lagi doya gori tuáñr network-or oi sáith-t zao.','WooCommerce sold separately on Woo.com'=>'WooCommerce Woo.com-ot alada bikri hoy','WooCommerce ticket orders become'=>'WooCommerce ticket order óll hoibo','WordPress %s Archives'=>'WordPress %s Arkaiv ókkol','Work it out from the file'=>'File thi bujhi nó','Would you like to allow users to submit bookings anonymously? If so, you can use the new [event_form] shortcode or <code>em_event_form()</code> template tag with this enabled.'=>'Estemalgoróya óll namsárabhabe Booking koríte dibá? Dile enable oíle noya [event_form] shortcode yá <code>em_event_form()</code> template tag estemal koría paró.','Yearly'=>'Bosori','Yes'=>'Ói','Yesterday'=>'Gotokalle','You <strong>must</strong> have assigned a %s page in your <a href="%s">main blog settings</a> for this to work.'=>'Ei kam koribar lagi tuañr <a href="%s">main blog séthín</a>\'ot ekta %s sófa assign koribo <strong>lagibo</strong>.','You already have booked a seat at this event.'=>'Añí agót ei Ivent\'ot Jaga booking goijjó.','You are adding unavailable dates.'=>'Tuí moujut na hoa tarík ezafágorér.','You are currently attending this event.'=>'Añí ekhon ei Ivent\'ot asó.','You are currently viewing options for an archetype. These can override the default options with the follwoing available options.'=>'Tuí hála ekta archetype\'or option soóyós. Ei sob default option override koribar fare nicé\'r option diye.','You are currently viewing your public page, this is what other users will see.'=>'Tuñi ekhon tuáñr aám sófa soóró, onno estemalgoróya ókkol ei dekhíbó.','You are in Events Manager debug mode. To turn debug mode off, go to the <a href="%s">settings</a> page.'=>'Añí Events Manager debug mode\'ot asó. Debug mode bon goróbar lagi <a href="%s">séthín ókkol</a> sófa\'ot zao.','You are successfully connected to the following %s account:'=>'Tuñí nise\'r %s account\'ót thikmoto connected asó:','You are switching location type, if you update this event your event previous location data will be deleted.'=>'Tuí Jaga-ór Kisím bodolorér, ei Ivent Update goríle agor Jaga-ór data Haçifélá zaibó.','You are trying to book a non-existent ticket for this event.'=>'Tuñí ei ivent\'r lagi nái ticket booking gorité cáiré.','You are viewing individual recurrences of %s.'=>'Tuñí %s\'r alada bar bar hoa dekhíre.','You can add private notes below for internal reference that only event managers will see.'=>'Tuí nicé niji nuth lekhibar fare jita khali ivent manager ókkol soóibo, bítore\'r reference\'or lagi.','You can add styles to your maps to give them a unique look. Build one using the %s or choose from the many free templates on %s paste the generated JSON code here.'=>'Tuáñr nokśa\'ke alada dekhaya ecthail ezafá koría paró. %s diya ek baniyó yá %s\'ót beshú free nomuna\'r moddhe óttu basílo koró ar baniya kora JSON kudh etháne lagaido.','You can allow different location types which can be assigned to an event. For more information see our %s.'=>'Ivent\'ór lagi alada alada Jaga kisím anumoti dia paró. Aro tothyo\'r lagi amár %s dekó.','You can allow users to publicly submit events on your blog by using the %s shortcode, and enabling anonymous submissions below.'=>'%s shortcode estemal koría ar níce namsára zomá enable koría tuáñr blog\'ót estemalgoróya óll sobar sámne Ivent zomá dite paré.','You can also %s into a single recurring event.'=>'Tuñí %s ekkún bar bar hoba ivent\'ot bodolo gorité fáro.','You can also add event attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_ATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on event pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'Etháne Ivent attribute ezafágoró paró, pratek line\'ót ek ek, ei cokól\'ót <code>#_ATT{key}</code>. Níce\'r kunu nomuna\'ót dhaló na koríle ei ókkol Ivent sófa\'ót dekha zaiba na, kintu onno kam\'ór lagi Ivent\'ór aro tothyo rakhíte paró. <a href=\'%s\'>Placeholder\'r baabote aro tothyo.</a>','You can also add location attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_LATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on location pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'Etháne Jaga attribute ezafágoró paró, pratek line\'ót ek ek, ei cokól\'ót <code>#_LATT{key}</code>. Níce\'r kunu nomuna\'ót dhaló na koríle ei ókkol Jaga sófa\'ót dekha zaiba na, kintu onno kam\'ór lagi Ivent\'ór aro tothyo rakhíte paró. <a href=\'%s\'>Placeholder\'r baabote aro tothyo.</a>','You can also request specific consent from your users to be contacted via supplied communication options (Email, Phone, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Telegram etc.), this can be separate to your privacy policy, given that this relates to consenting to non-essential communication such as marketing or non-email-based reminders.'=>'Tuñi estemalgoróya ókkol-or kaché supplied communication option (B-ciñçí, Phone, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Telegram etc.) diye zogazog gorár lagi nirdisto consent paó caí parró. Ítá tuáñr privacy policy-r thaki alada hoí parró, kerén ei marketing yá email-ni reminder moto jorurí nai zogazog-or consent-or kotha.','You can also reset all events of a blog to a new timezone in %s'=>'Añí %s\'ot bologsáith\'or beggún Ivent noya timezone\'ot reset goron pare','You can change the permalink structure of your events, locations, categories and tags here. Be aware that you may want to set up redirects if you change your permalink structures to maintain SEO rankings.'=>'Etháne tuáñr Ivent, Jaga, Kisím ar Hót\'ór permalink structure bodolo koría paró. Khetal rakó, permalink structure bodolíle SEO ranking rakhíbar lagi redirect thik koríte oiba paré.','You can choose to show a popup modal or inline under the main search bar triggered by an icon on the main search bar.'=>'Main tua bar\'r icon click goróle popup modal yá main tua bar\'r niçé inline dekháibar basílo goróno zay.','You can choose whether or not to show unavailable tickets to visitors.'=>'Moujut nai ticket ókkol visitor ókkolke dekhaibó ki na tumi basílo gorit paro.','You can create more than one "type" of event, which can have its own admin section, URL structure, calendar and formatting. For example, you may have events, appointments, and workshops all running under the Events Manager engine!'=>'Tumi ekta-or beshi "kisím"-or ivent banaite paro, zegulor nizor admin ilaka, URL structure, kelendhar ar cokól thakibo. Zemon, tuáñr ivent, appointment ar workshop sob Events Manager engine-ot cólibo!','You can disable ALL styling altogether by setting this to \'no\'. By doing so, nothing will be styled, AT ALL, by Events Manager in the front-end. Basically, it\'s up to you and your theme!'=>'Ei \'no\' koríle beggún styling ekdom disable koría paró. Eta koríle front-end\'ót Events Manager kisui style koríba na. Moldhote, eta tuáñr ar tuáñr tehm\'ór upor!','You can disable this email by leaving the subject blank.'=>'Subject khali rakhi tumi ei email bongoró gorit paro.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with a %s to prevent getting overwritten.'=>'Tuñí alada bar bar hoa sóiyigorité fáro aar %s\'ór tára ódhá goróté fáro zate mocé nó zai.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this %s.'=>'Tuñí alada bar bar hoa sóiyigorité fáro aar ei %s\'ór tára ódhá goróté fáro.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this recurring event.'=>'Añí alada alada bar bar hoa sóiyigoron pare ar ei bar bar hoba Ivent\'or logé sombondho kati dió pare.','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this repeating event.'=>'Tuñí alada bar bar hoa sóiyigorité fáro aar ei bar bar hoba ivent\'ór tára ódhá goróté fáro.','You can have single or multiple tickets, where certain tickets become available under certain conditions, e.g. early bookings, group discounts, maximum bookings per ticket, etc.'=>'Tuí ek yá bóut Ticket rakkibá, zéttát kunu Ticket kunu shortot moujut hoibó, zeman agor Booking, gróp Discount, Ticket-ór pisé zíyada Booking, ittadi.','You can hide or leave the consent box checked for registered users who have provided consent previously.'=>'Agó consent déoa registered estemalgoróya-r lagi tuñi consent box luwaí yá check kore rakhí parró.','You can join from %s.'=>'Tumi %s thi join gorté paro.','You can log into our site here : %s'=>'Añí ekhane amar sáith\'ot bútore gólo goron pare : %s','You can now give fine grained control with regards to what your users can do with events. Each user role can have perform different sets of actions.'=>'Tuí hála tuañr estemalgoróya ókkol ivent loi ki kori faribo ségula sukkho bhabe control koribar fare. Prottek estemalgoróya\'r rul alada alada ékcen kori faribo.','You can only convert a repeating %s'=>'Tuñí khali bar bar hoba %s bodolo gorité fáro','You can reset your events to a new timezone and also complete the final migration step by deleting unecessary data in %s'=>'Añí Tuáñr Ivent noya timezone\'ot reset goron pare ar %s\'ot dorkar nai data haçifélaiye sesh migration step\'o sesh goron pare','You can use Google Maps to show where your events are located. For more information on using maps, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a>.'=>'Tuáñr Ivent kózát asé tá dekhaiyar lagi Google Maps estemal koría paró. Nokśa estemal\'ór baabote ar tothyo\'r lagi <a href="%s">amár habosfonna dekó</a>.','You can view your event here:'=>'Añí tuáñr Ivent ekhane dékon pare:','You cannot RSVP to this booking with %s'=>'Añí %s dorí ei booking\'ot RSVP goron na pare','You cannot book more than %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'Tuñí ticket %2$s\'r lagi %1$d jagat beci booking gorité fáribó ná.','You cannot book more than %d spaces for this event.'=>'Añí ei Ivent\'or lagi %d Jaga\'r beci booking goron na pare.','You cannot change the CPT type of %s to %s. This custom post type already exists.'=>'Tuñi %s-or CPT kisim %s-t bodolaí parba na. Ei custom post type agó-t asé.','You cannot delete a ticket that has a booking on it.'=>'Booking asé ticket tuñí haçifélité fáribó ná.','You cannot delete tickets if there are any bookings associated with them. Please delete these bookings first.'=>'Honó booking asilé ticket haçifélité fáribó ná. Mehrobani goria agei ei booking ókkol haçifélo goró.','You cannot edit saved locations here.'=>'Tuí ouddá Bórieragiyé Jaga Sóiyigoritte faribá na.','You cannot manage this %s.'=>'Tuñi ei %s manage gorí parba na.','You cannot read private %s'=>'Añí háas %s poron na pare','You cannot view others %s'=>'Añí ókkor %s dékon na pare','You do not have any bookings.'=>'Tuár kunu Booking noi.','You do not have permission to attach media to that post.'=>'Ei poigam-t midhia attach gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to change this booking status.'=>'Ei booking-or hásiyot bodolaár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to create bookings through the API.'=>'API diye booking banaár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to create/edit %s.'=>'%s baná/sóiyigorór onumoti tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to delete %s'=>'Añár %s haçifélobar ijajot nai','You do not have permission to delete event terms.'=>'Ivent term haçifélo gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to delete others %s'=>'Añár ókkor %s haçifélobar ijajot nai','You do not have permission to delete this booking.'=>'Ei booking haçifélo gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to delete this event.'=>'Ei Ivent haçifélo gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to delete this location.'=>'Ei Jaga haçifélo gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to delete this ticket.'=>'Ei ticket haçifélo gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to do that.'=>'Ei kam gorar onumoti tomar nai.','You do not have permission to edit %s'=>'Añár %s sóiyigoróbar ijajot nai','You do not have permission to edit others %s'=>'Añár ókkor %s sóiyigoróbar ijajot nai','You do not have permission to edit that event, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Ei Ivent sóiyigoróár permission tuáñr nái, tai upload kora fothú ítár featured fothú hisabe thik hoí nái.','You do not have permission to edit that location, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'Ei Jaga sóiyigoróár permission tuáñr nái, tai upload kora fothú ítár featured fothú hisabe thik hoí nái.','You do not have permission to edit this attachment.'=>'Ei attachment sóiyigoróár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to edit this event.'=>'Ei Ivent sóiyigorón lagi añár ijajot nai.','You do not have permission to manage %s'=>'Añár %s chalaibar ijajot nai','You do not have permission to manage event terms.'=>'Ivent term manage gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to manage others %s'=>'Añár ókkor %s chalaibar ijajot nai','You do not have permission to manage this booking.'=>'Ei Booking sambalóár lagi Tuáñr onumoti nai.','You do not have permission to manage tickets for this event.'=>'Ei Ivent-or ticket manage gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to migrate data.'=>'Data migrate gorar onumoti tomar nai.','You do not have permission to publish %s'=>'Añár %s baáirgoróbar ijajot nai','You do not have permission to save this booking.'=>'Ei booking save gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to save this event.'=>'Ei Ivent save gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to save this location.'=>'Ei Jaga save gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to send a test email, or this page has expired. Please reload the settings page and try again.'=>'Test email fatibar ejazot tuañr nai, yá ei sófa\'r somoy sesh hoi gesé. Dua kori séthín sófa abbar load kori abbar kucícgoró.','You do not have permission to update this ticket.'=>'Ei ticket kiórzana gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to upload images'=>'Añár fothú uoretulibar ijajot nai','You do not have permission to upload media.'=>'Midhia upload gorár permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to view this booking.'=>'Ei booking soóar permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to view this event.'=>'Ei Ivent soóar permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to view this location.'=>'Ei Jaga soóar permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have permission to view this ticket.'=>'Ei ticket soóar permission tuáñr nái.','You do not have the rights to manage this %s.'=>'Añár ei %s chalaibar ijajot nai.','You do not have the rights to manage this event.'=>'Ei ivent manejment koribar adhikar tuañr nai.','You do not have the rights to manage this ticket.'=>'Ei ticket manejment koribar adhikar tuañr nai.','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Events Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'Tuáñr Events Manager nomuna séthín ókkol\'ot kono háaic attribute thík goijjá nai. <a href=\'%s\'>séthín ókkol sófa</a>\'ot ezafágoró','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Locations Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'Tuár Locations Manager template Séthín ókkol-ót kunu custom attribute banano noi. Doya kori <a href=\'%s\'>Séthín ókkol sófa</a>-ót ezafágoró','You have %s confirmed bookings'=>'Tuáñr %s confirmed booking asé','You have %s pending bookings'=>'Tuáñr %s pending booking asé','You have a confirmed booking'=>'Tuáñr ek confirmed booking asé','You have a pending booking'=>'Tuáñr ek pending booking asé','You have chosen to add or edit your current unavailable dates for all recurrences. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Tuí beggún bar bar hoa-ór lagi tuár zoriya moujut na hoa tarík ezafágoror yá sóiyigoror basón goijjó. Hushiyar hoi ei sotorkota fórió!','You have chosen to edit your %s times. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Tuí tuár %s somoy sóiyigoror basón goijjó. Hushiyar hoi ei sotorkota fórió!','You have chosen to edit your recurrence date ranges. If you shorten the date range, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be cancelled or deleted.'=>'Tuñí tuáñr bar bar hoa\'r tarík sima sóiyigorór bachi nichó. Zodi tarík sima kom goró, noya sima\'r baire bar bar hoa ókkol kenselgoróya yá haçifélo hóibo.','You have chosen to edit your recurrence date ranges. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'Tuí bar bar hoa-ór tarík hodd sóiyigoror basón goijjó. Hushiyar hoi ei sotorkota fórió!','You have confirmed your attendance.'=>'Tuñí hájir hoba\'r kotha confirm goijjó.','You have currently disabled %s'=>'Tuñi ekhon %s disable goriccó','You have currently enabled %s'=>'Tuñi ekhon %s enable goriccó','You have declined your attendance, your booking is now cancelled.'=>'Tuñí hájir hoba\'r fosondó nái bolijjó, Tuáñr Booking ekhon kenselgoróya gelo.','You have declined your attendance.'=>'Tuñí hájir hoba\'r fosondó nái bolijjó.','You have not defined a date range long enough to create a recurrence.'=>'Bar bar hoa baná gorór lagi tuñí fugor lomba tarík\'r somoy dió nái.','You have not definitively confrimed your attendance.'=>'Tuñí hájir hoba\'r kotha fakka confirm gorór nái.','You have successfully created an account at %s'=>'Añí %s\'ot akaunt banaiyó','You have successfully disconnected from your %s account.'=>'Tuí %s account tuwa hoshiyar dhorot disconnect goijjó.','You have successfully finalized upgrading your site.'=>'Tuáñr sáith upgrade bhalo kore finalize goríse.','You have successfully migrated to Events Manager v6 formatting! We hope you enjoy the changes. In case you had some special formatting you realize you needed, there\'s the undo option below, it will reset all your migrated formats to how they were previoiusly. You can migrate again or individuall migrate each option within the settings page.'=>'Tuí Events Manager v6 formatting-ót sofolbabe migrate goijjó! Amra asha kori bodol ókkol tuár bhala lagibó. Kunu special formatting zoruri hoile, nićé Wapesgoró option asé, ei tuár migrate kora beggún format agor moton Reset goribó. Tuí abbar migrate gorité fare yá séthín ókkol sófa-ór moddhe alada kori prottek option migrate gorité fare.','You have successfully submitted your event, which will be published pending approval.'=>'Añí Ivent submit goijjó, manjuri\'r baade baáirgoijjá hoibo.','You have successfully updated to Events Manager %s'=>'Añí Events Manager %s\'ot kiórzana goijjó','You have successfully updated your event, which will be republished pending approval.'=>'Añí Ivent kiórzana goijjó, manjuri\'r baade abbar baáirgoijjá hoibo.','You must allow us to collect and store your data in order for us to process your booking.'=>'Tuáñr booking process gorár lagi tuñi amáre tuáñr data collect ar store gorár ózazot dioó lagibo.','You must be logged in to view bookings.'=>'Booking soóar lagi tuáñr login goroó lagibo.','You must book at least %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'Tuáñre ticket %2$s\'r lagi komésom %1$d jaga booking gorité lagibó.','You must check the box allowing us to communicate with you via your provided contact methods.'=>'Añár dilé konték pothot amar logé zogazog goróbar ijajot dibar lagi box\'ot tik dió.','You must log in or register to make a booking.'=>'Booking goróbar lagi bútore gólo yá rejicthor goró.','You must log in to cancel your booking.'=>'Booking kenselgorón lagi bútore gólo.','You must log in to view and manage your bookings.'=>'Tuáñr booking dékibar ar chalaibar lagi bútore gólo.','You must log in to view and manage your events.'=>'Tuáñr Ivent dékibar ar chalaibar lagi bútore gólo.','You must log in to view and manage y